<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">Exodus</book>
  <para style="h">Exodus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Exodus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Exodus</para>
  <para style="mt">Exodus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêng hi Israela fapa Aigupta rama lûtte hming chu a ni; mi tin mahni chhûngte ṭheuh nên Jakoba hnênah chuan an kal a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Reubena te, Simeona te, Levia leh Juda te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isakara te, Jebuluna leh Benjamina te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dana te, Naphtalia te, Gada leh Asera te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jakoba ṭhâlbea chhuak zawng zawngte chu mi sawmsarih an ni; Josefa zawng Aigupta ramah chuan lo awm tawh sa rêng a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Josefa leh a unaute zawng zawng leh chûng chhuanho zawng zawngte chu an thi ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan chi tam tak an thlah a, nasa takin an lo pung a, an lo tam ta êm êm mai a, an lo chak ta telh telh a; tin, chu ramah chuan an lo khat ta mup mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ramah chuan Josefa hre lo, lal thar a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, a mite hnênah, “Ngai teh u, Israela thlahte hi kan aiin an tamin an chak tâk zâwk hi le;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hawh u, anmahni hi tihhnathiamin i ti ang u; chuti lo chuan, an lo pung zêl ang a, nakinah indonate a lo awm hian, kan hmêlmate lamah an pakai ve hlauh ang a, min bei ang a, he ram aṭang hian an tlân chhuak hlauh dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, an phurrita tirethei tûrin an chungah hnathawk vêngtute an ruat ta a. Tichuan, Pharaoa tân bungraw dah khâwmna tûr Pithom leh Rameses khuate an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, anmahni chu an tihretheih nasat poh leh an pung nasa deuh deuh va, an darh zau ta deuh deuh va. Tin, Israela thlahte avâng chuan Aigupta-ho chu an lungngai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite chuan Israela thlahte chu rim takin an thawhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnathawh hautak tak, lung chârna leh leirawhchante siamtîr leh lovah hna tinrêngte hrehawm taka thawhtîrin an chhawr vak vak a; an thawhna zawng zawngah chuan rim takin an chhawr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta lal chuan Hebrai nau chhar mite chu a bia a, chu mite chu pakhata hming Siphraii a ni a; tin, pakhata hming chu Puaii a ni a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />an hnênah chuan, “Hebrai hmeichhiate nau hrinna hmuna nau in chhar hunin, mipa fa a nih chuan tihlum zêl ang che u; hmeichhia a nih erawh chuan zuah tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, nau chhar mite chuan Pathian an ṭih a; tichuan, Aigupta lal thupêk ang chuan an ti duh lo va, mipa fate chu an humhim ta zêl zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta lal chuan nau chhar mite chu a kohtîr a, an hnênah chuan, “Engati nge hetianga thil in tiha, mipa fate chu in humhim zêl le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, nau chhar mite chuan Pharaoa hnênah, “Hebrai hmeichhiate hi Aigupta hmeichhiate ang an nih ve loh vâng a ni; anniho hi zawngin an sam êm bik a; tichuan, nau chhartu lo thlen hma hian an lo hring tawh ṭhîn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathianin nau chhar mite chu a tiṭha ta hle a; tichuan, mite chu an lo tam ta hle a, an lo chak ta telh telh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, nau chhar miten Pathian an ṭih avângin chhûngkua neiin a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoan, “Mipa lo piang apiang chu luiah in paih ang a; tin, hmeichhia apiang chu in humhim zêl tûr a ni,” tiin, a mite zawng zawng chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat, Levia chhûngte zînga mi a va chhuak a, Levia fanu nupuiah a va nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chu a rai a, fapa a hring a; tin, ani chuan nautê chu hmêl ṭha a ti êm a, thla thum a thukru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a lo thukru reng thei ta lo va, a tân luang lawng a la a, chu chu chirh leh alkatrain a châr a, nautê chu chutah chuan a muttîr a; tichuan, lui kama phairuang zîngah chuan a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a chungah eng tak la thleng ang maw tia hriat tumin a farnu chu hla feah a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa fanu chu luia inbual tûrin a zu kal a; tin, a bâwihnute chu lui kamah chuan an kal ve a; tin, phairuang zînga bâwm a han hmuh chuan a bâwihnu a va lâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a han hawn chuan nautê chu a hmu ta a; tin, ngai teh, nausên chu a ṭap ta a. Tin, a khawngaih ta êm êm a, “Hei Hebrai fa a nih hi le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, a farnu chuan Pharaoa fanu hnênah chuan, “He naute awmsaktu tûr che Hebrai hmeichhia nau awmtu ka kohsak ang che chu?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa fanu chuan a hnênah, “Kal rawh,” a ti a. Tin, nula chu a kal a, chu nausên nu chu a va ko ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa fanu chuan a hnênah, “He nautê hi kalpui ta la, mi awmsak ang che; tichuan, i hlawh ka pe ang che,” a ti a. Chutichuan, hmeichhia chuan nautê chu a la a, a pawm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, nautê chu a lo ṭhang lian a, Pharaoa fanu hnênah a hruai a; tichuan, a fapaah a awm ta a. Tin, “Tui ata ka lâk chhuah avângin,” a ti a, a hmingah chuan Mosia a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng laia Mosia a lo puitlin chuan, a unaute a va kan a, an phurritte chu a va hmu a. Tin, Aigupta mi pakhat hian a unau pakhat Hebrai mi hi a vaw lai a han hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu a hawi vêl ruai a; tin, tu mah an awm lo tih a hriat veleh Aigupta mi chu a vaw hlum a, leiah a phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah a va chhuak leh a, ngai teh, Hebrai mi pahnih an lo insual a; tin, a thiam lo zâwka hnênah chuan, “Engati nge i ṭhian i vuak le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Kan chungah hotuah leh rorêltuah tuin nge siam che? Aigupta mi i tihhlum ang khân mi tihhlum i tum elo?” a ti a. Tin, Mosia chuan a hlau ta a, “An hre ta ngei zuk nia le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Pharaoan chu chu a lo hriat veleh Mosia chu thah a tum ta a. Nimahsela, Mosia chu Pharaoa hnên ata a tlân bo va, Midian ramah a awm ta a; tin, tuichhunchhuah sîrah hian a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Midian rama puithiam chuan fanu pasarih a nei a. Tin, anni chuan tui an rawn chawi a, an pa berâm rual in tûrin tui inna thlêngte chu an tikhat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, berâm vêngtute an lo kal a, an rawn hnawt darh a; nimahsela, Mosia chu a tho va, anmahni chu a rawn ṭanpui a, an berâm rual chu tui a intîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, an pa Reuela hnên an va thlenin ani chuan, “Engtizia nge vawiin chu in va lo haw hma ve le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Aigupta mi pakhatin berâm vêngtute lak ata min chhan him a ni; tin, chu chang ni lovin, tui te min thâlsak a, berâm rual chu tui a intîr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a fanute hnênah chuan, “Chu, khawiah nge a awm le? Engtizia nge in rawn hâwnsan mai ni le? Va ko ta che u, chaw te rawn ei ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan chu mi hnêna awm chu rem a ti a; tin, a fanu Zipori chu Mosia a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Zipori chuan fapa a hring a; tin, Mosian a hmingah Gersoma a sa a; “Mi rama pêm ka nih avângin,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ni rei fe chinah chuan Aigupta lal chu a thi ta a. Tin, Israela thlahte chu an hnathawh hautak avâng chuan an rûm a; tin, an au va; tichuan, an hnathawh hautak avânga an au thâwm chuan Pathian hnên a han thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin an rûm chu a hria a; tin, Pathianin Abrahama te, Isaaka te leh Jakoba te hnêna a thuthlun kha a hre reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Pathian chuan Israela thlahte chu a thlîr reng a; tichuan, Pathian chuan anmahni chu a zuk ngaihsak reng bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan a pu Jethroa, Midian ram puithiam berâm rual a vêng a; tin, berâm rual chu thlalêr thlang lampangah chuan a khalh a; tin, Pathian tlâng, Horeb chu a va thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, hnim bukah Lalpa vântirhkoh hi mei alhin a hnênah a rawn inlâr a. Tin, a han en a, ngai teh, hnim buk chu meiin a kâng a, a hnim buka erawh chu a kâng ral si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan, “Ka va pêng teh rêng ang, eng tizia nge ni hnim buk saw a kan ral loh, he thilmak tak hi ka va en teh ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan en tûra a va pêng chu a hmuhin, Pathianin hnim buk aṭang chuan a han ko va, “Mosi, Mosi,” a han ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Heta hi ka awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Pathian chuan, “Rawn hnaih suh khai. I kephah ata i pheikhawkte kha phelh rawh, i dinna hmun kha lei thianghlim a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, “Kei hi i pa Pathian, Abrahama Pathian, Isaaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian chu ka nih hi,” a ti leh a. Tin, Mosia chuan a hmai a khuh ta a; Pathian a en ngam si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Aigupta rama ka mi awmte chu an hrehawmzia ka hmu reng asin, anmahni vêngtute avânga an au thâwmte chu ka lo hria a, an lungngaihnate chu ka hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Aigupta-ho lak ata chhan him tûr leh chumi ram ata chu hruai chhuaka, Kanaan-hote, Hit-hote, Amor-hote, Periz-hote, Hiv-hote, Jebus-hote awmna ram ṭha tak leh zau tak, hnute tui leh khawizu luanna rama hruai lût tûrin ka lo chhuk ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Israela thlahte au thâwm chu ka hnên a lo thleng e; chu chang a ni lo va, Aigupta-hovin anmahni an hnehchhiahziate chu ka hmu reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, hawh teh, ka mi Israela thlahte chu Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuak tûrin Pharaoa hnênah ka tîr ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Pathian hnênah, “Kei Pharaoa hnêna kala, Israela thlahte Aigupta ram ata zuk hruai chhuaktu atân chuan tu nge maw ka nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “I hnênah ka awm dâwn alâwm; tichuan, keima tirh ngei i ni tih hei hi i tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang: Aigupta ram ata mite chu i rawn hruai chhuah hunah chuan, he tlâng ngeiah hian Pathian rawng in la bâwl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Pathian hnênah, “Ngai teh, Israela thlahte hnênah chuan zuk kalin an hnênah, ‘In thlahtute Pathianin in hnênah hian mi rawn tîr a ni e,’ zuk ti ila; tin, anni chuan ka hnênah, ‘Tu nge ni a hming chu?’ lo ti ang sela, an hnênah chuan engtin nge ka sawi ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Mosia hnênah, “AWMA KA NI, nangin Israela thlahte hnênah chuan, ‘AWMA chuan in hnênah mi rawn tîr a ni e,’ i ti tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Pathian vêkin Mosia hnênah chuan, “Nangin Israela thlahte hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa , in thlahtute Pathian, Abrahama Pathian, Isaaka Pathian leh Jakoba Pathian chuan in hnênah hian mi rawn tîr a ni e. Hei hi kumkhuaa ka hming chu a ni a; tin, hei hi chhuan zawng zawng thlenga mi hriat rengna chu a ni,’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kal langin, Israel upaho ko khâwm ang che; tichuan, an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa , in thlahtute Pathian, Abrahama Pathian, Isaaka Pathian leh Jakoba Pathian chuan ka rawn kan ta ngei che u a, Aigupta rama in chunga an tih zia te hi ka hmu ta ngei mai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta rama tihhrehawmna lak ata chu ka hruai chhuak ang che u a, Kanaan-hote, Hit-hote, Amor-hote, Periz-hote, Hiv-hote, Jebus-hote ram, hnute tui leh khawizu luanna ramah chuan ka hruai lût ang che u ka tih tawh kha, tiin ka hnênah a rawn inlâr ta a ni,’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, i thu an lo ngaithla ang; tin, nang leh Israel upaho chu Aigupta lal hnênah in kal ang a; tin, a hnênah, ‘ Lalpa , Hebraite Pathianin min rawn tlawh ta mai a; chuvângin, thlalêr ni thum kalah Lalpa kan Pathian hnêna kan va inthawi theihna tûrin khawngaih takin min kaltîr ang che,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta lal zawngin kut chak tak ngawt lo chuan a chhuahtîr hlei lo vang che u tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ka kut ka phar ang a; tin, Aigupta-ho chu an zînga thilmak tak ka la tih tûr zawng zawngte chuan ka la hrem ang a; tin, chumi hnuah zawng a chhuahtîr tawh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, hêng mite hi Aigupta-ho ka khawngaihtîr ang a; tin, heti hi a ni ang a, in kal hunah chuan ruakin in kal lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />hmeichhe tinin an vêngte leh an ina chêngte chu tangkaraw incheinate leh, rangkachak incheinate leh, silhfênte an la dîl zâwk ang a; tichuan, in fapate leh in fanute chu in la bel ang; tin, Aigupta mite chu in rawk a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan, “Ngai teh, mi ring duhin ka thu an pawm lo vang; ‘ Lalpa chu i hnênah a inlâr ngût lo vang e,’ an ti mai âwm si a,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “I kuta mi kha eng nge ni?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Tiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Leiah khân han paih teh,” a ti a. Tin, leiah chuan a han paih a, rûlah a lo chang ta a; tin, Mosia chuan a tlânsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “I kut khân han ban la, a meiah han la teh (Tin, a kut chuan a han ban a, a han la a, a kutah chuan tiangah a lo chang leh ta a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa , an thlahtute Pathian, Abrahama Pathian, Isaaka Pathian leh Jakoba Pathian chu i hnênah a rawn inlâr ngei a ni tih an rin theihna tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “I kut khân i âwm zuk zen teh,” a ti leh a. Tin, a âwm chu a zuk zen a; tin, a han phawrh chhuah leh chuan, ngai teh, a kut chu vûr anga vârin a lo phâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “I kut khân i âwm zuk zen leh teh (Tin, a âwm chu a zuk zen leh a; a âwm ata a han phawrh chhuah chuan, ngai teh, a tisa dang ang bawk chuan a lo awm leh ta a).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, an rin duh loh chea, chhinchhiahna hmasa zâwk chu an pawm duh loh chuan, chhinchhiahna hnuhnûng zâwk tal chu an ring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, chûng chhinchhiahna pahnih ngei pawh an rin lohva, i thusawi pawh chu an pawm loh chuan, lui tui i zuk thâl ang a, lei chârah i bun ang a; tin, lui ata tui i zuk thâl chu lei chârah chuan thisenah a lo chang dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Aw Lalpa , kei zawng tûn hma lamahte leh i chhiahhlawh hnêna thu i rawn sawi hnuah pawh hian, mi ṭawnghmang thiam ka ni ve ngai lo a ni; mi ṭawng ban leh mi ṭawng mawh ka ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Mihring kâ hi tu siam nge ni a, ṭawngtheilo te, bengngawng te, mitvâr te, mitdel te pawh hi tu tih nge ni? Kei Lalpa hian a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, kal mai rawh, i kâ chu keiman ka awmpui zêl ang a, i sawi tûr chu ka hrilh zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ni lo ve, Lalpa , mi dang tîr zâwk ta mai che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chu Mosia chungah a thinur ta a, a hnênah, “I unaupa Arona, Levia chi chu a awm lâwm ni? Ani zawngin ṭawnghmang a thiam tih ka hria a ni. Ngai teh, nangmah hmuak tûrin a lo kal nghe nghe asin. Tin, a hmuh che zawngin a thinlung chu a lâwm hle mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, nangin amah chu bia langin, thûte chu fah vek ang che; tichuan, i kâ leh a kâ chu keiman ka awmpui zêl ang a, in tih tûr chu ka hrilh zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chu mipui hnêna i thu sawi chhâwngtu a ni ang; tin, heti hi a ni ang a, i tân kâ a ni ang a, nang chu a tân Pathian ang i ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, nangin hetiang hi i keng ang a, chu chuan thilmakte chu i ti ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu a kal a, a pu Jethroa hnênah a kîr leh ta a; tin, a hnênah, “Aigupta rama ka unau awmte chu an la dam emaw, an hnênah khawngaih takin ka va hâwng rih ang e,” a ti a. Tin, Jethroa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Thlamuang takin kal ta che le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Midian ramah Mosia hnênah chuan, “Kal la, Aigupta ramah chuan va kîr leh tawh rawh le; nangmah tihhlum tumtute kha an thi vek tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan a nupui leh a fapate chu a hruai a, sabengtung chungah a chuantîr a; tin, Aigupta ramah chuan a kîr leh ta a. Tin, Mosian Pathian tiang chu a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Aigupta ram i thlen hun chuan, i kuta thilmak zawng zawng ka kentîr che hi Pharaoa hmaah chuan ti ngei ngei ang che; nimahsela, a thinlung ka tikhauh vang a; tichuan, mite chu a chhuahtîr phal lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, nangin Pharaoa hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpan , “Israela hi ka fapa, ka fa tîr a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, ka fapa chuan ka rawng a bâwl theih nân chhuahtîr rawh khai, ka ti a; tin, i chhuahtîr phal lo vei a, i fapa, i fa tîr chu ka tihlum ang,” a ti e,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kalkawnga riahhmunah chuan Lalpan Mosia chu a zuk tlawh a, tihhlum a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Zipori chuan meilung a la a, a fapaa serh vun chu a tan a, Mosia ke a tawhtîr a; tichuan, “Ka tân pasal thisen chhuah hmang i lo nih hi le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, “Serh tan avângin pasal thisen chhuah hmang i lo nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Arona hnênah, “Mosia hmuak tûrin thlalêrah va kal rawh,” a ti a. Tin, a kal ta a, Pathian tlângah chuan a va hmu a, a fâwp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpan a tirh thu zawng zawng leh thilmak a tihtîr tûr zawng zawng chu Arona a hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chuan Israela thlahte upaho zawng zawng chu an ko khâwm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnêna a sawi zawng zawng kha Arona chuan a sawi chhâwng leh vek a; tin, mipuite hmuhah chuan thilmakte chu a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan an âwih ta a; tin, Lalpan Israela thlahte chu a zuk kan a, an hrehawmziate a zuk hmu ta a ni tih an hriatin an lû an kûn a, chibai an bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan Mosia leh Arona chu an va kal a, Pharaoa hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-hote Pathianin heti hian a ti, ‘Ka mite hi thlalêrah ka hnênah kût tûrin rawn kaltîr rawh,’ tiin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chuan, “Tu nge maw ni Lalpa , a thu ka han zawma, Israel-hote ka han chhuahtîrna tûr chu ni le? Lalpa chu ka hre lo ve; Israel-hote lah ka chhuahtîr hek lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Hebraite Pathianin min rawn tlawh ta mai a. Thlalêr ni thum kalah Lalpa kan Pathian hnêna kan va inthawi theihna tûrin, khawngaih takin kan va kal ang e; chuti lo chuan, kan chungah hian hri emaw, khandaih emaw a rawn lêntîr mai dah ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta lal chuan an hnênah, “Engtizia nge nangni Mosia leh Arona hi, mipuite hnathawk lai in dâwngdahtîr ni? In hna chu va thawk reng reng tawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chuan, “Ngai teh u, hemi rama mite hi in lo tam ta hle mai a; tin, nangnin an phurrit phur chu in chawlhtîr mai a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni ngei chuan Pharaoan hnathawk vêngtute leh an hotute hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tûn achinah zawng tûn hma ang khân mite hi leirawhchana siam tûr buhpâwl in pe tûr a ni tawh lo ve, anmahni ngeiin buhpâwl chu thiar khâwm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, leirawhchan tûn hmaa an siam zât bawk kha anmahni lakah chuan in phût tûr a ni a; in tihtlêmsak hlek tûr a ni lo ve. An thatchhia a nih hi; chuvâng chuan alâwm, ‘Kan Pathian hnênah kan va inthawi ang e,’ an tih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite hi hnathawh hautak lehzual tuk rawh u khai, chûng chu thawk sela, dâwt thu mai maite hi ngaisâng suh se,” tiin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, hnathawk vêngtute leh an hotute chu an kal chhuak a, mite hnênah chuan, “Pharaoan, ‘Buhpâwl zawng ka pe dâwn tawh lo a che u,’ a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmahniin buhpâwl chu in hmuh theih ang ang va thiar khâwm rawh u; in hnathawh hi an tihtlêmsak chuang dâwn hlek lo che u a nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, mite chu Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawngah chuan, buhpâwl aiah buh bul zawng khâwmin an vâk darh chum chum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, hnathawk vêngtute chuan, “Tûn hmaa buhpâwl awm lai ang bawk khân, in hnathawh, in ni tin hnathawhte hi thawk zo thuai thuai rawh u,” tiin an tur hmanhmawh chhên ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa hnathawk vêngtute chuan Israela thlahte zînga hotu atâna an ruatte chu an vua a, “Engati nge niminah te leh vawiinah te pawh tûn hma ang bawka leirawhchan siam hi in la zawh loh ni?” tiin an chhâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte hotute chu Pharaoa hnênah an va kal a, “I chhiahhlawhte hian engati nge heti taka min tih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhte hi buhpâwl rêng rêng min pe ta lo va, anni chuan, ‘Leirawhchan siam rawh u,’ min ti mai si a. Tin, ngai teh, i chhiahhlawhte hi min vua a; nimahsela, nangma mite ngei thiam loh a ni zâwk a ni,” tiin an mangan thu an va sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan, “In thatchhia a ni, in thatchhia a ni! Chuvâng chuan a ni, ‘ Lalpa hnênah kan va inthawi ang e,’ in tih ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, kal ula, va thawk rawh u; buhpâwl zawng kan pêk dâwn loh che u hi; amaherawhchu, leirawhchan an tuk zât che u chu in siam rêng rêng tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, “In ni tin hnathawh, in leirawhchan siam hi in titlêm chuang hlei lo vang e,” an tih veleh chuan Israela thlahte hotute chuan an chan a chhe êm êm a ni tih an lo inhre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa hnên aṭanga an lo chhuak chuan Mosia leh Arona, kawnga lo ding chu an rawn hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, an hnênah, “ Lalpan en che u sela, rorêlsak che u rawh se; keimahni min thahna tûra an kuta khandaih kentîrin, Pharaoa mit hmuhah leh a chhiahhlawhteho lakah hian huat min phurhtîr tâk avâng hian,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chuan Lalpa lam a hawi a, “Lalpa, eng tizia nge he mite hi ṭha lo taka i tih le? Eng vângin nge mi tirh ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pharaoa hnêna i hminga thusawi tûra ka kal achinah he mite hi ṭha lo takin a ti a; nang lah chuan i mite hi i la chhan chhuak hauh si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Tûnah zawng Pharaoa chunga ka tih dân tûr chu i hmu tawh ang. Kut chak tak avâng chuan anmahni a chhuahtîr ang a; tin, kut chak tak avâng chuan a ram ata chu anmahni a hnawt chhuak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathianin Mosia a bia a, hnênah, “Kei JEHOVA ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abrahama hnênah te, Isaaka hnênah te leh Jakoba hnênah te khân Pathian Engkimtheia-in ka lo inlâr ta a, ka hming JEHOVA-in erawh chuan an hnênah ka la inhriattîr lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, anmahni hnênah chuan, Kanaan ram, an mikhualna ram, rei lo tê an lo awm tawhna kha pêk tumin ka thinlung chu ka lo tinghet ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte, Aigupta-hoten an bâwihate rûm kha ka lo hre bawk a; tichuan, ka thuthlung chu ka hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israela thlahte hnênah chuan, ‘Kei JEHOVA ka ni a, Aigupta-hote phurrit lak ata hi ka hruai chhuak ang che u a, an bâwiha in awm hi ka chhuahtîr ang che u; tin, nasa taka ngaihtuah che uin bân phar meuhvin ka tlan ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ka mi atân ka nei ang che u a; tin, kei in tân Pathian ka ni ang a; tichuan, kei hi Jehova, in Pathian, Aigupta-ho phurrit lak ata hruai chhuaktu che u ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abrahama te, Isaaka te leh Jakoba te hnêna ka bân meuhva pêk ka tumna ramah khân ka hruai lût ang che u a; tichuan, in ro chanah ka pe ang che u: kei JEHOVA ka nih hi,’ tiin hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israela thlahte hnênah chuan chûng thu chu a va sawi a; nimahsela, rilru nguina avâng leh nasa taka tihretheihna avâng chuan Mosia thu chu an ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Va kal la, Aigupta lal Pharaoa hnênah Israela thlahte hi a ram ata chhuahtîr tûrin va sawi rawh,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpa hmaah, “Ngai teh, Israela thlahten ka thusawi an ngaithla duh si lo va; kei mi ṭawng mawh thusawi tehlul hi Pharaoan engtin nge a ngaihthlâk ang ni?” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia leh Arona chu a bia a, “Aigupta ram ata Israel-te hruai chhuak tûrin thu ka pe tawh che u a ni tih Israel-te leh Aigupta lal chu hrilh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, hêng hi an pate hnam bulpui berte chu an ni: Israela fa tîr Reubena fapate chu Hanoka te, Palua te, Hezrona te, Karmia te an ni a; hêngte hi Reubena hnamte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Simeona fapate chu Jemuela te, Jamina te, Ohada te, Jakina te, Zohara te, Kanaan hmeichhe laka a fapa Saula te an ni: hêngte hi Simeona hnamte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, hêngte hi an thlahte ang zêlin Levia fapate hming chu a ni: Gersona te, Kohatha te, Meraria te an ni a; tin, Levia dam chhûng kum chu kum za leh kum sawmthum leh kum sarih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an hnam ang zêlin Gersona fapate chu Libnia leh Simeia te hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Kohatha fapate chu Amrama te, Izara te, Hebrona te, Uziela te an ni a; tin, Kohatha dam chhûng kum chu kum za leh kum sawmthum leh kum thum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Meraria fapate chu Mahlia leh Musia an ni. Hêngte hi an thlahte ang zêla Levia hnamte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Amrama chuan a pa farnu Jokebedi chu nupuiah a nei a; tin, Arona leh Mosia a hrinsak a: tin, Amrama dam chhûng kum chu kum za leh kum sawmthum leh kum sarih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Izara fapate chu Kora te, Nephega te, Zikria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Uziela fapate chu Misaela te, Elzaphana te, Sithria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Arona chuan Aminadaba fanu, Nasona farnu Elisebi chu nupuiah a nei a; tin, Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazara te, Ithamara te a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Kora fapate chu Asira te, Elkana te, Abiasapha te an ni. Hêngte hi Kora-ho hnamte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Arona fapa Eleazara chuan Putiela fanute zînga mi pakhat chu nupuiah a nei a; tin, Phinehasa a hrinsak a. Tin, hêngte hi an hnam ang zêla Levia thlah bulpui berte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu mi Arona leh Mosia-te chu an ni Lalpan , “Aigupta ram ata Israela thlahte hi an pâwlho ang zêlin hruai chhuak rawh u,” tia a hrilh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chu mite chu an ni Aigupta lal Pharaoa va biaa, Israela thlahte chu Aigupta ram ata chhuahtîr tûra va betute chu. Chu mite chu Mosia leh Arona chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Aigupta rama Lalpan Mosia a biak ni chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni. Aigupta ram lal Pharaoa hnênah chuan i hnêna ka sawi zawng zawng hi sawi rawh,” tiin Mosia chu a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpa hmaah, “Ngai teh, kei mi ṭawng mawh ka ni si a; tichuan, keia thusawi tehlul hi Pharaoan engtin nge a ngaihthlâk ang ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai teh, Pharaoa tân Pathian angah ka siam tawh che alâwm; tin, i unau Arona chu i zâwlnei a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu ka pêk apiang che chu i sawi chhuak zêl ang a; tin, i unau Aronan Pharaoa a ram ata Israela thlahte chhuahtîr tûrin a hrilh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa thinlung chu ka tikhauh ang a; tin, ka chhinchhiahna leh ka thilmakte chu Aigupta ramah hian ka tipung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pharaoan in thu a pawm duh lo vang; tin, Aigupta ram chhûngah hian ka kut ka nghat ang a, anmahni chu nasa taka ngaihtuahin ka mi Israela thlahte, ka pâwlhote hi Aigupta ram ata chu ka hruai chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite chuan, Aigupta ram chunga ka kut ka han phara, an zîng ata Israela thlahte ka hruai chhuah hunah zet chuan kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an la hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chuan chutiang chuan an ti a; Lalpan anmahni thu a pêk ang ngei chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa an va biak lai khân Mosia chu kum sawmriat mi a ni a; tin, Arona chu kum sawmriat leh kum thum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona hnênah, “Pharaoan, ‘Thil mak han ti teh u,’ a lo tih che u chuan nangin Arona hnênah, ‘I tiang kha la la, Pharaoa hmaah paih ang che; tichuan, rûlah a lo chang dâwn nia,’ ti ang che,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chu Pharaoa hnênah an va lût a; tin, Lalpa thupêk ang chuan an han ti a. Tin, Arona chuan a tiang chu Pharaoa leh a chhiahhlawhte hmaah chuan a han paih a; tin, rûlah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pharaoa pawh chuan mi fingte leh dawithiamte chu a ko ve a: tin, anni, Aigupta rama mitlâk dawithiamte pawh chuan chutiang bawk chuan an dawina chuan an han ti ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An tiang chu an han paih ṭheuh va, rûlah a chang ṭheuh va; amaherawhchu, Arona tiang chuan an tiangte chu a lem zo ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa thinlung chu tihkhauhvin a awm a; tichuan, an thu chu a ngaithla duh ta lo va, Lalpan a lo sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Pharaoa thinlung hi tihluhlulin a lo awm ta a, mite chu a chhuahtîr phal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharaoa hnênah chuan zîngah va kal ang che; ngai teh, tuiah a kal ṭhîn a, tin, amah hmuh tumin lui kamah ding ang che; tin, i tiang rûla chang kha keng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, ‘ Lalpa , Hebraite Pathianin, “Ka mite hian thlalêrah ka rawng an bâwl theihna tûrin rawn kaltîr rawh,” tiin i hnênah mi a tîr a ni e; tin, ngai teh, tûn thlengin i la ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpan , “Hemiah hian kei Lalpa chu ka ni tih i hria ang. Ngai teh, hemi ka tiang ken hian luia tuite hi ka han vua ang a; tichuan, thisenah a lo chang mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, luia sanghate chu an thi ang a, lui chu a uih hluah hluah ang; tichuan, Aigupta miten luia tui chu an in lo vang,” a ti e,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Arona hnênah, ‘I tiang keng la, Aigupta ram tui chungah te, an lui chungah te, an luite chungah te, an dîl chungah te, tui tlin khâwmna zawng zawng chungah te chuan thisena a lo chan vekna tûrin phar rawh; tichuan, Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawngah, thingkuangahte leh lungkuangahte chuan thisen a awm vek mai ang,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chuan Lalpa thupêk ang chuan an han ti a; tin, tiang chu a han lek a, Pharaoa mit hmuhah leh a chhiahhlawhte mit hmuhah chuan luia tui chu a han vua a; tichuan, luia tui zawng zawng chu thisenah a chang ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, luia sanghate chu an thi ta vek a, lui chu a uih ta hluah hluah a; tichuan, Aigupta mite chuan luia tui chu an in thei ta lo va. Tin, thisen chu Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawngah chuan a awm ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta rama mitlâk dawithiamte pawh chuan an dawi hmangin chutiang bawk chuan an han ti ve a; tin, Pharaoa thinlung chu tihkhauhvin a awm a; tichuan, an thu chu a ngaithla duh ta lo va, Lalpan a sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chu a in lamah chuan a hâwng ta a, chûng pawh chu a thinlungah a lungkham chuang hauh lo mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mi zawng zawng chuan tui in atân lui kam vêlte chu an lai chiam a; lui tui chu an in thei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan lui a vuak achin chu ni sarih zet a tling a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia chu a bia a, a hnênah, “Pharaoa hnênah va lût la, a hnênah, ‘ Lalpan , “Ka mite hian ka rawng an bâwl theih nân chhuahtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I chhuahtîr phal loh zawngin, ngai teh, i ram chin zawng zawng hi chunguin ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lui chu chunguin a khat mur mur ang a, chungute chu i inah hian an lo lût chho vang a, i mutna pindanah te, i khumah te, i chhiahhlawhte in chhûngah te, i mite zîngah te, i thukah te, i chhang hmehna thlêng chhûngah te an awm noh noh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, chungute chu nangmah leh i mite leh i chhiahhlawhte chungah chuan an vâk noh noh mai ang,” a ti e,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Arona hnênah, ‘I tiang kha i kutin lui chungah te, luite chungah te leh tui tlinna chungah te lek langin, Aigupta ramah hian chungu rawn lêntîr chiam ang che,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Arona chuan Aigupta ram lui chungahte chuan a kut a han phar a; tichuan, chungu chu an lo chhuak a, Aigupta ram khahin a khat zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, mitlâk dawithiamte pawh chuan an dawi hmangin chutiang bawk chuan an han ti ve a, Aigupta ramah chuan chungute chu an han tichhuak ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pharaoa chuan Mosia leh Arona chu a kohtîr a, an hnênah, “Ka hnên aṭang leh ka mite hnên aṭanga chungu hi la bo tûrin Lalpa hnênah ngên teh u; tichuan, Lalpa hnêna an inthawi theihna tûrin mite hi ka chhuahtîr ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Pharaoa hnênah, “I hnên aṭang leh i in aṭanga chungute chu tihborala a awma, luiah chauh a awmna tûrin, nangmah leh i chhiahhlawhte leh i mite tân chuan eng tik atân nge ka ngen ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Naktûk atân le,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “I thu ang chuan ni ang hmiang; tichuan, Lalpa kan Pathian ang rêng rêng hi tu mah an awm lo tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chungute chuan nangmah leh i inte leh i chhiahhlawhte leh i mite chu an chhuahsan vek ang che u a; luiah chauh an awm tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chu Pharaoa hnên ata an chhuak ta a; tin, Mosia chuan Pharaoa chunga chungu a rawn lêntîr chungchâng thûah chuan Lalpa hnênah a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia thu ang chuan a ti a; tin, in chhûnga mite, in hung chhûng kawtlaia mite leh lova mi chungute chu an thi fai ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, an chhar khâwm a, an dah vûm thûr mai a; tichuan, a ram uihin a lo uih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pharaoa chuan engthâwlna a lo awm ta tih a hriat veleh a thinlung a tikhauh va; tichuan, an thu chu a ngaithla duh ta lo va, Lalpan a lo sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Arona hnênah, ‘I tiang kha lek la, leia vaivut hi vaw rawh, Aigupta ram zawng zawnga vaivut hi thosia a lo chan theih nân,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chutiang chuan an han ti a. Arona chuan a tiang chu a kutin a han lek a, leia vaivut chu a han vua a; tin, mihring chungah leh sa chungah chuan thosi a lo awm ta mur mur a; Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawnga leia vaivut zawng zawng chu thosiah a chang zo ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, mitlâk dawithiamte chuan an dawi hmangin thosi tihchhuah an han tum ve a; nimahsela, an thei lo. Tin, mihring chungah leh sa chungah chuan thosi chu a awm ta mur mur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, mitlâk dawithiamte chuan Pharaoa hnênah, “Hei hi Pathian kutzungtang a nih hi,” an ti a; tichuan, Pharaoa thinlung chu tihkhauhvin a awm a, an thu chu a ngaithla duh lo va, Lalpan a lo sawi ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Zîng takah tho la, Pharaoa hmaah va ding ang che; ngai teh, tuiah a lo kal ṭhîn a. Tin, a hnênah, ‘ Lalpan , “Ka mite hian ka rawng an bâwl theih nân chhuahtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuti lo zawng, ka mite i chhuahtîr phal loh zawngin, ngai teh, i chungah leh i chhiahhlawhte chungah leh, i mite chungah leh i in chhûngahte chuan tho tam tak ka rawn tîr chiam ang a; tichuan, Aigupta mite inte leh an chênna lei zawng zawngte pawh chu tho hlîrin a khat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan ka mite awmna Gosen ram chu ka tihrang ang, chutah chuan tho rêng rêng a awm ve loh nân; tichuan, lei chungah hian kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in lo hre thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ka mite leh i mite chu ka thliar ang a; naktûkah he chhinchhiahna hi a lo awm ang,” a ti e,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan chutiang chuan a ti a; tichuan, Pharaoa inah leh a chhiahhlawhte inah leh, Aigupta ram zawng zawngah chuan tho tam pui mai chu an lût ta chiam a; tho tam tak chuan ram chu a tichhe chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chuan Mosia leh Arona a kohtîr a, an hnênah, “Kal ta ula, he ramah hian in Pathian hnênah chuan va inthawi mai tawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan, “Chutiang tih chu a fel hlei nêm, Aigupta miten thiang lo an tihte chuan Lalpa kan Pathian hnênah kan inthawi dâwn zuk nia! Ngai teh, Aigupta mite mit hmuhah hian thiang lo an tihte chuan kan inthawi dâwn em ni ang? Lungin min dêng mai dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thlalêr ni thum kalah chuan kan va kal ang a, Lalpa kan Pathianin tih tûra min pêk ang angin a hnênah kan va inthawi ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chuan, “Thlalêra Lalpa in Pathian hnêna in inthawi theihna tûrin ka kaltîr ang che u; amaherawhchu, in kal hla vak tûr a ni lo ve. Mi ngensak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan, “Ngai teh, i hnên aṭang chuan ka chhuak dâwn a ni a, naktûkah hian Pharaoa leh a chhiahhlawhte leh a mite chu tho tam pui hian a chhuahsan theihna tûrin Lalpa hnênah ka ngên ang e; amaherawhchu, mite Lalpa hnêna an inthawi chu Pharaoa hian phal lovin, tihder leh tawh lul suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu Pharaoa hnên ata a chhuak a; tichuan, Lalpa hnênah a ngên ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia thu ang chuan a ti a; tichuan, Pharaoa hnên ata leh a chhiahhlawhte hnên ata leh a mite hnên ata tho tam pui chu a tikiang ta a, pakhat mah a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chuan chumi ṭum pawh chuan a thinlung a tikhauh leh a; tichuan, mite chu a chhuahtîr phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Pharaoa hnênah va lût la, ‘ Lalpa , Hebraite Pathianin, “Ka mite hian ka rawng an bâwl theih nân chhuahtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I chhuahtîr phal lohva, i la hrên reng zawngin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ngai teh, phûla i rante chungah chuan Lalpa kut a awm dâwn a ni, sakawr chungah te, sabengtung chungah te, sanghâwngsei chungah te, bâwng rual chungah te, berâm rual chungah te chuan hri nasa tak mai a lo lêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Israel-ho ran leh Aigupta mite ran chu a tihrang ang a; tichuan, Israela thlahte ta chu pakhat mah a thi lo vang,” a ti e,’ tiin hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Naktûkah Lalpan he ramah hian chutiang chu a ti dâwn e,” tiin hun a ruat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a tûkah chutiang chuan a ti ta a, Aigupta mite ran zawng zawng chu a thi ta vek a; nimahsela, Israela thlahte ran chu pakhat mah a thi ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chuan mi a tîr a; ngai teh, Israel mite ran chu pakhat mah a lo thi ve lo va. Nimahsela, Pharaoa thinlung chu tihluhlulin a awm a, mite chu a chhuahtîr phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona hnênah, “Rawh tuina meia mi vut va ṭhûm ula, Pharaoa mit hmuhah Mosian vân lamah theh chiam rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ram zawng zawng chungah hian vut dip takah a lo chang ang a; tin, chu chuan Aigupta ram chhung zawng zawnga mi leh sa chu khawihli a veitîr ṭheuh ang a, a durh leu chiam ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, rawh tuina meia vut chu an la a, Pharaoa hmaah chuan an va ding a; tin, Mosia chuan vân lamah a han theh chiam a; tichuan, mi tin leh sa tinin khawihli durh leu an lo vei ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, khawihli avâng chuan mitlâk dawithiamte chuan Mosia chu an chelh ta lo va; mitlâk dawithiamte leh Aigupta mi zawng zawngte chuan khawihli chu an vei vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Pharaoa thinlung chu a tikhauh va; tichuan, an thu chu a ngaithla duh ta lo va, Lalpan Mosia hnêna a sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Zîng takah tho la, Pharaoa hmaah va ding la; tin, a hnênah, ‘ Lalpa , Hebraite Pathianin, “Ka miten ka rawng an bâwl theih nân chhuahtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûn ṭumah zawng i chungah leh i chhiahhlawhte chungah leh, i mite chungah hian ka hri zawng zawngte hi ka lêntîr dâwn e; tichuan, khawvêl zawng zawngah hian keimah ang rêng rêng hi tu mah an awm lo tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuti ni suh sela, ka kut ka thawh ang a, nang leh i mite hi hriin ka hrem ang a, khawvêl ata hi ka tiboral daih tawh tûr che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, hemi avâng ngawt hian ka tungding chia, ka thiltihtheihna entîr tûr che leh khawvêl zawng zawnga ka hming a lo than theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka mite lakah hian i la induh cheuvin, i la chhuahtîr lo vang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai teh, naktûk hetih hunah hian rial tam pui, Aigupta ram a lo awm tirh ata, tûn thleng pawha la tla ngai lo chu ka tlâktîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, phûla i rante leh i neih apiangte chu khungtîr thuai rawh khai; mi tin leh sa tin phûla awm, ina khung loh tawh phawt chu, rialin a dêng ang a, an thi ang,” a ti e,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pharaoa chhiahhlawhte zînga Lalpa thu pawisa apiang chuan, an chhiahhlawhte leh an rante chu in chhûngah an tlân luhtîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa thu ngaisâng lo apiang chuan, an chhiahhlawhte leh an rante chu phûlah chuan an awmtîr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Vân lamah i kut han lek rawh, Aigupta ram zawng zawngah hian mihring chungah te, sa chungah te, Aigupta ram chhûnga lova thlai tinrêng chungah te chuan rial a lo tlâk nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan a tiang chu vân lamah a han lek a; tin, Lalpa chuan khawpui ri leh rial a zuk tîr a, leiah chuan meite a lo tla a; tichuan, Lalpan Aigupta ram chungah chuan rial a tlâktîr ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, rial, mei leh riala inpawlh, nasa êm êm mai, Aigupta ram zawng zawngah chuan, Aigupta hnam lo awm achin chutiang rêng rêng la awm ngai lo chu a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, rial chuan Aigupta ram zawng zawnga phûla awm zawng zawng, mihringte leh sate chu a dêng a; tin, rial chuan lova thlai tinrêngte chu a dêng a, phûla thing tinrêngte chu a titliak vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gosen ram, Israela thlahte awmnaah chauh chuan rial a tla ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chuan Mosia leh Arona chu a kohtîr a, an hnênah, “Tûn ṭum zawng thil ka tisual ta a ni e. Lalpa chu mi fel a ni a, kei leh ka mite hi kan sual a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah ngên rawh u, hêng khawpui ri dur durte leh rialte hi a tâwk tawh e; tichuan, ka chhuahtîr ang che u a, in awm tawh lo vang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mosian a hnênah, “Khua ata hi ka chhuah veleh Lalpa lamah ka kut ka phar ang a, khawpui rite chu a reh ang a, rial pawh a awm tawh hek lo vang; tichuan, lei hi Lalpa ta a ni tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, nang leh i chhiahhlawhteho hi zawngin, Lalpa Pathian hi in la ṭih chuang lo tih ka hria a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, la leh barli chu a dêng chhia a; barli chu a vuih lai mêk a ni a, la chu a rah lai mêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimahsela, buh leh vai buhtun chu a dêng chhe lo, a la ṭo rih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu Pharaoa hnên aṭangin khua ata chu a chhuak a, Lalpa lamah a kut a phar a; tichuan, khawpui rite leh rial tla chu a lo bâng ta a, lei chungah chuan ruah pawh chu a baw tlâwrh tlâwrh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chu ruah leh rial leh khawpui rite chu a bâng ta tih a hriat veleh a sual leh ta sauh va, amah leh a chhiahhlawhte nên an thinlung an tikhauh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa thinlung chu tihkhauhvin a awm a; tichuan, Israela thlahte chu a chhuahtîr phal ta lo va, Lalpan Mosia hmanga a lo sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Pharaoa hnênah va lût rawh; a thinlung leh a chhiahhlawhte thinlung chu ka tihkhauhsak tawh e, hêng ka chhinchhiahnate hi an zîngah ka entîr theihna tûrin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, nang pawhin i fa leh i fa fate benga Aigupta ram chunga thil ka tih zia leh, an zînga ka chhinchhiahnate ka tih zia hi i hrilh theihna tûrin; kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hriat theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chu Pharaoa hnênah an va lût a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa , Hebraite Pathianin, ‘Ka hmaah eng chen nge inngaitlâwm duh lova awm i tum ni? Ka mite hian ka rawng an bâwl theih nân chhuahtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mite hi i chhuahtîr phal loh zawngin, ngai teh, naktûkah i ram chhûngah hian khaukhuapte ka rawn lêntîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, lei chung hi an dâp vek ang a, tu mahin lei rêng rêng hi an hmu thei lo vang; tin, rialin a tihchhiat bâk, in hnêna la awmate hi an ei ang a, phûla in thing ṭo apiangte chu an ei vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, i inte leh i chhiahhlawhte zawng zawng inte leh, Aigupta mi zawng zawng inte chu a khat vek ang; i thlahtute leh i thlahtute thlahtute pawhin, khawvêla an lo awm achin tûn thleng pawhin, chutiang chu an la hmu ngai lo a ni,’ a ti e,” an ti a. Tin, a lehhawi a, Pharaoa hnên ata chu a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “He mi hi kan tân eng chen nge maw thanga a awm dâwn le? Hêngho hian Lalpa an Pathian rawng an bâwl theih nân kaltîr ta mai che maw le. Aigupta ram hi tihchhiat a nih tawh hi i la hre lo vem ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chu Pharaoa hnênah an hruai leh a; tin, an hnênah, “Kal ula, Lalpa in Pathian rawng chu va bâwl tawh u. Amaherawhchu, tute nge ni kal tûr chu?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “A pui a pangin kan kal ang; kan fapate leh kan fanute nên, kan berâm rualte leh kan bâwng rualte nên kan kal ang; Lalpa hnênah kan kût ngei tûr a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa chu in hnênah awm ang hmiang! In fanau tê tête nên chuan ka kaltîr mawlh ang che u le; inngaihtuah rawh u khai, thil sual tih in tum a nih hi le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnai lo ve! Nangni mipaho erawh chu kal ula, Lalpa rawng chu bâwl rawh u; chu chu alâwm in duh,” a ti a. Tin, Pharaoa hnên ata chu an hnawt chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Aigupta ram chungah hian khaukhuapte rawn lêntîr tûrin i kut phar rawh, Aigupta ramah hian an lo chhohva, he rama thlai tinrêng, rial den chhiat bâk zawng zawngte nên lam pawha an ei theihna tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Aigupta ram chungah chuan a tiang chu a han lek a, Lalpan chumi ni, nilêng leh zankhuain chumi ramah chuan khawchhak thli a rawn tlehtîr a; tin, a tûkah chuan khawchhak thli chuan khaukhuap a rawn lên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, khaukhuapte chu Aigupta ram zawng zawng chungah chuan an lêng a, Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawngah chuan an fu a. An tam êm êm mai a; tûn hmain khaukhuap chutiang rêng rêng a la awm ngai lo va, tûn hnuah pawh chutiang rêng rêng chu a awm leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lei chung zawng zawng hi an dâp vek mai si a; tichuan, ram chu a thimin a thim mup mai a ni; tin, rial den chhiat bâk, chumi rama thlai tinrêng leh theirah zawng zawngte chu an ei vek a. Tichuan, Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawngah chuan lovah thil hring rêng rêng, thing pawh, thlai pawh a awm ta hauh lo mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chuan Mosia leh Arona chu hmanhmawh takin a kohtîr a, an hnênah, “ Lalpa in Pathian chungah leh nangmahni chungah thil ka lo tisual ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka sual hi tûn ṭumah chauh hian ngaidam ang che, ka ngên a che, he thihna hi mi lâk bosak phawt mai tûrin Lalpa in Pathian hnênah ngên ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa hnên ata chu a kal chhuak a, Lalpa hnênah chuan a ngên ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan khawthlang thli na tak mai a rawn tlehtîr a, chu chuan khaukhuapte chu a lên a, Tuifinriat Senah a lên thla ta vek a; Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawngah chuan khaukhuap pakhat mah a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan Pharaoa thinlung chu a tikhauh va; tichuan, Israela thlahte chu a chhuahtîr phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Vân lamah i kut han lek rawh, Aigupta ram chungah hian a lo thim khupa, ai mit thlawn ang maia a lo thimna tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan a kut chu vân lamah a han lek a, Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawng chu ni thum chhûng zet a thim ta mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu mah rêng rêng an inhmu thei ta lo va, tu mah mahni hmun ata ni thum chhûng zet chu an tawlh sawn thei lo bawk a. Israela thlahte zawng zawng awmna erawh chu a êng vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoan Mosia a kohtîr a, a hnênah, “Kal ta ula, Lalpa rawng chu va bâwl tawh u; in beram rualte leh in bâwng rualte erawh chu awm sela; in fanau tê tête pawh in hnênah kal ve rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “ Lalpa kan Pathian hnêna kan inthawi theihna tûrin inthawina tûrte leh hâlral thilhlan tûrte chu nangin kan kutah min pe tel ve bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kan rante chu kan hnênah an kal ve bawk tûr a ni; ran rêng rêng chu pakhat mah kan hnutchhiah lo vang. Chûng zînga mi chu Lalpa kan Pathian rawngbâwl nân kan hman ngei ngei tûr a ni si a; chumi hmun kan va thlen hma loh chuan engin nge Lalpa rawng kan bâwl ang tih kan la inhre lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan Pharaoa thinlung chu a tikhauh va, a chhuahtîr phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoan a hnênah, “Ka hnên ata hi chhuak daih la, fimkhur rawh khai, ka hmêl rêng rêng rawn hmu tawh hlek suh; ka hmêl i hmuh ni la la chuan i thi ngei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan, “I sawi dik zet mai; i hmêl zawng hmuh ni ka nei leh tawh lo vang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah chuan, “Pharaoa chungah leh Aigupta ram chungah hian vawi khat chu hri ka han lêntîr leh ang e; chumi hnuah zawng a chhuahtîr tawh ang che u. A chhuahtîr vêk vêk che u zawngin heta ta hi a hnawt chhuak daih mai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite beng hriatah thu va sawi rawh, mipa leh hmeichhe tinin an vêngte chu tangkaraw incheina leh rangkachak incheinate dîl rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan mite chu Aigupta mite a khawngaihtîr ta a. Chu chang a ni lo va, Mosia chu Aigupta ramah chuan, Pharaoa chhiahhlawhteho ngaihah leh mipuite ngaihah mi ropui tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti, ‘Zanlai vêlah chuan Aigupta ram chhûngah hian ka lo kal tlang ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tichuan, Aigupta rama fa tîr zawng zawng, lalṭhutphaha thu Pharaoa fa tîr aṭanga buh râwt sawmna bula awm bâwihnu fa tîr lam pawhin an thi ang, ran piang hmasa ber zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ram chhûng zawng zawngah chuan ṭahna nasa tak a awm ang a, chutianga nasa rêng rêng a la awm ngai lo va, chutiang rêng rêng chu a awm leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Israela thlahteho zawng mihring leh sa lamah rêng rêng ui pawhin a lei a phût lo vang; Lalpa chuan Aigupta mite leh Israel mite hi a thliar ngei a ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, hêng i chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte hi ka hnênah an lo chhuak ang a, “Chhuak rawh, i hnung zuitute zawng zawng nên hian,” tiin ka hmaah an kûn ang; tin, chumi hnuah chuan ka chhuah ang,’ tiin,” a ti a. Tin, Pharaoa hnên ata chu thinrim zet maiin a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah chuan, “Pharaoan in thu a pawm lo vang; ka thilmakte Aigupta ramah hian tihpuna a awm theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chuan Pharaoa hmaah chuan chûng thilmak zawng zawng chu an ti a; tin, Lalpan Pharaoa thinlung chu a tikhauh va, Israela thlahte chu a ram ata a chhuahtîr phal lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona chu Aigupta ramah chuan a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tûn thla hi in tân thla chhiar ṭanna a ni ang a; in tân kum khat chhûnga thla chhiar ṭanna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-ho pung khâwm zawng zawngte hnênah hian, ‘Tûn thla ni sâwm ni takah hian mi tinin an chhûngkaw khawsak ang zêlin an chhûngkaw tân berâmno pakhat la ṭheuh sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an chhûngkua chu berâmno talhna tham ni lo khawpa tlêm lutuk an nih chuan, a ṭhenawm nên an chhûngkaw mihring zir zêlin berâmno pakhat inṭâwm sela; mi tin ei tâwk tûr ang zêl ngaihruatin berâmno chu in ruat tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In berâmno chu a pa, kum khat hnuai lam, hmêlhem lo a ni tûr a ni a, berâm zînga mi emaw, kêl zînga mi emaw a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chumi thla ni sâwm leh ni li ni thlengin in dah tûr a ni a; tichuan, Israel-ho pung khâwm zawng zawng chuan tlai lamah an talh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a thisen chu an la ang a, an eina tûr in kawngka biang pahnihah leh kawngka lû chungah an tât tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chumi zân chuan a sa chu rawh sela, chhang dawidim telh loh nên ei rawh se; hnim khâ nên an ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a helin ei suh sela, tui pawhin chhûm hauh suh sela, a rawhin rawh zâwk rawh se, a lû leh a ke chawpin, a kawchhûng nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a tûk atân chuan eng mah in dah tûr a ni lo va; a tûk thlenga bâng la awm chu meiah in rawh ral tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, hetiang hian in ei tûr a ni: in puan vengin, pheikhawk bunin, tiang kengin. Tin, hmanhmawh takin in ei tûr a ni; Lalpa kal hlên a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Aigupta ram chhûng chu ka fang dâwn si a, Aigupta rama fa tîr zawng zawng, mi leh sa chu ka tihlum ang a; Aigupta rama pathian zawng zawng chu an ro ka rêlsak ang: Lalpa ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, thisen chu in tân in awmna in chhinchhiahna a ni ang a; tin, thisen chu ka hmuh chuan ka kal hlên ang che u a; tichuan, Aigupta ram ka hrem hunah chuan nangmahni tiboraltu tûr in chungah hri rêng rêng a lo lêng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, hemi ni hi in tân hriat rengna ni a ni ang a; Lalpa tân kût nîah in ruat tûr a ni. In thlahte thlengin kumkhaw thuruat atâna awm reng tûrin kût nîah in hmang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Ni sarih chhûng chu chhang dawidim telh loh in ei tûr a ni a; ni khat ni aṭang rêng chuan in in chhûng ata dawidim chu in thian fai vek tûr a ni. Tu pawh ni khat ni aṭanga a ni sarih ni thlenga chhang dawidim telh ei apiang chu, chu mi chu Israel-ho zîng ata tihboral a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ni khat nîah inkoh khâwmna thianghlim in nei ang a, a ni sarih nîah inkoh khâwmna thianghlim a awm leh ang; mi tinin an mamawh ei tûr buatsaih tih loh chu, chumi chhûng chuan hna rêng rêng thawh hlek tûr a ni lo, ei tûr buatsaih chauh tih thian a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chhang dawidim telh loh kût ni chu in serh tûr a ni, chumi ni ngei chuan Aigupta ram ata in mipuihote chu ka hruai chhuak si che u a; chuvângin, in thlahte thlengin kumkhaw thuruat atâna awm reng tûrin chumi ni chu in serh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thla khatna, chumi thla ni sâwm leh ni li ni, tlai lamah chuan chhang dawidim telh loh chu in ei ang a, chumi thla ni sawmhnih leh ni khat ni tlai thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chu in in chhûngah rêng rêng dawidim a awm tûr a ni lo va; tu pawh dawidim telh ei apiang chu, chu mi chu hnam dang pawh, in rama piang pawh ni sela, Israel-ho pung khâwm zîng ata hi tihboral tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dawidim telh rêng rêng chu in ei tûr a ni lo va; in chênna hmun apiangah chuan chhang dawidim telh loh in ei tûr a ni,’ tiin sawi ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israel upaho zawng zawng chu a koh khâwmtîr a, an hnênah, “Chhûngkaw tinin berâmnotête chu va la chhuak ta ula, kalhlênna tûr talh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, husop kau in la ang a, maihûna thisenah chuan in zu hnim ang a, kawngka lû chungah leh kawngka biang pahnihah chuan maihûna thisen chu tât ang che u. Tin, khawvâr hma loh chuan tu mah mahni in ata in chhuak tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chu Aigupta mite tihlum tûrin a lo kal tlang dâwn si a; tichuan, kawngka lû chung leh kawngka biang pahniha thisen kai a hmuh chuan, Lalpa chuan kawngka chu a kal hlên ang a, in in chhûngah chuan nangmahni tihlum tûrin tiboraltu chu a rawn luhtîr lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hetiang hian nangmah leh i fate tâna kumkhuaa thuruat awm reng tûrin in rawn ti ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpan pêk a lo tiam tawh anga a pêk che u ram chu in thlen hunin, he rawngbâwlna hi in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, in faten in hnêna, ‘He rawngbâwlna awmzia hi eng nge ni ngai le?’ an rawn tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nangnin, ‘Hei hi Lalpa kalhlên inthawina a nih hi, ani chuan Aigupta mite a tihhlum lai khân kan inte chu a rawn zuah a, Aigupta rama Israela thlahte in chu a rawn kal hlên a ni,’ in la ti dâwn nia,” a ti a. Tin, mipuite chuan an lû an kûn a, chibai an bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu an kal a, chutiang chuan an ti a; Lalpan Mosia leh Arona thu a pêk ang chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, zanlaiah chuan Lalpa chuan Aigupta rama fa tîr zawng zawng - lalṭhutphaha ṭhu Pharaoa fa tîr aṭanga rip chhûnga tâng fa tîr lamin - a zuk tihlum ta vek a, ran piang hmasa ber zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa chu amah leh a chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte leh, Aigupta mi zawng zawngte nên zânah chuan an tho ta a; tin, Aigupta ramah chuan ṭahna nasa tak a awm a; mitthi awm lohna in rêng rêng pakhat mah a awm si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chu a zân a zânin a kohtîr a, “Tho ula, ka miteho zîng ata hi chhuak rawh u, nangmahni leh Israela thlahteho nên hian; tin, kal ula, in sawi ang khân Lalpa rawng chu va bâwl tawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />In sawi ang khân in berâm rualte leh in sebâwng rualte pawh chu kalpui rawh u; kal tawh u; tin, kei pawh mal mi sâwm ve bawk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite chuan chumi ram ata chu hmanhmawh taka tîr chhuak tûrin mite chu an tur ta chhên a; “Kan thi vek a ni ta mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan an chhang hmehte chu dawidim an telh hmain an la a, an chhang hmehna thlêngte chu an puanin an tuam a, an kokiah an bât ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Mosia thu ang chuan an ti a; tin, Aigupta mite chu tangkaraw incheinate leh rangkachak incheinate leh, puante an dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan mite chu Aigupta mite a khawngaihtîr a; chutichuan, an dil apiang an neihtîr zêl a. Tichuan, Aigupta mite chu an rawk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu Rameses khua ata an chhuak a, Sukkoth hmun thlengin an kal ta a, naupangte tiam lovin, mipa puitling hlîr nuai ruk lai kein an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah chuan mipui inpawlhsawp tam tak an kal ve bawk a; tin, ran rual tam tak, berâm leh bâwngte an chhawm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ram ata an ken chhuah chhang hmeh hmangin chhang, dawidim telh lohte chu an ur a; Aigupta ram ata chu hnawh chhuaha an awm avâng leh, an awm rei theih tâk lohva, ei tûr takngial pawh an inbuatsaih hman tâk loh avânga dawidim telh loh a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte Aigupta rama an awm chhûng chu kum zali leh kum sawmthum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum zali leh kum sawmthum a lo ral chuan, chumi ni ngei chuan heti hi a ni a, Lalpa mipuiho zawng zawngte chu Aigupta ram ata an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Aigupta ram ata anmahni a hruai chhuah avângin, Lalpa tâna zân serh tak ni tûr a ni a. Israela thlahte zawng zawngin, chhuan zawng zawng thlengin, chu zân chu Lalpa zân atân serh hle tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona hnênah, “Hei hi kalhlên thuruat dân tûr a ni ang: hnam dang chuan an ei ve tûr a ni lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />amaherawhchu, miin a chhiahhlawh, tangkaa a lei tawhate chu a serh i tansak tawh phawt chuan a ei ve thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hnam dang leh chhiahhlawh rawihte erawh chuan an ei tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />In khatah ei tûr a ni; pâwn lamah a sa rêng rêng ken chhuah tûr a ni lo va, a ruh rêng rêng pawh in titliak tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Israel-ho zawng zawngin an zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, hnam dang in hnêna awm hian Lalpa kalhlên hi tih ve a duh chuan, mipa zawng zawngte serhtan ni sela, tichuan rawn ti ve rawh se; ani chu chumi rama piang anga ngaih a ni ang. Amaherawhchu, serhtan loh mi chuan a ei hauh tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chumi rama piang leh, hnam dang in zînga awmte tân hian dân angkhat a awm tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Israela thlahte zawng zawng chuan chutiang chuan an ti a, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona thu a pêk ang ngei chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chumi ni ngei chuan, Lalpan Israela thlahte chu Aigupta ram ata mipuiho chu a hruai chhuak ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte zînga fa tîr zawng zawng, chhûl keu hmasa ber apiang, mihring pawh, sa pawh ka tân serhah in ruat tûr a ni; ka ta a ni e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Mosian mipuite hnênah chuan, “Vawiin, Aigupta ram ata bâwih ata in chhuah ni hi hre reng ang che u; kut chak takin Lalpan hemi hmun ata hi a hruai chhuah che u hi; chhang dawidim telh rêng rêng chu ei tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abib thla, vawiin ni hian in chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpan Kanaan-hote, Hit-hote, Amor-hote, Hiv-hote, Jebus-hote ram, khawizu leh hnute tui luanna ram, in thlahtute chhechhama pêk a tiamah khân a hruai thlen hunah che u chuan, hemi thla hian he rawngbâwlna hi in zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chu chhang dawidim telh loh in ei tûr a ni a; tin, a ni sarih ni chu Lalpa tân kût ni a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chuan chhang dawidim telh rêng rêng chu a awmin awm hlek suh se; in awmna hmunah rêng rêng dawidim pawh a awmin awm hlek bawk suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan in fate hnênah, ‘Aigupta ram ata kan lo chhuah lai khân Lalpan thil min lo tihsak vâng a ni e,’ tiin in hrilh tûr a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa dân chu in kâa a awm reng theih nân, in kutah in tân chhinchhiahna leh in mit inkârah hriat rengna tûr a ni ang; kut chak takin Lalpan Aigupta ram ata a hruai chhuah che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, he thuruat hi kum tin a hun takah in zâwm ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpan in hnênah leh in thlahtute hnêna chhechhama pêk a tiam tawh che u anga Kanaan-hote rama a hruai thlen che ua, a pêk hun che u chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chhûl keu hmasa ber apiang leh in ran piang thla hmasa ber apiang chu Lalpa tân in dah hrang zêl tûr a ni; a pate chu Lalpa ta tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabengtung piang hmasa ber apiang chu berâmnovin in tlan tûr a ni ang; in tlan duh loh erawh chuan a nghâwng chu in titliak tûr a ni; tin, in fate zînga mipa piang hmasa ber apiang chu in tlan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, nakin lamah te in faten, ‘Hei engtizia nge ni le?’ tia an la rawn zawh hun che u chuan nangnin an hnênah, ‘Kut chak takin Lalpan Aigupta ram ata bâwiha kan awm kha min hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Pharaoan kan chhuah thu a tihkhirh êm avângin, Lalpan Aigupta rama fa tîr zawng zawng, mihring fa tîr apiang leh ran piang hmasa ber apiang chu a tihlum vek a. Chuvângin, a pa, chhûl keu hmasa ber apiang hian Lalpa hnênah kan inthawi a nih hi; amaherawhchu, kan fapate zînga fa tîr zawng zawngte chu kan tlan a ni,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, in kutah in tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang, in mit leh mit inkâra chal hrênnate nên; kut chak takin Lalpan Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuak ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Pharaoan mite chu a chhuahtîr phal veleh chuan, Pathianin Philistia-ho ram lamah chuan, a hnai zâwk nain a hruai lo va; Pathianin, “Indonate an hmuhin an inchhîr ang a. Aigupta ramah an kîr leh hlauh dah ang e,” a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Pathianin mite chu Tuifinriat Sen lam panin thlalêr lamah a hruai kikawi ta zâwk a; tin, Israela thlahte chu Aigupta ram ata chu inrâlring rengin an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Josefa ruhte chu a chhawm a; Israela thlahte kha, “Pathianin a la rawn kan ngei ngei ang che u a; tin, ka ruhte hi heta ta hi in zâwn chho tûr a ni,” tiin chhia a lo chhamtîr tlat tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Sukkoth hmun ata chu an chhuak a, thlalêr tawntirh Etham hmunah an riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan chhûn laiah chuan chhûm dingin an hma a hruai a, zânah chuan anmahni ên tûrin mei alh dingin an hma a hruai a; chhûn leh zân an kal theih zêlna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chhûna chhûm ding leh zâna mei alh ding chuan mipui chu a kalsan ngai hauh lo a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte hnênah hian thu sawi rawh khai, kîr leh sela, Migdol hmun leh tuipui inkâr Pi-hahiroth hmun bul, Baal-Zephon hmun bulah chuan riak rawh se; chumi dep tuipui kamah chuan riak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Pharaoan Israela thlahte chungchâng thûah, ‘Ram lakah an mangang ta zet mai le, thlalêrah an tâng ta,’ a ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, keiin Pharaoa thinlung chu ka tikhauh ang a; tichuan, anmahni chu a ûm ang a; tin, keiin Pharaoa lakah leh a sipaiho zawng zawng lakah chuan chawimawina chu ka hlawh ang; tichuan, Aigupta miten kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” tiin. Tin, chutiang chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mite chu an tlân bo zo ta tih Aigupta lal chu an hrilh a; tin, Pharaoa thinlung leh a chhiahhlawhte thinlung chu a inlamlêt leh ta a; tichuan, “Israel mite kan rawngbâwl lai kan chhuahtîr ta ngawt mai hi, engtiziaa hetianga ti ta nge maw kan nih chu le?” an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an tawlailîr an buatsaih a, a mite chu a hnênah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, tawlailîr zaruk ṭha ṭhiau leh Aigupta rama tawlailîr zawng zawng, an zaa chunga hotute nên a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Aigupta ram lal Pharaoa thinlung chu a tikhauh va, Israela thlahte chu a ûm ta a; Israela thlahte lah chu induh takin an chhuak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite chuan sakawr zawng zawng leh Pharaoa tawlailîrte leh, a sakawr chung chuang mite leh a sipaihote nên chuan an ûm a; tin, Pi-hahiroth hmun bul, Baal-Zephon hmun depa tuipui kama an riak chu an va ûm pha ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoan a va pan hnaih chuan Israela thlahte chu an han dâk a; tin, ngai teh, Aigupta mite chuan an lam chu an rawn pan phei a. Tichuan, an hlau ta êm êm mai a, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa chu an au ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Mosia hnênah, “Aigupta ramah khân thlân a awm loh avângin em ni thlalêrah hian thi tûra min hruai chhuah ni? Eng vângin nge ni hetianga min ti tûra Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuah ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta ramah pawh khân, ‘Aigupta mite rawngbâwl hian kan awm mai ang e,’ tiin i hnênah khân kan sawi rêng lo vem ni? Thlalêra thih tlaw ngawt mai te ai chuan Aigupta mite rawng kha lo bâwl ta ila a ṭha zâwk tûr,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mosian mipuite hnênah chuan, “Hlau suh u. Awm hle hle mai ula, Lalpa chhandamna, vawiina a thawhsak tûr che u hi en ngawt mai rawh u. Vawiina Aigupta mi in hmuhte hi kumkhuain in hmu leh dâwn tawh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpan a dosak ang che u a, nangni chu in awm hle hle mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah chuan, “Eng vângin nge maw mi auh le? Israela thlahte hi kal zêl tûrin hrilh ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, nang pawhin i tiang kha han la la, tuipui chungah khân lek la, tui chu lo inṭhen rawh se. Tichuan, tuipui chhûng lei chârah Israela thlahte chu an kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, keiin Aigupta mite thinlung chu ka tikhauh ang a; tichuan, an ûm zêl ang. Tin, Pharaoa lakah leh, a sipaiteho zawng zawng lakah leh, a tawlailîrte lakah leh a sakawr chung chuang mite lakah chuan chawimawina chu ka hlawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Pharaoa lakah leh, a tawlailîrte lakah leh a sakawr chung chuang mite laka chawimawina ka hlawh hunah chuan, Aigupta miten kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Pathian vântirhkoh, Israel mite hma hruai ṭhîn kha an hnung lamah a insawn ta a; tin, chhûm ding kha an hma lam ata a insawn a, an hnung lamah a ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite leh Israel mite inkârah a lo tla ta a; tichuan, lehlam tan chhûm leh zân thim a ni a, lehlam tan zân chu a tiêng thung a; chutichuan, zankhuain a tu lam mah mah an inpan lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chuan tuipui chungah a kut a han phar a; tin, Lalpan zankhuain khawchhak thli na takin a rawn tlehtîr a, tuipui chu a nem kîrtîr a, tuipui chu lei chârah a chantîr a; tin, tuite chu a lo inṭhen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu tuipui chhûng lei chârah chuan an kal ta a; tin, tuite chu an ding lampangah leh an vei lampangah chuan an tân bang a lo ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite chuan an ûm a, Pharaoa sakawr zawng zawngte leh a tawlailîrte leh a sakawr chung chuang mite chuan tuipui chhûngah chuan an ûm lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, khawfingchah veleh Lalpan Aigupta mite chu mei alh ding leh chhûm dingah chuan a zuk timangang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An tawlailîr kete chu a thlawnsak a, an khalh chak thei ta lo va; chutichuan, Aigupta mite chuan, “Israel-hote hi i tlânsan ang u; Lalpan an lama ṭangin he mite hi Aigupta mite a dopui a nih hi,” an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Aigupta mite, an tawlailîrte, an sakawr chung chuang mite chu tuiin a rawn chîm leh theihna tûrin, i kut kha tuipui chungah han phar rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Mosian tuipui chungah chuan a kut chu a han phar a; tin, khua a vâr veleh tuipui chu a luan pângngaiin a luang leh ta a, Aigupta mite chu an tlân kîr leh lai takin. Tichuan, Lalpan Aigupta mite chu tuipui chhûngah chuan a paih thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, tuite chu a luang leh ta a; tichuan, tawlailîrte leh sakawr chung chuang mite, tuipuia ûm lûttu, Pharaoa sipaiho zawng zawngte lam chuan tuiin a chîm pil ta vek a; pakhat mah chhuak rêng rêng an awm hauh lo mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israela thlahte erawh chu tuipui chhûng lei chârah chuan an kal vek a; tin, tuite chu an ding lampangah leh an vei lampangah chuan an tân bang a lo ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutiang chuan a ni, Lalpan Israel-hote chu chumi ni chuan Aigupta mite kut ata a chhan chhuah ni; tin, Israel-hote chuan Aigupta mi thite chu tuipui kamah chuan an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hote chuan Lalpan Aigupta mite chunga thil ropui tak a tih chu an hmu a; tin, mipuite chuan Lalpa chu an ṭih a, Lalpa leh a chhiahhlawh Mosia chu an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia leh Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa chawimawiin he hla hi an sa a, an sawi dual dual a: “ Lalpa chawimawiin hla ka sa ang, Ropui takin a hneh tâk hi! Sakawr leh a chunga chuang chu tuipuiah a paih thla ta a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka chakna leh ka hla a ni, Ani chu ka chhandamna a lo ni ta bawk a; Ka Pathian a ni a, amah chu ka fak ang; Ka pa Pathian a ni a, amah chu a chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chu indo mi a ni; A hming pawh Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pharaoa tawlailîrte leh a sipaihote chu tuipuiah a paih thla ta a; Tin, a sipai hotu thlante pawh Tuifinriat Senah an tla hlum zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui thûk takin a chîm zo ta; Lung angin tui thûk takah an pil ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I kut ding lam chu, aw Lalpa , thiltihtheihnain a ropui a, I kut ding lam chuan, aw Lalpa , hmêlma chu a tisawm ta dep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I ropuina nasa tak chuan nangmah dotute chu i tiboral vek a; I thinrim i rawn hrithla a, buhpâwl ang maiin an kâng ral zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I hnâra thawin tuite chu a lo intiang a, Tuite chu englo dah khâwm thûr angin a ding luah a; Tuifinriat chhûng daiha tui thûk takte chu a lo khal zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmêlma chuan, ‘Ka ûm ang a, ka ûmphâk ngei ang, Râllâk sum chu ka sem ang; Anmahniah chuan ka châk daih ka hmu tawh ang. Ka khandaih ka phawi ang a, ka kutin anmahni chu ka tiboral ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I thli chu i han tlehtîr ta mai a, tuifinriatin a chîm pil ta vek a; Tui thûk takahte chuan suan angin an pil ta vang vang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , pathiante zîngah hian nang ang hi tu nge awm le? Thianghlimna lama ropui leh, fak tlâk nihna lama zahawm leh thilmakte ti ṭhîn hi, Nang ang tu nge awm le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangin i kut ding lam i han phar a, Leiin anmahni chu a lem zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangin i khawngaihnain mipui i tlante kha i hruai a; I chênna thianghlimah chuan i chaknain i hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tinrêngin an hria a, an khûr thlu zo va, Philistia rama chêngte chu thlaphânnain a man ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Edom rama hotute chuan mak an ti hle a; Moab mi chakte chu khurhnain a rawn man a; Kanaan rama awm zawng zawngte chu an tui zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭihna leh hlauhnain a tlâkbuak a; I bân chaknain lung ang maiin a tingawi hle hle a, Aw Lalpa , i mite an kai vek hma loh chuan, mi i leite an kai vek hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangin anmahni chu i hruai lût ang a, I roluah tlângah chuan i phun ang, Aw Lalpa , nangin i awmna tûra hmun i buatsaihah chuan, Aw Lalpa , hmun thianghlim, i kut ngeiin a lo dinnaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan chatuanin ro a rêl tawh ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pharaoa sakawrte chu a tawlailîrte chawpin a sakawr chung chuang mite nên chuan tuipuiah an lût thla a, Lalpan tuifinriat tuite chuan a vûr ta a; Israela thlahte erawh chu tuipui chhûng lei chârah chuan an kal vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Miriami, Arona farnuin khuangtê a keng a; tin, hmeichhia zawng zawngin khuangtê kenga lâmin an zui chhuak ve ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Miriami chuan, “ Lalpa chawimawiin hla sa rawh u, ropui takin a hneh tâk hi! Sakawr leh a chunga chuang chawpin tuipuiah a paih thla ta a,” tiin hlain a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian Israel-hote chu Tuifinriat Sen ata a hruai chhuak a, Sur thlalêr lam panin an chhuak ta a; tin, thlalêrah chuan ni thum zet an kal a, tui an hmu zo ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Mara hmun an va thleng a, Mara hmuna tuite chu a lo khâk avâng chuan an in thei lo va; chuvâng chuan a hmingah Mara vuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, mipuite chu, “Eng nge ni kan in dâwn le?” tiin Mosia chungah an phunnawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Lalpa chu a au va; tin, Lalpa chuan thing pakhat hi a han kawhhmuh a, chu chu tuiah chuan a zuk paih lût a; tichuan, tui chu a lo tui ta a. Chutah chuan thuruat leh rorêlna a siamsak a; chutah chuan anmahni fiahna a siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“ Lalpa i Pathian aw hi ngun taka i ngaihthlâka, a mit hmuha ṭha a tih zâwngte i tiha, a thupêkte i ngaihsâna, a thuruat zawng zawngte i pawm chuan, Aigupta mite chunga hri ka lêntîr tâk angte kha i chungah rêng rêng ka lêntîr ve lo vang. Kei Lalpa a tidamtu che ka nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Elim hmun an va thleng a, chutah chuan tuihna nei sâwm leh pahnih leh tûm thing sawmsarih a awm a; tin, chuta tui kamahte chuan an riak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Elim hmun ata chu an chhuak a, tin, Israela thlahte pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan Aigupta ram ata an chhuah achin thla hnihna, ni sâwm leh ni nga niin Elim hmun leh Sinai tlâng inkâra Sin thlalêr an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, thlalêrah chuan Israela thlahte pung khâwmho zawng zawng chu Mosia chungah leh Arona chungah an lo phunnawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan an hnênah, “Aigupta rama sa bêl bula kan ṭhut lai te leh chhang khamkhawp kan ei lai te khân Lalpa kutah lo thi ta zâwk mai ila aw! Mipui pung khâwmho zawng zawngte hi thlalêrah hian rilṭâma tihhlum tûrin min hruai chhuak a nih hi le,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai rawh, vân aṭangin in tân chhang ka rawn sûrtîr ang e; tichuan, mipuiten ni tin ni khat atâna chanvo tâwk chauh zêl chu va chhar ṭhîn rawh se, ka dân an zâwm nge zâwm lo ka fiah theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, a ni ruk ni chuan an va chhara chu an buatsaih ang a; tin, ni tina an chhar leh hnih zêl a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Aronan Israela thlahte zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Tlai lamah chuan Lalpa chu Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu ngei che u a ni tih in hre dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, zîngah pawh Lalpa ropuina chu in hmu dâwn e; Lalpa chunga in phunnawina kha a lo hriat tâk hi. Keinite chu eng nge kan niha, kan chunga in phunnawi mai ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “Chûng chu in la hria ang, Lalpan tlai lama sa ei tûr a pêk che ua, zîng lama chhang kham khawp a pêk hunah che u chuan; Lalpa chuan a chunga in phunnawina kha a hre reng si a. Keinite chu eng nge kan nih ni? Kan chunga phunnawi in ni hlei nêm, Lalpa chunga phunnawi asin in nih ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Arona hnênah, “Israela thlah pung khâwm zawng zawng hnênah hian, ‘ Lalpa kiang hnaiah lo kal rawh u, in phunnawinate kha a lo hriat tâk hi,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Israela thlah pung khâwm zawng zawng hnêna Aronan thu a sawi lai tak chuan, thlalêr lam chu an han thlîr a; ngai teh, Lalpa ropuina chu chhûmah a lo lang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israela thlahte phunnawinate kha ka lo hria a. An hnênah, ‘Tlai lamah chuan sa in ei ang a, a tûkah chuan chhang kham khawp zetin in ei tawh ang. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa in Pathian chu ka ni tih in hria ang, a ti e,’ ti ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, tlai lamah chuan vahmîm an lo thlâwk chho chiam a, an riahhmun chu a dâp ta dul a; tin, a tûkah chuan an riahhmun vêlah chuan dai a lo tla dup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, dai tla chu a han hul veleh chuan, ngai teh, thlalêr lei chungah chuan thil pêr tê tê, vûr thal tiat lek lek tê hi a lo awm tuar mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu chu Israela thlahten an han hmuh chuan, “Eng nge maw ni chu le?” an ti hlawm a; eng nge ni tih an hre si lo va. Tin, Mosian an hnênah, “ Lalpan chhang in ei atâna a pêk che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hei hi a ni Lalpan , ‘Mi tinin mahni kham khawp ṭheuh chhar ulangin, mi pakhat tân omer khat zêl, in chhûngkaw mihring awm zât ang zêlin in chhar tûr a ni; mi tinin in puan in chhûnga awmte tân chuan in chhar tûr a ni,’ tia thu a pêk chu ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan chutiang chuan an ti a, ṭhenkhatin an chhar tam a, ṭhenkhatin an chhar tlêm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, omer-in an han teh a, a chhar tamin a chuangin a nei lo va, a chhar tlêmin a tlachham hek lo; mi tinin mahni kham tâwk an chhar ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Mosian an hnênah, “Tu mahin a tûk lam atân chuan khêk suh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Mosia thu chu an pawm duh lo va. ṭhenkhat chuan a tûk lam atân an khêk a; tichuan, a lo lung a, a lo rimchhe ta a. Chuvângin, Mosia chu an chungah a thinrim ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, tûk tin mi tinin mahni kham khawp lek zêlin an chhar ṭhîn a; ni a lo tlângsân veleh a tui ral vek ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a ni ruk ni chuan chhang chu a leh hnih, mi pakhat tân omer hnih zêl an chhar a. Tin, chûng pung khâwmho rorêltu zawng zawngte chuan Mosia an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Chu chu alâwm Lalpan , ‘Naktûk hi chawlh dêr ni, Lalpa tâna Chawlhni thianghlim a ni e,’ a tih chu. Chuvângin, a âwma âwm in duh leh âwm ulangin, a chhuma chhum in duh leh chhûm rawh u; chumi bâng chu a tûk lam atân in dah dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Mosia hrilh ang chuan a tûk lam atân an dah hrang ta a; chu chu a rimchhe lo va, a lung hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian, “Vawiin chuan hei hi ei rawh u, vawiin hi Lalpa tân Chawlhni a nih hi; vawiinah zawng leia tla in hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng chuan in va chhar ṭhîn ang a; a ni sarih ni erawh chu Chawlhni a ni a, chhar tûr rêng rêng a awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a ni sarih ni chuan mi ṭhenkhat chu chhar tûrin an va chhuak a, chhar tûr rêng rêng an hmu zo ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Ka thupêkte leh ka dânte hi eng chen nge maw pawm duh loh in tum ni aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpan Chawlhni a pêk che u hi hre ta che u maw le! Chuvângin, ni ruk niin ni hnih tla tâwk tûr chhang a pe che u a nih hi. Mi tin mahni hmun ṭheuhvah awm hle hle mai rawh u; ni sarih ni chuan tu mah an awmna hmun ata chhuak hauh suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, mite chu ni sarih ni chuan an châwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Israela chhûngte chuan chumi hmingah chuan Manna an vuah a. Koriander mu ang maia vâr ser a ni a; han ei chuan chhangpêr, khawizu nêna siam ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “Hei hi alâwm Lalpan , ‘Hei hi in thlahte thlengin omer khat vawng ṭha rawh u; Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah lai che ua, thlalêra ka châwm ṭhinna che u chhang chu an rawn hmuh theih nân,’ tia thu a pêk chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosian Arona hnênah, “Bêl va la langin, manna hi omer khat khung rawh, in thlahte thlenga vawn reng tûrin Lalpa hmaah dah ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang chuan Arona chuan vawn reng tûrin Thuhriattîrna hmaah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israela thlahte chuan mihring chênna ram an thlen hma loh chuan, kum sawmli chhûng chu manna an ei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Omer khat hi epha hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat hu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte pung khâwmho zawng zawng chu Sin thlalêr ata an chhuak leh a, Lalpa thupêk angin riah bi nei thliah thliaha riakin, Rephidim-ah an inkhuar a; amaherawhchu, chutah chuan mipuite in tûr tui a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, mipuite chuan Mosia chu an bei ta a, “Tui in tûr min pe rawh,” an ti a. Tin, Mosian an hnênah, “Engati nge mi beih mai? Eng vângin nge Lalpa in fiah ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutah chuan mipuite chu tuihâlin an awm a ni a; tichuan, mipuite chu Mosia chungah an phunnawi a, “Eng vângin nge kan fanaute leh kan rante nên hian tuihâla tihhlum tûrin Aigupta ata min hruai chhuah ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “Hêng mipuihote hi engtin nge ka tih ang? Lunga mi den hlum hial pawh an duh âwm hi,” tiin Lalpa chu a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Mipuiho hma lamah kal langin, Israela thlahte upaho ṭhenkhat hruai ve ang che; tin, i tiang, hmâna lui i vuakna kha keng langin, kal rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh, Horeb-a lungpui chungah sâwn i hmaah ka lo ding ang a; tin, lungpui chu i han vua ang a; tichuan, mipuite in tûr tui chu a lo luang chhuak mai ang,” a ti a. Tin, Mosian Israela thlahte upaho mit hmuhah chuan chutiang chuan a han ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hmun hmingah chuan Masa leh Meriba a vuah a; Israela thlahten an beih avâng leh, “Kan zîngah hian Lalpa chu a awm nge maw awm lo le?” tia Lalpa chu an fiah avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Rephidim hmunah chuan Amalek-hovin Israel-ho chu an rawn bei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosian Josua hnênah, “Kan zînga mi hi thlang chhuak la, Amalek-ho hi va bei rawh u khai. Naktûkah tlâng chhîpah khian Pathian tiang kengin ka lo ding ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian a hnêna a sawi ang chuan Josua chuan a ti a, Amalek-ho chu a va bei ta a. Tin, Mosia leh Arona leh Hura chu tlâng chhîpah an han lâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Mosian a bân a phar veleh Israel-hote chuan an hneh ṭhîn a; a bân a lâk thlâk veleh Amalek-hote chu an chak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Mosia bânte chu a lo kham ta a; tichuan, lung an la a, a bulah chuan an dah a, chutah chuan a ṭhu ta a. Tin, Arona leh Hura chuan a kut chu an dâwmsak ta a, pakhatin lehlam a dâwm a, pakhatin a lehlam a dâwm a; chutichuan, ni tlâk thlengin a kutte chu a awm ngaiin a awm ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Josua chuan Amaleka leh a hote chu khandaih hriamin a tudawl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Hemi thu hi hriat reng atân lehkhabuah ziak la, Josua hriatah sawi chhuak ṭhîn ang che; vân hnuaiah hian Amalek-ho hi an awm tih pawh hriat loh khawpin ka tichimit hlauh dâwn e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Mosian maichâm a siam a, a hmingah chuan Jehova-nisi a vuah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Lalpan chhia a chham ta: Lalpan chhuan awm chhûng zawng zawng chuan Amalek-ho chu a do vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jethroa, Midian rama puithiam, Mosia puzawn chuan Pathianin Mosia leh a mi Israel-hote thil a tihsakzia zawng zawngte leh, Lalpan Israel-hote chu Aigupta ram ata a hruai chhuah ziate chu a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Mosia puzawn Jethroa chuan Mosia nupui Zipori, Mosian a hâwntîr kha, a fapate pahnih nên a hruai a; chu mi pakhat hming chu Gersoma a ni a, “Mi rama awm ka nih avângin,” a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, pakhata hming chu Eliezera a ni, “Ka pa Pathian chu mi ṭanpuitu a ni a, Pharaoa khandaih lak ata chu mi chhan him tâk avângin,” a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, Mosia puzawn Jethroa chu Mosia fapate leh a nupui nên, Mosia hnênah thlalêra a riahna Pathian tlângah chuan an va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Mosia hnênah, “Kei i puzawn Jethroa hi i nupui nên, i fa pahnih nên kan lo kal e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu a puzawn hmuak tûrin a va chhuak a, chibai a va bûk a. Chanchin te an inzâwt a; tichuan, puan inah an lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Israel-ho avânga Pharaoa leh Aigupta-hote chunga a tih zia zawng zawngte leh, kawng laka hrehawm an tuarzia zawng zawngte leh, Lalpan anmahni a chhanhimzia te chu Mosia chuan a puzawn chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Israel-hote chu Aigupta-ho lak ata a chhan hima, anmahni thil a lo tihsak tâkzia leh, an chunga a ṭhatna zawng zawng avângte chuan Jethroa chu a lâwm êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Jethroa chuan, “ Lalpa , Aigupta-ho lak ata leh Pharaoa lak ata chhanhimtu che u chu fakin awm rawh se; ani chuan Aigupta-ho thu hnuaia awm mipuite chu a chhan him tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnah chuan Lalpa chu pathian dang zawng zawngte ai chuan a ropui zâwk tih ka hre ta; a ni, Israel-te laka chapo takte chungah chuan a lo lang a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mosia puzawn Jethroa chuan hâlral thilhlan leh Pathian tâna inthawina tûrte a va la a; tin, Arona leh Israel upaho zawng zawngte chu Mosia puzawn hnênah chuan Pathian hmaah chhang ei tûrin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûkah chuan Mosia chu mipuite ro rêl tûrin a ṭhu a; tin, mipuite chu zîng ata tlai thlengin Mosia kiang vêlah chuan an ding reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Mosia puzawnin chutia mipuite tâna thil a tih zawng zawng chu a han hmuh chuan, “Mipuite hi thil eng nge maw i tihsak chu le? Engtizia nge nangmah chauh hi i ṭhut renga, zîng ata tawh tlai thlenga mipui zawng zawngte hi i kiang vêla an din reng?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Mosian a puzawn hnênah, “Mipuite hi Pathian râwn tûrin ka hnênah an lo kal a ni ber e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thu eng emaw an neih chuan ka hnênah hian an lo kal ṭhîn a; tichuan, keiin a ṭhenawmpa nêna an thu chu ka lo rêlsak a; tin, Pathian remruat leh a dânte chu ka lo hriattîr ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Mosia puzawn chuan a hnênah, “I thiltih dân chu a ṭha lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang leh hêng i hnêna mipui awmte hi in intichau zo ngei ang maw le. He hna hi i tân a hautak lutuk a ni; nangmah chauhva han tlin chi a ni hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thu hi ngaithla teh khai; rem ka han ruatpui ang chia, i hnênah Pathian awm rawh se: nang hi Pathian hmaah mipui aiawhin awm langin, an thubuaite chu Pathian hnênah thlen ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, thuruatte leh dân chu i zirtîr ang a, an awm dân tûr leh an tih dân tûrte chu i kawhhmuh zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu bâkah, mipui zîng ata mi hman tlâk deuh deuh, Pathian ṭih mite, mi dik takte, hlâwkna dik lo tak haw mite thlang chhuak langin; chutiang mite chu sâng pâwl chunga hotuah te, za pâwl chunga hotuah te, sawmnga pâwl chunga hotuah te, sâwm pâwl chunga hotuah te i ruat dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûngte chuan eng lai pawhin mite ro rêlsak rawh se. Tin, heti hi a ni ang, thu lian deuh apiang chu i hnênah an rawn thlen ṭhîn ang a, thu tê tham erawh chu anmahniin rêl rawh se. Chutichuan, i tân a lo awlsam zâwk ang a, anni chuan an chhâwk zâng hle dâwn che nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutianga i tiha, Pathian pawhin thu a pêk che chuan i tlin thei ang a; tichuan, hêng mipuiho zawng zawngte pawh hi lungawi takin mahni awmna lamah an ṭîn thei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia chuan a puzawn thusawi chu a pawm a, a sawi ang zawng zawng chuan a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Israel-ho zawng zawng zing ata chu mi hman tlâk deuh deuh a thlang chhuak a, mipui chunga hotuah a siam a, sâng pâwl chunga hotuah te, za pâwl chunga hotuah te, sawmnga pâwl chunga hotuah te, sâwm pâwl chunga hotuah te a ruat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chûngte chuan eng lai pawhin mite ro an rêlsak ṭhîn a; thu lian deuh apiang chu Mosia hnênah an thlen ṭhîn a, thu tê tham erawh chu anmahnihovin an rêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chuan a puzawn chu a kaltîr a, a awmna ram lamah chuan a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israela thlahte Aigupta ram ata an chhuah achin a thla thumna, chumi ni tak chuan Sinai thlalêr an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rephidim hmun ata an chhuaha, Sinai thlalêr an va thlen chuan thlalêrah chuan an riak a; chutah chuan Israel-hote chu tlâng bulah chuan an riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu Pathian hnênah a han chho va; tichuan, Lalpa chuan tlâng aṭangin a bia a, a hnênah, “Jakoba chhûngte hnênah hetiang hian ti la, Israela thlahte hnênah pawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Aigupta-hote chunga ka tih ziate leh, mupui thlaa ka put che ua, ka hnêna ka hruai thlen zia che u hi in hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thu in awihtak zeta, ka thuthlung hi in pawm chuan khawvêl hnam zawng zawng zîngah hian ka tân ro thlan bîk in ni ang; khawvêl pum pui hi ka ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, ka tân puithiam chi, hnam thianghlim in ni ang,’ tiin hrilh ang che. Hêng thu hi Israela thlahte hnêna i sawi tûr chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Mosian mipui zînga upahote chu a ko khâwm a, Lalpa thupêk zawng zawngte chu a hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho zawng zawng chuan, “ Lalpa sawi zawng zawngte chu kan ti zêl ang e,” tiin a rualin an chhâng dual dual a. Tichuan, Mosian mipuite thusawi chu Lalpa a hrilh lehchhâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai teh, ka biak lai tak che mipuiin an hriat ve theiha, kumkhuaa i thu chu an âwih theihna tûrin chhûm chhah mupah i hnênah ka lo kal dâwn e,” a ti a. Tichuan, Mosian mipuite thusawi chu Lalpa a hrilh lehchhâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Mipuiho hnênah va kal la, vawiin leh naktûk hian anmahni chu tithianghlim ang che, an puante su fai sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni thum ni atân inpuahchah rawh se. A ni thum ni chuan mipuiho zawng zawng mit hmuhah Sinai tlângah chuan Lalpa a lo chhuk dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An hnênah, ‘Fîmkhur ula, tlângah khian han lâwn hauh suh ula, tlâng hmâwr pawh han dek hlek suh ang che u. Tu pawh tlâng han dek apiang chu tihhlum ngei ngei tûr an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kut rêng rêngin deh tûr a ni lo va, lunga den hlum ngei ngei tûr a ni, a nih loh leh, kah tlang tûr a ni ang; sa pawh, mihring pawh an nung lo vang,’ tiin hrilh la. Tawtawrâwt a rîk ruai ruai hunah chuan tlângah khian an lâwn chho tûr a ni, tiin mipuiho tân ri khamsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia chu tlâng ata mipuiho zîngah chuan a chhuk a, mipuite chu a tithianghlim a; tin, an puante an su fai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, mipuihote hnênah chuan, “A ni thum ni atân chuan inpuahchah rawh u; hmeichhe kiangah rêng rêng kal suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a ni thum ni zîngah chuan khawpuite a lo ri a, kâwlte a lo phe a, tlâng chhîpah chuan chhûm a lo zîng chhah mup a, tawtawrâwt ring êm êm maiin a lo ri a; tichuan, mipui riahhmuna awmho zawng zawng chu an khûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian mipuiho chu Pathian be tûrin riahhmun ata chu a hruai chhuak hlawm a; tlâng bulah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Sinai tlângah chuan Lalpa chu meia a lo chhuk avângin a khu phui ta mup a. Chu meikhu chu rawh tuina meikhu ang maiin a khu chho ngut ngut a; tichuan, tlâng pum pui chu a nghîng dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, tawtawrâwt ri chu a ring telh telh a, Mosia chuan thu a han sawi a, Pathian awin a lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chu Sinai tlâng, tlâng chhîpah chuan a lo chhuk a. Lalpa chuan Mosia chu tlâng chhîpah a ko chho va; tichuan, Mosia chu a han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Zuk chhuk langin, mipuite khu zuk zilh rawh; chuti lo zawng, Lalpa hmêl hmuh tumin an lo lût tlang mai ang e, mi tam tak an boral mai tûr a nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, puithiamho, Lalpa kianga lo kal vete pawh chu intithianghlim ve rawh se; chuti lo zawng, an chungah Lalpa chu a ṭuan mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Lalpa hnênah, “Mipuiho hi Sinai tlângah hian an lo chho thei hlei nêm; nangin, ‘Tlâng vêlah hian ri khamsak la, tithianghlim ang che,’ tiin thu min pe alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a hnênah, “Kal la, zuk chhuk tawh; tin, Arona nên lo chho leh ang che u. Amaherawhchu, puithiamho leh mipuiho chu Lalpa hnêna lo kal tumin lo lût tlang mai suh se; chuti lo zawng, an chungah a ṭuan mai tûr a nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia chu mipuite hnênah chuan a zuk kal a, chûng thû chu a zuk hrilh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathianin hêng thu zawng zawng hi a hrilh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kei, Lalpa i Pathian, Aigupta ram ata, bâwih ata hruai chhuaktu che u ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah lo chu pathian dang rêng rêng i nei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milem siam chawp leh thil a anpui rêng rêng, chung lam vâna mi emaw, hnuai lam leia mi emaw, lei hnuai lama tuia mi emaw, i tân i siam tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chûng chu chibai i bûk tûr a ni lo va, an rawng i bâwl tûr a ni hek lo. Kei, Lalpa i Pathian hi, Pathian thîkthuchhia, pate khawlohna avânga fate hrem ṭhîn, mi hawtute chu chhuan thumna leh chhuan lina thlenga hrem ṭhîn leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mi hmangaiha ka thupêkte pawmtu sâng tam takte chunga khawngaihna lantîr ṭhîn ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian hming chu i lam mai mai tûr a ni lo; Lalpa chuan a hming lam mai mai chu thiam loh chantîr lohvin a chhuah dâwn si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chawlhni hi thianghlim taka serh tûr a ni tih hre reng rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûngin i thawk tûr a ni a, i hna zawng zawng chu i thawk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a ni sarih ni erawh chu Lalpa i Pathian tân Chawlhni a ni e. Chumi ni chuan hna rêng rêng i thawk tûr a ni lo: nang pawhin, i fapa pawhin, i fanu pawhin, i bâwihpa pawhin, i bâwihnu pawhin, i ran pawhin, i ina hnam dang pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûngin Lalpan lei leh vân te, tuifinriat leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte chu a siam a; tin, a ni sarih ni chuan a châwl ta si a. Chuvângin, Lalpan Chawlhni chu mal a sâwm a, a tithianghlim ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh; tichuan, Lalpa i Pathianin ram a pêkah che hian i dam rei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tual i that tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I uire tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I ru tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I vêngte chungah hretu derah i insiam tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I vêngte chhûngte chu i awt tûr a ni lo va, i vêngte nupui chu i awt tûr a ni lo, a bâwihpa emaw, a bâwihnu emaw, a bâwngpa emaw, a sabengtung emaw, i vêngte ta rêng rêng chu eng mah i awt tûr a ni lo,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawngte chuan khawpui ri te, kâwlphe te, tawtawrâwt ri te, tlâng khu te chu an hmu a; tin, mipuiin an han hmuh chuan an khûr a, hla takah an ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia hnênah, “Nangmân kan hnênah hian thu sawi zâwk teh khai, kan lo ngaithla ang e; amaherawhchu, Pathian zawngin kan hnênah thu sawi tawh teh suh se; chuti lo zawng, kan thi mai dah ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan mipuite hnênah chuan, “Hlau suh u; Pathianin a rawn fiah che u a nih hi, in mit hmuhah ṭihbaiawma a awmna hi in sual lohna tûrin a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu hla takah an la ding reng a, Mosia chuan Pathian awmna thim chhah mup kiang chu a va pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Israela thlahte hnênah hetiang hian va sawi rawh: ‘Nangmahni ngeiin hei vân aṭanga ka rawn biakzia che u in hre tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian dang rêng rêng chu ka kiangah chuan in rawn nei tûr a ni lo; tangkaraw pathiante emaw, rangkachak pathiante emaw in tân in siam tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka tân lei maichâm i siam tûr a ni a, chutah chuan i berâmte leh i sebâwngte chu i hâlral thilhlanahte leh i remna inthawi nânte i hlân ṭhîn tûr a ni. Hmun tinah ka hming ka hriattîrna apiangah chuan i hnênah ka lo kal ṭhîn ang a, mal ka rawn sâwm ṭhîn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, lung maichâm mi siamsak dâwn chuan lung chherin i siam tûr a ni lo ve; i hriamhrei chu i hman hlauh zawngin i tibawlhhlawh a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka maichâm lâwn chhohna rahkaahte chuan lâwn pawh i lâwn chho tûr a ni lo ve, saruaka i awm a lan lohna tûrin,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, hêngte hi a ni an hnêna rorêl dân tûr i hriattîr tûrte chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebrai mi, chhiahhlawhah lo lei ang la, kum ruk rawng a bâwl ang a; tin, a kum sarih kum chuan intlan lo pawhin a chhuak mai thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah ngawta lo lût a nih chuan amah ngawtin a chhuak leh mai ang; nupui nei a nih chuan a nupui pawh chu a chhuak tel ve bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A puin nupui lo neihsak sela; tin, fanu emaw, fapa emaw lo hrinsak sela; a nupui leh a fate chu a pu ta an ni ang a, ani erawh chu amah ngawtin a chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, bâwih chuan, ‘Ka pu te, ka nupui te, ka fa te hi ka hmangaih êm mai a; ka chhuak duh lo ve,’ a tih tlat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a puin Pathian hnênah hruai sela, kawngkâah emaw, kawngka biangah emaw hruai sela, a puin a beng chu thir zumin vit sela; tichuan, kumkhuain a rawng a bâwl tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miin a fanu chu bâwihnu atân hralh sela, chhiahhlawh mipate ang chuan a chhuak ve lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pu chuan a nupui atân lo hual sela, ani chuan a pu chu lo tilâwm leh thei ta si lo sela, a intlantîr leh tûr a ni, a lo bum avâng chuan hnam dangte hnêna zawrh leh theihna a nei hlek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a fapa tâna nupuia hualsak duh a nih chuan, fanute en ang bawkin a en tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nupui dang lo nei leh mah sela, a ei tûr sa te, a silhfên te, a nupui a nihna te kha a tihlêm chuansak tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu thil kawng thum chu a tih loh chuan tangka pe lovin a chhuak mai thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu pawhin mi lo vua sela, chu mi chu thi ta sela, tihhlum ve ngei ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, miin tum rêng vâng ni lova, Pathian chaltawhtîr a nih erawh chuan, a tlân luhna tûr hmun ka ruatsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, miin tum lui rêngin a ṭhenawm chu fin vervêkin thah tum sela, thi tûrin ka maichâm ata chu hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu pawh a nu emaw, a pa emaw vua apiang chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu pawh mihring rua zuar emaw, a la kawl lai ngei emaw an hmuh chuan, chu mi chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu pawh a nu emaw, a pa emaw ânchhia lawh apiang chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, mi lo inhnial sela, pakhat chuan lungtumin chhu sela emaw, a kuttumin chûm sela emaw, thih chu thi lo sela, amaherawhchu khumbetin tlûk phah sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />lo tho leh theiin tiang hawlin lo kal leh thei sela, a kut thlâktua chu chhuah tûr a ni. A hun sên hu kha erawh chu a rûl ang a, a dam feltîr viah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, miin a chhiahhlawh emaw, a bâwihnu emaw tiangin vua sela, a kutah chuan lo thi ta sela, amah chu hrem ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ni khat emaw, ni hnih emaw dam sela, hrem tûr a ni lo vang; a chhiahhlawh chu a sum leh pai a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, mi lo insual ta sela, hmeichhe nau pai vaw palh ang sela, a nau pai chu lo tla sela, chhiatna dang erawh chu awm lo sela, chu hmeichhe pasalin a ngen zât chu chawitîr ngei tûr a ni a; rorêltute ruat ang zât chu a pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chhiatna dang lo awm sela chuan nun aia nun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />mit aia mit, hâ aia hâ, kut aia kut, ke aia ke,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tihkan aia tihkan, hliam aia hliam, vuak aia vuak i tuartîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, miin a chhiahhlawh mit emaw, a bâwihnu mit emaw vuain, lo tichhe ta sela, a mit avâng chuan a chhuahtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a bâwihpa hâ emaw, a bâwihnu hâ emaw lo vuak balsak sela, a hâ avâng chuan a chhuahtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, sebâwngpain mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw lo si hlum ta sela, chu sebâwngpa chu lunga den hlum ngei tûr a ni a, a sa chu ei tûr a ni lo; sebâwngpa neitua erawh chu hrem loh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, sebâwngpa chuan tûn hma pawhin mi sîk lo hmang ṭhîn sela, a neitu chu lo hriattîr tawh bawk sela; nimahsela, khung duh chuang lovin, mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw lo si hlum ta sela, chu sebâwngpa chu lunga den hlum tûr a ni a, a neitu pawh chu tihhlum bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tlana tlan tûrin lo tuk zâwk sela erawh chuan, a nunna aiah chuan an tuk zât apiang chu tlan nân pêk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi fapa emaw, mi fanu emaw pawh lo si hlum ni sela, hetiang dân bawk hian rêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sebâwngpain bâwihpa emaw, bâwihnu emaw lo si hlum ta sela, an pu chu tangka sekel sawmthum a pe ang a; tin, sebâwngpa chu lunga den hlum tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, miin khuarkhurum chhîn lo hawng sela emaw, miin khuarkhurum lo siam sela emaw, lo chhîn lo sela, sebâwngpa emaw, sabengtung emaw lo tla ta sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />chu khuarkhurum neitu chuan a rûl tûr a ni; ani chuan chûng ran neitu chu tangka a pe ang a, anin ran thi chu a ruang a hlâwm thung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat sebâwngpain mi sebâwngpa lo si hlum sela, sebâwngpa dam zâwk chu an zuar ang a, a man chu an insem ang; tin, a thia pawh chu an insem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sebâwngpa chuan tûn hma pawhin mi sîk lo hmang ṭhîn sela, a neitu chuan khung duh si lo sela, sebâwngpa aiah chuan sebâwngpa vêk chu a pe ngei ngei tûr a ni a; tin, ran thi ruang chu a hlâwm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, miin sebâwngpa emaw, berâm emaw ru sela; tin, lo talhin emaw, lo zuar emaw ta sela, sebâwngpa pakhat aiah chuan sebâwngpa panga a chawi ang a, berâm pakhat aiah chuan berâm pali a chawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rûkru, mi ina lût chu lo manin lo vaw hlum ta sela, a vaw hlumtu chu a thisen chhuah ve tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Niin a rawn chhuah hnan hman erawh chuan a thisen chhuah ve tûr a ni ang (Rûkru chuan kim takin a pe kîr leh tûr a ni; pêk tûr a neih loh erawh chuan rûk a rûk avângin amah chu an zuar tûr a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rûkruin a thil rûk - sebâwngpa emaw, sabengtung emaw, berâm emaw - a nungin lo la nei reng sela, a leh hnih a chawi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miin mi lovah emaw, mi grêp huanah emaw a ran thlahin an huan thlai ei zawhtîr ta sela, ama lo ṭha ber emaw, ama grêp huan ṭha ber emawin a rûl leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mei chhuahin hlîng ṭawmte emaw lo manin, buhphalte emaw, buh ding lai emaw, lo emaw lo kâng ta vek sela, mei chhuahtu ngeia chuan a rûl ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miin a tangka emaw, a bungrua emaw a ṭhenawm vawntîr sela; tin, chumi in ata chu miin lo ru ta sela, rûkru chu an man chuan a leh hnih a chawi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rûkru chu an man si loh chuan, chumi in neitupa chu Pathian kiangah va kal sela, a ṭhenawmpa bungrua chu aman a lo lâk a nih leh nih loh va fiah rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawhchhiatna tawh phawt chu sebâwngpa thûah emaw, sabengtung thûah emaw, berâm thûah emaw, silhfên thûah emaw, thil eng pawh bo chungchâng thûah rêng rêng - miin, ‘Hei chu ka ta a ni,’ lo ti ta sela, an pahniha thubuai chu Pathian hnênah thlen tûr a ni; Pathianin thiam loh a chantîr zâwk apiang chuan a ṭhenawmpa lakah chuan a leh hnih a chawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miin sabengtung emaw, sebâwngpa emaw, berâm emaw, ran eng pawh a ṭhenawmpa lo enkawltîr sela; tin, lo thiin emaw, lo silin emaw, suamin emaw lo awm sela, tu mân hmu si suh sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ani chuan a ṭhenawmpa ran chu a khawih leh khawih loh thûah, an pahniha kârah chuan Lalpa hming chhâlin chhia a chham tûr a ni; tichuan, a neitu chuan chu chu a lo pawm ang a, ani chuan a rûl lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, rûksak ngei a nih chuan a neitu chu a rûl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sain seh sela, a them chu hriattîr nân rawn keng rawh se; chumi sa seh ai chu a rûl tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miin a ṭhenawmpa ran lo hawhsak sela, lo silin emaw, lo thi emaw ta sela, tin, a neitupa chu awm lo sela, a rûl ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A neitupa chu a awm ve reng erawh chuan a rûl tûr a ni lo. Man chawia hawh a nih erawh chuan an inhawh dân athû thû a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Miin nula, nupuia la hual loh chu lo thlêmin lo mutpui sela, a man pein a nupui atân a nei ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pain a neihtîr phal lul loh chuan nula man zah sum chu a pe rêng rêng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dawithiamnu rêng rêng i zuah tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu pawh ran mutpui apiang chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu pawh Lalpa hnênah chauh tih loh, pathian dang rêng rêng hnêna inthawi chu tihboral hlauh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hnam dang i sawisa tûr a ni lo va, i hnehchhiah tûr a ni hek lo; nangni pawh Aigupta ramah khân hnam dang in nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmeithai emaw, fahrah emaw in tirethei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anmahni chu in tihretheih vaiha, mi rawn auh phawt chuan, an mi auhna aw chu ka lo ngaithla ngei ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tichuan, ka thinur chu a ling phut mai ang a, khandaihin ka rawn tihlum ang che u; tin, in nupuite chu hmeithai an ni ang a, in fate pawh fahrahin an awm mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka miteho zînga mi in hnêna awm, retheite tangka i pûktîr chuan i leibatu angah i ngai tûr a ni lo va; a lakah a pung i phût tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I ṭhenawm silhfên chu lo hrênsak ta ang la, ni tlâk hmain i pe leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Inthuam nâna a neih chhun a ni a, a taksa tihlum nâna a puan a ni si a. Eng sinin nge a mut ang? Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, mi rawn auh chuan ka lo ngaithla ngei ang; kei zawng mi khawngaih thei tak ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian chu i hau tûr a ni lo va, i mite zînga rorêltute chu ânchhia i lawh tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I thlai thar hmasa ber leh i uain tui tla hmasa ber chu i hlân var tûr a ni. I fapa upa ber chu mi pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin i sebâwngpate leh i berâmte pawh chu i ti tûr a ni. Ni sarih chu a pui hnênah a awm ang a; a ni riat ni chuan mi pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ka tân mi thianghlim in ni tûr a ni. Rama sa seh rêng rêngte chu in ei tûr a ni lo va; ui hnênah in theh mai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuthang dik lo chu i sawi chhâwng mai mai tûr a ni lo. Hretu fel lo tak nihna tûrin mi suaksual zîngah chuan i kut chu rawlh ve suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil sual tih tumin mipui chu i zui tûr a ni lo va; thubuaiah pawh a tam lam, a dik lo zâwk lamah chuan i ṭang ve mai tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi rethei pawh a thubuaiah i ṭan bîk tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I hmêlma sebâwngpa emaw, a sabengtung emaw bo i hmuh chuan, a hnênah i khalh hâwnsak leh ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah hawtu che sabengtung a phurin a delh beh reng i hmuhin, puih duhna rêng nei lo mah la, i pui ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I mi rethei chu a thubuaiah dik lo takin i rêlsak tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thudik lovah zawng inthiarfihlîm daih rawh; tin, pawi sawi lo leh mi felte chu tihlum suh. Mi suaksualte chu thiam ka chantîr dâwn si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, thamna rêng rêng i la tûr a ni lo; thamna chuan khaw hmu lai mitte hi a tihdelsak ṭhîn a, mi fel thu chu a tihkhawlohsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnam dang i hnehchhiah tûr a ni lo; nangni pawh Aigupta ramah khân hnam dang in lo nih tawh avângin hnam dang rilru put dân chu in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum ruk chhûng chu i lovah buh tuh tûr a ni a, chuta a hâwng apiang chu khung zêl tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a kum sarih kum erawh chuan awmtîr la, dah tui rawh; tichuan, i mi retheiten an ei ve thei ang a; tin, an lâk bâng awm apiang chu ramsaten an ei ve dâwn nia. Chutiang bawkin i grêp huan leh i olive huan pawh i ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûngin i hna i thawk tûr a ni a, a ni sarih ni chuan i châwl tûr a ni a; tichuan, i bâwngpa emaw, i sabengtung emaw an lo châwl thei ang a, i bâwihnu fapate leh i hnam dangte pawh an lo hahdam ve thei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, in hnêna ka sawi zawng zawng hi ngaihven ula, pathian dangte hming rêng rêng chu lam suh u, in kâ aṭangin chhuah pawh chhuak suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kum khatah vawi thum ka tân kût i nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chhang dawidim telh loh kût i nei tûr a ni. Thu ka lo pêk tâk che ang khân, ni sarih chhûng chu chhang dawidim telh loh, Abib thlaa hun ruatah khân i ei tûr a ni (Khami thlaah a nih kha Aigupta ram ata i lo chhuah); tichuan, ka hmaah tu mah hi kut ruakin in lo lang tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, lova i tuh, i thawh rim rah hmasa ber, buhseng kût chu i nei tûr a ni; tin, kum ral veleh lovah i thawh rim rahte i khung vek hnuin pâwl kût i nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum khatah vawi thum i mipate zawng zawng chu Lalpa Pathian hmaah an rawn inlan ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tân inthawina sa thisen chu chhang dawidim telh nên chuan i rawn hlân tûr a ni lo; ka tân kûtna sathau chu zankhuain, a tûk thlengin awmtîr reng tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I lova thlai thar hmasa ber chu Lalpa i Pathian inah i rawn dah tûr a ni. Kêlno sa a pui hnute tuiin i chhûm tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, kawnga vêng zêl tûr che leh, hmun ka buatsaihah chuan hruai lût tûr chein i hmaah vântirhkoh ka rawn tîr dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama zai ngai zêl ulangin, a thusawi pawm thîn ang che u; a chungah hel suh u, in bawhchhiatnate chu a ngaidam duh dâwn si lo va; amahah chuan ka hming a awm a nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a thusawi i pawmsak takmeuhva, ka sawi apiang i tih zêl chuan i hmêlmate hmêlma chu ka ni ve ang a, i dote dova chu ka ni ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka vântirhkoh chuan i hma a hruai zêl ang a, Amor-hote, Hit-hote, Periz-hote, Kanaan-hote, Hiv-hote, Jebus-hote awmnaah chuan a hruai ang che; anni chu ka tiboral daih dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An pathiante chu chibai i bûk tûr a ni lo va, an rawng i bâwl tûr a ni hek lo, an thiltih angte chu i ti ve tûr a ni hek lo; i tichimit vek tûr a ni a, an lungphunte chu i tikeh sawm vek zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in Pathian rawng chu in bâwl tûr a ni; tichuan, i chhang leh i tui chu mal a sâwm ang a; tin, in zîng ata hri hi ka tikiang daih dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I ram chhûngah hian nauchhiat leh ching rêng an awm lo vang a; i dam chhûng nite chu ka tihtlingtlâksak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I hmaah chuan ka ṭihbaina ka tîr ang a, i kalna tûr rama mite zawng zawng chu ka timangang ang a; tichuan, i hmêlmate zawng zawng chu i hmaah ka tlânchhiattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, i hmaah khawinghal ka tîr ang a, chu chuan Hiv-hote, Kanaan-hote, Hit-hote chu i hmaah a ûm zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kum khat chhûng mai chuan ka hnawh chhuahsak lo vang che; chuti lo zawng, ram chu a lo ṭiau mai ang a, ramsate chu i tân a lo tam lutuk dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I lo puna ram chu i luah khah hma chuan, zawi zawiin ka hnawh chhuahsak hret hret zâwk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />I ramri chu Tuifinriat Sen aṭanga Philistia-ho tuipui thlengin, thlalêr aṭanga Lui thlengin ka khamsak ang che. Chumi rama awmte chu in kutah ka pe dâwn si a; tichuan, anmahni chu i hnawt chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An hnênah thu i thlung tûr a ni lo va, an pathiante hnênah pawh i thlung tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />I ram chhûngah an awm tûr a ni lo; chuti lo zawng, ka chungah hian an sualtîr dah ang che. An pathiante rawng i bâwl vaih zawngin i tân thang a ni ngei dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Mosia hnênah, “Nang nên, Arona nên, Nadaba nên, Abihua nên, Israel upa sawmsarih nên Lalpa hnênah lo chho ula, ralkhat aṭangin chibai rawn bûk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mosia chu amah chauhvin Lalpa hnênah lo kal sela, anniho erawh chu lo kal hnai suh se; mipuite pawh a hnênah chuan lo chho suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chu a zuk kal a, Lalpa thu zawng zawng leh rorêl dân tûr zawng zawng chu mipui hnênah a zuk sawi a; tin, mi zawng zawng chuan, “ Lalpa sawi zawng zawng chu kan ti ang e,” tiin a rualin an chhâng dual dual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpa thu zawng zawng chu a ziak vek a. Tin, a tûk zîng takah a tho va, tlâng bulah chuan maichâm a siam a; tin, lungphun sâwm leh pahnih, Israel hnam sâwm leh hnam hnih zâtin a phun bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte zînga tlangvâlte chu a tîr a, chu mite chuan Lalpa tân hâlrala thilhlante an hlân a, remna inthawiin sebâwngpatein an inthawi bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan chûng thisen zâtve chu a la a, maihûnahte a dah a; tin, thisen zâtve dang chu maichâmah a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, thuthlunna bu chu a la a, mipuite hriatah chuan a chhiar a. Anni chuan, “ Lalpan a sawi zawng zawng chu kan ti zêl ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosian thisen chu a la a, mipuite chu a theh a, “Hei hi Lalpan hêng thu zawng zawng chungchâng thûa in hnêna thu a lo thlun tawh, thuthlunna thisen a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia leh Arona leh Nadaba leh Abihua leh Israel upa sawmsarihte chu an han chho va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israela Pathian chu an han hmu a. Tin, a kephah hnuai chu sapphir lungrem ang mai, a thianzia chu vân thiang vek ang mai hi a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte zînga mi lianhote chungah chuan a kut a thlâk lo; tichuan, Pathian chu an hmu a, an eiin an in hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Tlângah hian ka hnênah lo chho la, lo awm rawh; tichuan, mipuite i zirtîr atâna lungphêka dân leh thupêk ka ziak chu ka lo pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh a rawngbâwltu Josua chu an tho va; tin, Mosia chu Pathian tlângah chuan a han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan upate hnênah chuan, “In hnêna kan lo kal hma chuan hetah hian min lo nghâk reng ang che u. Ngai teh u, Arona leh Hura in hnêna an awm hi. Tu pawhin thubuai eng emaw in neih chuan an hnênah hian in lo kal ṭhîn dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia chu tlângah chuan a han chho va, chhûmin tlâng chu a chîm ta mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ropuina chu Sinai tlângah chuan a awm ta reng a, chhûm chuan ni ruk chhûng chu a chîm a. Tin, a ni sarih ni chuan chhûm aṭangin Mosia chu a han ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte mit hmuhah chuan Lalpa ropuina lan dân chu, tlâng chhîpa thil kan ral hmang mei ang mai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu chhûm zîngah chuan a va lût a, tlângah chuan a han lâwn a. Tin, Mosia chu tlângah chuan ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a han awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia chu a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte hnênah thu va sawi la, ka hnênah thil rawn hlân rawh se. An thinlunga châk taka pe apiangte pêk chu ka tâna thilhlanah in la tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêngte hi a ni an hnên aṭanga hlan tûra in lâk tûrte chu: rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />la dumpâwl te, la sen duk te, la sen lâr te, la zai sîn te, kêl hmul te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, berâmpa vun chhum sen te, savun ṭha chi vun te, thingri thing te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />khâwnvâr atân hriak te, hriak thih mi atân leh hâl tûr rimtui tak atân englo rimtui te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />puithiam kawr leh kawr âwma zeh tûrin onukion-te leh lunghlute nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, hmun thianghlim mi siamsak rawh se, an zînga ka chên ve theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biak bûk lem leh a chhûnga bungrua tûr zawng zawng lem ka entîr ang chiah che hian in siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, thingri thingin bâwm siam sela; a dung lam chu tawng hnih leh a chanve ni sela, a vâng lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin i luan tûr a ni a, a chhûng leh a pâwn i luan tûr a ni a; tin, rangkachakin a tlâng i kâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi atân chuan rangkachak khâng pali i chhûng tûr a ni a, a ke paliah chuan vuah vek tûr a ni; chumi khâng pahnih chu a lehlamah vuah tûr a ni a, khâng pahnih chu a lehlamah vuah bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, thingri thingin zâwnfungte i siam tûr a ni a, rangkachak tîin luan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, bâwm chu zâwn theih tûrin a panga khângah chuan zâwnfungte chu i rawlh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu bâwma khângah chuan zâwnfungte chu a invuah reng tûr a ni; phawi chhuah hlek tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, bâwm chhûngah chuan thuhriattîrna ka la pêk tûr che chu i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak hlîr hlakin zahngaihna ṭhutphah i siam tûr a ni; a dung lam chu tawng hnih leh a chanve ni sela, a vâng lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, cherub pahnih rangkachakin i siam tûr a ni; zahngaihna ṭhutphah hmâwr ve vea mi chu a chherin i chher tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hmâwr lehlamah cherub pakhat siam la, a hmâwr lehlamah cherub pakhat siam bawk ang che; zahngaihna ṭhutphah nêna inbelhbawm khâwm vekin a hmâwr ve vea cherub pahnih chu in siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, cherub-te chu inhmatawna zahngaihna ṭhutphah chu an thlaa hliapin, an thlate chu an zâr duai tûr a ni; zahngaihna ṭhutphah lam chu cherub-te chuan an hawi ve ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, bâwm chungah zahngaihna ṭhutphah chu i dah tûr a ni a; tin, bâwm chhûngah chuan thuhriattîrna ka la pêk tûr che chu i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutah chuan i hnênah ka lo kal ang a; tin, thuhriattîrna bâwm chunga cherub pahnih inkâr, zahngaihna ṭhutphah chung lam aṭangin, Israel mite thu ka pêk tûr apiang chungchâng thûah chuan ka rawn be ṭhîn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, thingri thingin dawhkân i siam tûr a ni; a dung lam chu tawng hnih ni sela, a vâng lam chu tawng khat ni sela, a sân lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chu chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin luan tûr a ni a; tin, rangkachakin a tlâng i kâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, kutphah bawka hlaiin a kâwm i siam tûr a ni a; tin, a kâwm chu rangkachakin a tlâng i kâwm leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, chumi atân chuan rangkachak khâng pali i siam tûr a ni a; tin, chumi khâng chu dawhkân ke pali kil ṭheuhvah chuan vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dawhkân chu zâwna, a zâwnfung chu rawlh theih tûrin khângte chu a kâwm sia vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, dawhkân chu a zâwn theih nân zâwnfungte chu thingri thingin i siam tûr a ni a; tin, rangkachak tîin luan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, chumi atân chuan thlêng te, no te, uain thâwl te, a bun chhuahna tûr berhbute i siam tûr a ni. Chûng chu rangkachak hlîr hlakin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, dawhkânah chuan ka hmaah chhangdah i hlui fo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, khâwnvâr dahna rangkachak hlîr hlakin i siam tûr a ni; chumi khâwnvâr dahna chu a ngul bul leh a ngul chu chher tûr a ni; a note, a parfungte, a pârte nên chuan inzawm vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a sîrahte chuan pêng paruk lo pêng chhuak sela: khâwnvâr dahna ngul sîr lehlamah chuan pêng pathum awm sela, khâwnvâr dahna ngul sîr lehlamah chuan pêng pathum awm bawk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lehlam pang pêngah chuan vaiumkhal kuhmûm ang no pathum, a pârfung leh a pâr i siam tûr a ni; tin, a lehlam pang pêngah pawh vaiumkhal kuhmûm ang no pathum, pârfung leh a pâr i siam tûr a ni; chutiang chuan khâwnvâr dahna pêng paruk atân i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, khâwnvâr dahna ngulah chuan no pali, vaiumkhal kuhmûm anga siam, a pârfung leh a pârte a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, chumi inzawm vek pêng pahnih hnuaiah chuan pârfung awm sela; tin, chumi inzawm vek pêng pahnih hnuaiah chuan pârfung awm sela; tin, chumi inzawm vek pêng pahnih hnuaiah chuan pârfung awm sela; khâwnvâr dahna ngula pêng parukah chuan a awm vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chûng a pârfungte leh a pêngte chuan a zawm vek tûr a ni a; a pum chuan rangkachak hlîr hlaka chher tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, chumi atân chuan khâwnvâr pasarih i siam tûr a ni; tichuan, khâwnvârte chu an dah ang a, a hma zâwnte chu a ên theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, chumi atâna hman tûr chaichehte leh meivâp dahnate chu rangkachak hlîr hlak a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chumi khâwnvâr dahna leh a hmanrua tûr zawng zawng siam nân chuan rangkachak hlîr hlak talent khat i hmang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, tlânga a lem ka entîr ang chiah che khân engkim i siam tûr a ni tih hre reng rawh khai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk, puanzâr sâwm neiin i siam bawk tûr a ni; la zai sîn tak kawp, dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te hmangin cherub lemte thiam taka siam chuantîrin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puanzâr chu a sei lam tawng sawmhnih leh tawng riat ṭheuh a ni ang a, puanzâr chu a hlai lam tawng li ṭheuh a ni ang. Puanzâr zawng zawng chu inchen vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puanzâr pangate chu inzawm tûr a ni a; tin, puanzâr panga vêkte pawh chu inzawm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr zawm khat hmawrtawng ber tlângah chuan a beng a dumpâwlin i siam tûr a ni a; chutiang bawkin puanzâr zawm lehlam hmawrtawng ber tlângah chuan i siam bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puanzâr pakhatah chuan beng sawmnga i siam tûr a ni a; tin, zawm khat puanzâr tlângah pawh chuan beng sawmnga i siam bawk tûr a ni a; chûng bengte chu a inep thliah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak chilh behna sawmnga i siam tûr a ni a, a chilh behnate chuan puanzârte chu i chilh bet tûr a ni a; tichuan, biak bûk chu pindan pakhat a lo ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk chung khuh nân kêl hmul puanzârte i siam tûr a ni. Puanzâr sâwm leh pakhat i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puanzâr chu a sei lam tawng sawmthum ṭheuh a ni tûr a ni a; tin, puanzâr chu a hlai lam tawng li ṭheuh a ni tûr a ni: puanzâr te chu inchen vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr pangate chu i ṭhui zawm vek tûr a ni a; tin, puanzâr paruk pawh chu ṭhui zawm vek tûr a ni a, puan in hma lama puanzâr a parukna chuan a khuh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr zawm khat tlângah chuan beng sawmnga i siam tûr a ni a; tin, puanzâr zawm lehlam tlângah pawh chuan beng sawmnga siam bawk tûr a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, dâr chilh behna sawmnga i siam tûr a ni a; tin, chumi chilh behna chu puan tlânga a bengah chuan vuah tûr a ni a, puan in chu chilh zawm vek tûr a ni; pindan pakhat a lo nih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puan in puanzâr uai thla la chuang, a zatve la chuang chu biak bûk kawmchârah a uai thla tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, puan in puanzâr a dung lam hmâwr tuak ve vea tawng khat ve ve la chuanga chu biak bûk bang lehlam lehlam khuh nân a uai thla tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, berâmpa vun chhum senin puan in chung khuhnate, savun ṭha chiin a chunga khuh lehnate i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk ban rem khâwm tûrte chu ngîl taka dingin thingri thingin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ban rem khâwm sei lam chu tawng sâwm ni sela; tin, a vâng lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve ni ṭheuh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ban rem khâwm tinah chuan ke pahnih inzawmin a awm tûr a ni. Chutiang chuan biak bûk ban rem khâwm chhim chhawng chhim lampang atân chuan, ban rem khâwm sawmhnih i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk atân ban rem khâwm chhim chhawng chhim lampang atân chuan, ban rem khâwm sawmhnih i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chumi ban rem khâwm sawmhnih nghahchhan atân chuan tangkaraw tlang ker kuak sawmli i siam tûr a ni: a ke pahnih atân ban rem khâwm pakhat nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih leh, a ke pahnih atân ban rem khâwm dang pakhat nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk sîr lehlam hmâr chhawng lam atân chuan ban rem khâwm sawmhnih i siam tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />chûng atân chuan tangkaraw tlang sawmli ker kuak nên, ban rem khâwm pakhat atân nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih leh, ban rem khâwm dang pakhat atân nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih i siam bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk kawmchâr khawthlang chhawng lam atân chuan ban rem khâwm paruk i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk kawmchâr kil ve ve atân chuan ban rem khâwm pahnih i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a hnuai lamah chuan thlawp tûr a ni a, chutiang bawkin a chhîp lam khâng hmasa ber thlengin tih vek tûr a ni. Chutiang chuan a pahnih chuan tih ve ve tûr a ni. Chûng chu a kil pahnih atân a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ban rem khâwm pariat, a nghahchhan tûr tangkaraw tlang ker kuak sâwm leh paruk nên a awm tûr a ni; ban rem khâwm pakhat atân nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih; tin, ban rem khâwm dang atân pawh chuan nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih zêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, thingri thingin bangrel, biak bûk bang lehlam ban rem khâwm atân panga, biak bûk bang lehlam ban rem khâwm atân panga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tin, biak bûk kawmchâr khawthlang chhawng lam ban rem khâwm atân pawh panga i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, bangrel laita, ban rem khâwm lai taka mi chuan ban rem khâwm hmâwrtawng ber aṭangin a lehlam hmâwrtawng ber thlengin a thil tlang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ban rem khâwmte chu rangkachak tîin i luan tûr a ni a, bangrelte thil nân rangkachak khângte i siam tûr a ni; tin, chûng bangrelte chu rangkachak tîin i luan bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, tlânga ka entîr dân ang chiah che khân biak bûk chu i sa tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr tûr lazai sîn tak kawp te, a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lârte hmangin cherub lemte mi thiam tak siam chuantîrin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu chu thingri ban pali rangkachak tîa luanah chuan i zâr tûr a ni, a bânna chu rangkachaka siam tûr a ni; tin, tangkaraw tlang ker kuak palia inphun tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chumi puanzâr chu puanzâr chilh behnate hnuai lamah chuan i zâr tûr a ni a, chumi puanzâr chhûng lamah chuan thuthlunna bâwm chu i dah lût tûr a ni; tichuan, puanzâr chuan hmun thianghlim leh hmun thianghlim ber chu a daidansak dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, zahngaihna ṭhutphah chu hmun thianghlim berah thuthlunna bâwm chungah chuan i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr pâwn lamah chuan dawhkân i hûng tûr a ni a; tin, biak bûk chhim chhawng lam dawhkân epah chuan khâwnvâr dahna i hûng tûr a ni; tichuan, dawhkân chu hmâr lampangah chuan i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, puan in kawngkaa zâr tûr lazai sîn tak kawp te, a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lârte hmangin, puan zeh mawi thiam taka zeh nên i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr zârna tûr chuan thingri ban panga i siam tûr a ni a, chûng chu rangkachak tîin i luan tûr a ni; a bânnate chu rangkachaka siam tûr a ni: chûng hûnna atân chuan dâr tlang ker kuak panga i chhûng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, thingri thing maichâm, a dung lam tawng nga, a vâng lam tawng ngain i siam tûr a ni; chu maichâm chu kil li a ni tûr a ni a, a sân lam chu tawng thum a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a kil li chhîpahte chuan a kîte i siam tûr a ni a; maichâm nên chûng a kîte chu a inzawm vek tûr a ni. Dâr tîin i luan vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, meivâp ruh chhuahna bêlte, vut lawhnate, maihûnte, sa thurna thîrkawmte, mei lâknate i siam tûr a ni; chûng hmanrua zawng zawng chu dârin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, maichâm atân chuan dâr lên i siam tûr a ni; tin, chumi lên chung, a kil liahte chuan dâr khâng pali i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chu chu maichâm dawhzâwl hnuai lam vêl chuan i dah tûr a ni, chu lên chuan maichâm chanve chu a han thlen theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, maichâm atân zâwnfung, thingri thing zâwnfungte i siam tûr a ni a, chûng chu dâr tîin i luan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chûng zâwnfungte chu chung khângahte chuan thun luh tûr a ni a; tichuan, zâwnfungte chu a zâwnna tûrin maichâm sîr pahnihah chuan a awm ve ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maichâm chu thing phela hungin a kawrawngin i siam tûr a ni; tlânga ka entîr ang chiah che khân siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlai i siam tûr a ni. Chhim chhawng chhim lampangah chuan a sîr lehlam atân a hung chhûng kawtlaia puanzâr tûrte, lazai sîn tak kawpa siam tawng zaa sei a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi atân chuan ban sawmhnih leh dâr tlang ker kuak sawmhnih a awm tûr a ni. Bana a bânnate leh a zârfungte chu tangkarua a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chutiang bawkin, hmâr chhawng lampang dung lam puanzâr zâr tûrte chu tawng zaa sei a ni tûr a ni a, chumi atân chuan ban sawmhnih leh dâr tlang ker kuak sawmhnih a awm tûr a ni; bana a bânnate leh a zârfungte chu tangkarua a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a khawthlang lampang hung chhûng kawtlai vâng lam puanzâr tûrte chu tawng sawmngaa sei a ni tûr a ni, a ban sâwm leh a nghahchhan ker kuak sâwm nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, khawchhak lam chhawng, chhak lampang a hung chhûng kawtlai vâng lam chu tawng sawmngaa sei a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kawngka sîr lehlama puanzâr zâr tûrte chu tawng sâwm leh tawng ngaa sei a ni tûr a ni: a ban pathum leh a nghahchhan kerkuak pathum a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, kawngka sîr lehlama puanzâr zâr tûrte chu tawng sâwm leh tawng ngaa sei a ni tûr a ni a, a ban pathum leh a nghahchhan ker kuak pathum a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a hung chhûng kawtlai kawngkaa zâr tûr tawng sawmhniha sei, lazai sîn tak kawp te, a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lârte hmangin, puan zeh mawi thiam tak zeh nên a awm tûr a ni. A ban pali leh a nghahchhan ker kuak pali a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hung chhûng kawtlai ban zawng zawngte chu tangkaruaa zem chhuah vek tûr a ni a; a bânnate chu tangkarua a ni tûr a ni a, nghahchhan ker kuakte chu dâr a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hung chhûng kawtlai dung lam chu tawng za ni sela, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmnga ni sela; tin, a sân lam chu tawng nga ni sela, lazai sîn tak kawpa hung ni sela; tin, a nghahchhan ker kuakte chu dâr tlang ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biak bûk sakna zawng zawnga a hmanrua zawng zawng leh, a kilhbehna zawng zawng leh, a hung chhûng kawtlai kilhbehna zawng zawng chu dâr vek a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, khâwnvâr chu eng lai pawha a alh theih nân olive hriak fîm taka sâwr, chhit atân i hnênah rawn la ṭhîn tûrin Israela thlahte chu thu i pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Inbiakna puan in chhûngah, thuhriattîr dahna bula puanzâr pâwn lamah chuan, Arona leh a fapaten Lalpa hmaah chuan tlai aṭangin a tûk thlengin an buatsaih ṭhîn tûr a ni. Hei hi Israela thlahte tân kumkhuain, an thlahte thleng pawhin thuruat ngheh tlat a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, nangin i u Arona leh a fapate chu Israela thlahte zîng ata i hnênah hruai ang che, ani chuan puithiam rawngbâwl hna chu ka tân a thawh theih nân, Arona te, Arona fapa - Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazera te, Ithamara te nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, i u Arona tân silhfên thianghlim, tiropuitu atân leh timawitu atân i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, mi themthiamho, finna thlarauva ka tihkhah zawng zawngte chu bia la, puithiam rawngbâwl hna ka tân a thawh theihna tûrin Arona chu silhfênte siamsak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hêngte hi a ni silhfên atâna an siam tûrte chu: âwmbel te, kawr te, kawrfual te, kawr zeh mawi te, lukhum leh kâwnghrênte nên. Tin, i u Arona leh a fapate chuan puithiam rawngbâwl hna ka tân an thawh theih nân, silhfên thianghlim an siamsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak te, la dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te, lazai sîn tak kawpte nên an la tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, puithiam kawr chu rangkachak te, la dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te, lazai sîn tak kawpte hmangin, mi themthiam takin a buatsaih angin an siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chumi kawr hmâwr hma lam leh hnung lama ṭhui belhbawm, dârbak pahnih neihtîr tûr a ni; a inzawm tlat theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, kawr chunga kâwnghrên tûr themthiam taka tah, chumi kawr chi bawk tluan khat vek hman tûr a ni; chu chu rangkachak nên, la dumpâwl nên, sen duk nên, sen lâr nên, lazai sîn tak kawp nêna tah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, onukion lung pahnih i la tûr a ni a, chutah chuan Israela thlahte hming i chuantîr tûr a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />lung pakhatah chuan an hming paruk, lung dang pakhatah chuan a la awmate paruk; hming chu an pian dân indawtin i chuantîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hming nemnaa chuang ang, lunga ziak thiam miin a ziak ṭhin ang hian, Israela thlahte hming ang zêlin lung pahnihah chuan i ziak tûr a ni. Rangkachaka phûm tûrin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chumi lung pahnih chu Israela thlahte hriat rengna lung atân, puithiam kawr dârbakah chuan i bel tûr a ni. Tichuan, Arona chuan hriat rengna tûrin, Lalpa hmaah an hmingte chu a koki khing hnihah chuan a bât ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak zaite i phiar tûr a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />rangkachak hlîr hlak khaidiat pahnih nên, hruihrual anga herhin i siam tûr a ni; tin, chumi khaidiat herhte chu phiarah chuan i zawm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, rorêlna âwmbel, mi thiam tak siam ang i siam tûr a ni. Puithiam kawr siam ang khân i siam tûr a ni a: rangkachak te, la dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te, lazai sîn tak kawpte hmangin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kil li neia siama thuah tûr a ni: a dung lam khâp khat, a vâng lam pawh khâp khat bawk a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan lunghlu, lunghlu tlar li i zep tûr a ni: tlar khatna chu sardion te, topazion te, smaragdos te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, tlar hnihna chu anthrax te, sappheiros te, sordonuks te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, tlar thumna chu huakinthos te, akates te, amethustos te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tin, tlar lina chu berullos te, onukion te, jaspis te a ni tûr a ni. Rangkachakah chuan phûm ṭhêt tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, lungte chu Israela thlahte hming ang zêlin, sâwm leh pahnih chu an hming ang zêlin a ni tûr a ni; hming nemnaa chuang ang, hnam tin an hming ang zêlin, hnam sâwm leh hnam hnihte tân chuan a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, âwmbel chungah chuan hruihrual ang khaidiatte, rangkachak hlîr hlak herh i siam tûr a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, âwmbel chungah chuan rangkachak khâng pahnih i siam tûr a ni a; tin, chumi khâng pahnih chu âwmbel tlâng hmâwr ve veah chuan i vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak khaidiat herh pahnih chu, âwmbel tlâng hmâwr ve vea khâng pahnihah chuan i thlung tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, khaidiat herh hmâwr lehlam pahnihte chu rangkachak zai phiar pahnihah chuan i zawm tûr a ni a, chu chu puithiam kawr hma lama dârbakah chuan i thlung tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak khâng pahnih i siam tûr a ni a, chûng chu âwmbel kil pahnih, puithiam kawr dep chhûng lampangah chuan i vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak khâng pahnih i siam tûr a ni a, chûng chu a hma lama puithiam kawr dârbakna pahnih hnuai lampang, a inzawmna lai vêl, puithiam kawr hrênna themthiam taka tah chung lamah chuan i vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, puithiam kawra khângahte chuan âwmbela khângte chu hrui dumpâwlin an chilh zawm tûr a ni, themthiam taka tah puithiam kawr hrênna chung lama a awm theih nân leh, âwmbel chu puithiam kawr nên a inhran loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Arona chuan hmun thianghlima a kal hunah Lalpa hmaah a hriat reng theihna tûrin, a thinlung zâwn taka rorêlna âwmbelah chuan Israela thlahte hming chu a pu zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, rorêlna âwmbelah chuan Urim leh Thumim i dah tûr a ni a; chu chu Arona chuan Lalpa hmaa a kal hunah chuan a thinlung zâwnah chuan a dah zêl tûr a ni. Tin, Arona chuan Israela thlahte rorêlna chu Lalpa hmaa a kal hunah a thinlung zâwnah chuan a pu zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, puithiam kawrfual, a dumpâwl hlîr hlak i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a lai takah lû thawn nân tihâwng tûr a ni a; chumi âwng chu a thlêr chhiat theih mai lohna tûrin, kawrbân bûl angin a tlâng vêl chu cheh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, a fêmahte chuan pawmgranet lem - a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr tein - a fêm vêlin i siam tûr a ni a; tin, chumi inkârahte chuan rangkachak tengeng a vêlin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kawrfual fêm vêlahte chuan rangkachak tengeng pakhat leh pawmgranet pakhat zêl i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Arona chu rawng a bâwl laiin chutiang chuan a inthuam tûr a ni; tichuan, hmun thianghlima Lalpa hmaa a luh leh a chhuah hunah a ri chu hriat theih a ni tûr a ni; chutichuan, a thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak hlîr hlak phêk i siam tûr a ni a, a pangah chuan hming nemnaa chuang ang, ‘ Lalpa PUAL’ tih i chuantîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chu chu hrui dumpâwlah chuan i bel tûr a ni a, puithiam lukhumah chuan bel tûr a ni; puithiam lukhum hma lamah a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chu chu Arona chalah a awm tûr a ni a, Israela thlahten an thilpêk thianghlim atâna an hlan tûr thil serha sualna awmte chu Arona chuan a phur zêl tûr a ni; chu chu Lalpa hmaa chhân tlâka a awm theih nân a chalah a awm chawt tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, kawr chu puan zai sîn tak, zeh mawiin i tah tûr a ni; tin, puan zai sîn takin puithiam lukhum i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Arona fapate chu kawr i siamsak tûr a ni a; tin, kawnghrênte, diarte i siamsak bawk tûr a ni, tiropuitu leh timawitu atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chûng chuan i u Arona leh a fapate chu i thuam tûr a ni; tin, ka tân puithiam hna thawka rawng an bâwl theihna tûrin, anmahni chu hriak thihin, tihrangin, i tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, an taksa saruak khuh nan puan zai sîn kekawr i siamsak tûr a ni; kâwng aṭanga malpui thleng ni sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chu chu Arona leh a fapaten inbiakna puan ina an luh hun leh, hmun thianghlima rawngbâwl tûra maichâm bula an kal hunin an ha zêl tûr a ni; chuti lo chuan, suala ngaihin an thi dah ang e. Chu chu amah leh a hnua a thlahte thleng pawha kumkhuaa thuruat ngheh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, puithiam hna thawka ka rawng an bâwl theihna tûra anmahni tihthianghlim nân, an chungah hetiang hian i ti tûr a ni: bâwngpatuai pakhat leh berâmpa sawisêl bo pahnih nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chhang dawidim telh loh nên, chhangpêr dawidim telh loh hriaka chawhpawlh nên, chhangpêr pan dawidim telh loh hriaka chulh nên i rawn la tûr a ni; chhangphut dip tak chiin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûng chu fawng pakhata dahin, fawng chawpin bâwngpa leh berâmpa pahnih nên chuan i rawn keng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Arona leh a fapate chu inbiakna puan in kawngka bulah chuan rawn hruaiin, tuiin i lo sil tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, silhfênte chu rawn lain, Arona chu kawr nên, puithiam kawrfual nên, puithiam kawr nên, âwmbel nên hâktîrin, puithiam kawr hrênna themthiam taka tah chuan i hrêng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lukhum chu khumtîrin, lukhum chungah chuan lukhum thianghlim chu i khumtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, hriak thih mi rawn lain, a lûah leihin i thih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a fapate chu rawn hruaiin kawr i hâktîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Arona leh a fapate chu kâwnghrêna hrêngin, diar i khimtîr tûr a ni. Puithiam nihna chu kumkhua atâna ruat ngheh tlatin an chang tawh ang. Chutiang chuan Arona leh a fapate chu i tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, inbiakna puan in bulah bâwngpa i rawn la tûr a ni: Arona leh a fapate chuan bâwngpa lû chungah chuan an kut lo nghat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, inbiakna puan in kawngka bulah, Lalpa hmaah chuan bâwngpa chu i lo talh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, bâwngpa thisen chu lo lain, maichâm kîte chu i kut zungṭangin i hnawih tûr a ni; tin, maichâm bulah chuan thisen chu i leihbaw vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a kawchhûng thau zawng zawng nên, a thin tuamtu râng nên lain maichâmah chuan i hâl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bâwngpa sa leh a vun leh a êk erawh chu daipâwn lamah i hâl tûr a ni; chu chu sual tâna hlan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Berâmpa pakhat i rawn la bawk tûr a ni; tin, Arona leh a fapaten chu berâmpa lû chungah chuan an kut lo nghat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, berâmpa chu lo talhin, a thisen chu lain, maichâm chung chu a vêlin i theh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, berâmpa chu i chan tûr a ni a; tin, a kawchhûng leh a kete chu silin, a sahrangte nên, a lû nên i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, berâmpa chu a pumin maichâmah chuan i hâl tûr a ni. Chu chu Lalpa tâna hâlral thilhlan a ni a; Lalpa tâna meia hlan rimtui chu a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, berâmpa pakhat i rawn kai leh tûr a ni; Arona leh a fapaten chu berâmpa lû chungah chuan an kut lo nghat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, berâmpa chu lo talhin, a thisen chu lain, Arona beng ding lam tlângah te, a fapate beng ding lam tlângah te, an kut ding lam zungpuiah te, an ke ding lam zungpuiah te i tât tûr a ni a; tin, maichâm chung vêlah chuan thisen chu i theh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, maichâm chunga thisen leh, hriak thih mi chu rawn lain, Arona leh a silhfênahte leh, a hnêna tel ve a fapate leh a fapate silhfênahte chuan i theh tûr a ni; tichuan, amah leh a silhfênte leh, a hnêna tel ve a fapate leh a fapate silhfênte chu tihthianghlim an lo ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Berâmpa thau nên, a mei thau tak nên, a kawchhûng thau nên, a thin tuamtu râng nên, a kal pahnih leh a bawhtu thau nên, a bawp ding lam nên i la bawk tûr a ni; chu chu tihhranna berâmpa chu a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tin, fawnga chhang dawidim telh loh Lalpa tâna chhiah mi chu chhangpêr pakhat nên, chhangpêr hriaka chawhpawlh pakhat nên, chhangpêr pan pakhat nên i telh tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tin, chûng chu Arona kut leh a fapate kutah chuan i dah vek tûr a ni a, Lalpa hmaa thên thilhlan atân i thên tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, an kut ata chu lâksakin, Lalpa tâna rimtui atân maichâmah hâlral thilhlan chungah chuan i hâl tûr a ni. Chu chu Lalpa tâna meia thilhlan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Arona tihhranna berâmpa irâwm chu lain, Lalpa hmaa thên thilhlan atân i thên tûr a ni; chu chu i chanvo tûr ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Arona leh a fapate puala tihhranna berâmpa irâwm, thên thilhlan leh chawikân thilhlan, a bawp thên tawh leh chawikân tawh chu i tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu chu Israela thlahte laka kumkhuaa Arona leh a fapate chanvo tûra ruat a ni ang. Chu chu chawikân thilhlan a ni si a; remna thilhlana an inthawinate zînga Israela thlahten an chawikân thilhlan tûr chu a ni ang, Lalpa tâna an chawikân thilhlan ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Arona silhfên tihthianghlimte chu a hnuah a fapaten an la rochung zêl ang, chûngte chuan an inthuama, hriak thih leh tihthianghlim an nih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A fapa, a aiawha puithiam hna thawk tûra ruata chu, hmun thianghlima rawngbâwl tûra inbiakna puan ina a luh hunah, ni sarih chhûng chu inthuamin a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, tihhranna berâmpa chu rawn lain, a sa chu hmun thianghlimah i chhûm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, Arona leh a fapate chuan berâmpasa leh fawnga chhangpêrte chu inbiakna puan in kawngka bulah ei rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chûng inremna thil, anmahni tihhran nân leh tihthianghlim nâna hlante chu an ei tûr a ni; amaherawhchu, thil thianghlim a nih avângin mi dang zawngin an ei ve tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, chumi tihhranna sa emaw, chhang emaw chu a tûk thlenga a bâng a la awm chuan, a bâng chu meiin i hâl ral tûr a ni. Chu chu thil thianghlim a nih avângin ei tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, thu ka pêk zawng zawng che ang hian Arona leh a fapate chungah chuan i ti tûr a ni. Ni sarih anmahni i tihrang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ni tin sual hlan inthawina sebâwngpa, inremna tûrin i hlân tûr a ni. Tichuan, inremna i siam hunin maichâm chu i tifai dâwn nia; tin, a tithianghlim tûrin hriak i hnawih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Maichâm atân inremna ni sarih siamin i tithianghlim tûr a ni a; tichuan, maichâm chu thil thianghlim tak a lo ni ang. Maichâm dek apiang chu a lo thianghlim zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutichuan, maichâm chunga i hlan tûr chu hei hi a ni: ni tin kum khat tling berâmno pahnih zêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Berâmno pakhat chu zîng lamah i hlân tûr a ni a, berâmno pakhat chu tlai lamah i hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bêramno pakhat hlannaah chuan chhangphut dip tak, epha hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat, hriak sâwr hin hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat nêna chawhpawlh i telh tûr a ni a; in tûr thilhlan atân uain hin hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, berâmno pakhat chu tlai lamah i hlân tûr a ni a, chu chu zîng lama ei tûr thilhlan dân ang leh in tûr thilhlan dân angin rimtui, Lalpa tâna meia thilhlan atân i hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chu chu in thlahte thlenga inbiakna puan in kawngka bula Lalpa hmaa hâlral thilhlan fo tûr a ni ang a, chutah chuan a be tûr chein ka lo kal ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israela thlahte pawh chutah chuan ka rawn be ṭhîn ang a; tichuan, puan in chu ka ropuinaa tihthianghlim a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, inbiakna puan in leh maichâm chu ka tithianghlim ang. Arona pawh a fapate nên ka tâna puithiam hna thawka ka rawng an bâwl theihna tûrin ka tithianghlim bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte zîngah chuan ka chêng ang a, an Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chutichuan, anmahniho zînga ka chên theihna tûra Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu Lalpa an Pathian chu ka ni tih an hria ang. Kei hi Lalpa an Pathian ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, rimtui hâlna tûr maichâm i siam tûr a ni; thingri thingin i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A dung lam tawng khat, a vâng lam tawng khat a ni tûr a ni a, kil li neia siam tûr a ni; tin, a sân lam chu tawng hnih ni sela. A kîte chu maichâm nên chuan inzawm vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a chung te, a pang vêl te leh a kîte chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin i luan tûr a ni; tin, a kotlâng vêlah chuan rangkachak i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a kotlâng hnuai lamah, a sîr tuakah chuan rangkachak khâng pahnih i siam tûr a ni. A sîr pahnihah chuan i siam tûr a ni a, chûng chu a zâwnfung rawlhna tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, thingri thinga zâwnfungte siamin rangkachak tîin i luan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chu chu thuhriattîrna chunga ka rawn biak ṭhinna tûr che zahngaihna ṭhutphah hmaah, thuhriattîrna bâwm kianga puanzâr bulah i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Aronan chutah chuan englo rimtui tak hâl tûr rimtui a hâl tûr a ni a; tûk tin khâwnvârte a tihfai hun apiangin a hâl ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Aronan tlai lamah khâwnvârte a chhit hun chuan rimtui chu a hâl ṭhîn tûr a ni; chu chu in thlahte thlenga Lalpa hmaa rimtui a ni reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutah chuan rimtui dang emaw, hâlral thilhlan emaw, ei tûr thilhlan emaw in hlân tûr a ni lo va; tin, chutah chuan in tûr thilhlan pawh in leih tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Aronan kum khatah vawi khat ki chungahte chuan inremna a siam tûr a ni; inremna tûra sual thawina thisen chuan kum tin vawi khat in thlahte thlengin inremna chu a siam ṭhîn tûr a ni. Chu chu Lalpa tân thianghlim tak a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Israela thlahte awm zât i chhiar hun chuan, a awm zât i chhiar ang zêlin mi tinin an nunna tlanna chu Lalpa an pe zêl tûr a ni, anmahni i chhiar huna an zînga hri a lên loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hei hi an pêk tûr chu a ni: chhiar tawhte zînga tel tûra kal apiangte chuan, hmun thianghlima sekel an pêk ṭhin ang sekel chanve an pe tûr a ni (sekel chu gera sawmhnih a ni). Lalpa puala thilhlan atân sekel chanve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhiar tawhte zînga tel tûra kal apiang, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam zawng chuan Lalpa puala thilhlan chu an pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In nunna tlanna tûra Lalpa puala thil in hlan chuan sekel chanve aia tam chu mi hausain a pe tûr a ni lo va, mi rethei pawhin chumi aia tlêm chu a pe tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte tlanna man tangka chu lo lain, inbiakna puan ina rawngbâwl nân i lo ruat tûr a ni; in nunna tlan nâna Lalpa hmaa Israela thlahte tâna i hriat rengna a lo nih theihna tûrin,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Insilna tûr dâr maihûn, a hûnchhan dâr nên i siam bawk tûr a ni. Chu chu inbiakna puan in leh maichâm inkârah i hûng tûr a ni a, chutah chuan tui i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Arona leh a fapaten chutah chuan an kete an sil ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Inbiakna puan in chhûnga an luh hunin emaw, Lalpa tâna meia thilhlan hâl tûra maichâm bula rawngbâwl tûra an lo kal hunin emaw, tui chuan an insil tûr a ni; chuti lo chuan, an thi mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, an thih loh nân an kut leh an kete chu an sil ṭhîn tûr a ni. Chu chu an tân kumkhua atâna thuruat a ni ang - amah leh a thlahte leh an thlahte thleng tân pawh,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa vêkin Mosia hnênah, “Rimtui tui ber chi zînga mi - murra tui sekel zanga leh, thakthîng rimtui, chumi zâtve sekel zahnih leh sawmnga zet - leh fu rimtui sekel zahnih leh sawmnga leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />thakthîng chi dang sekel zanga, hmun thianghlima sekel an pêk ṭhin ang, olive hriak hin khat nên rawn lain,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />rimtui siamtu siam angin hriak thih chu hriak thianghlim atân i siam tûr a ni. Chu chu hriak thih chi hriak thianghlim a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, inbiakna puan in te, thuhriattîrna bâwm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />dawhkân leh a bungbêl zawng zawngte, khâwnvâr dahna leh a hmanruate, rimtui hâlna maichâm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan maichâm leh a hmanrua zawng zawngte, maihûn leh a hûnchhante nên, chu chuan i hnawih vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, thianghlim tak an lo nih theih nân i tithianghlim tûr a ni; chûng dek apiangte chu an lo thianghlim zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ka tân puithiam hna thawka ka rawng an bâwl theih nân Arona leh a fapate chu hriak thihin i tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte hnênah, ‘He hriak hi in thlahte thlenga ka hriak thianghlim thih mi chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihring taksaah chuan leih tûr a ni lo va; hemi siam dân anga siam, a ang tak hian in siam tûr a ni hek lo. Hei hi zawng a thianghlim a; tichuan, in tân thianghlim a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu pawhin a anpui siam sela emaw, mi dang tân tu pawhin lo hmang sela emaw, chu mi chu a chipuite zîng ata tihboral a ni ang,’ tiin sawi ang che,” tiin a sawi leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Rimtui tui tak - stakte te, onuka te, galbanum te - la ang che, rimtui tui tak beraw fîm tak nên; bûk inzât vekin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chu chu rimtui siamtu siam angin chia al, fîm leh thianghlim takin rimtui i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A ṭhente chu râwt dip dep tûr a ni a, ka rawn biak ṭhinna tûr che inbiakna puan in chhûnga thuhriattîrna bulah chuan i dah tûr a ni. Chu chu in tân thil thianghlim tak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, chumi rimtui i siam tûr, a siam dân tûr anga siam chu zawng nangmahni tân in siam tûr a ni lo ve, Lalpa tâna thil thianghlimah i ngai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu pawhin hnim atân ngawta chutiang a siam chuan chu mi chu a chipuite zîng ata tihboral a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai teh, Juda hnama mi Hura fapa Uria, chu mi fapa Bezalela chu ka thlang tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chu finna te, hriat thiamna te, hriatna te, kawng tinrênga themthiamna te, thiltih tûr fing taka suangtuah thiamna te, zeh tûra lunghlu phel thiamna te, thing zai mawi dân thiamna te, kawng tinrênga themthiamna te nei tûrin Pathian Thlarauvin ka tikhat tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, a hnêna thawk ve tûrin Dan hnama mi Ahisamaka fapa Oholiaba chu keimahin ka ruat leh e; thilsiam tûra thu ka pêk zawng zawng che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />inbiakna puan in te, thuhriattîrna bâwm te, chumi chunga zahngaihna ṭhutphah te, puan in chhûnga bungrua zawng zawng te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, dawhkân leh a hmanrua te, rangkachak hlîr hlaka siam khâwnvâr dahna, a hmanrua zawng zawngte nên, rimtui hâlna maichâm te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, hâlrala thilhlanna maichâm, a bungbêl zawng zawngte nên, maihûn leh a hûnchhan te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, silhfên mawi tak taka tah te, puithiam rawng an bâwl huna hâk tûr puithiam Arona silhfên thianghlim leh a fapate silhfên te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tin, hriak thih mi te, hmun thianghlim atâna rimtui tui takte hi an siam theihna tûrin mi themthiamho zawng zawngte finna ka pe e. Tih tûra thu ka pêk zawng zawng che ang kha an ti tûr a ni,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Israela thlahte hnênah chuan, ‘Ka Chawlhnite hi in serh ngei ngei tûr a ni, in thlahte thlenga keimah leh nangmahni inkâra chhinchhiahna a ni si a; kei hi Lalpa , nangmahni tithianghlimtu che u ka ni tih in hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Chawlhni hi in serh tûr a ni, chu chu in tân ni thianghlim a ni si a. Tu pawh tibawlhhlawh apiang chu tihhlum ngei ngei tûr a ni; tu pawh chumi nia hna eng pawh thawk chu, chu mi chu a chipuite zîng ata tihboral tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng hna thawh nân hman tûr a ni a; a ni sarih ni erawh chu chawlh dêrna Chawlhni, Lalpa tâna ni thianghlim a ni. Tu pawh Chawlhnia hna thawk apiang chu tihhlum ngei ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israela thlahte hian Chawlhni chu an thlahte thlenga kumkhuaa thuthlun nân, chu Chawlhni chu an serh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keimah leh Israela thlahte inkârah hian kumkhuaa thuthlun chhinchhiahna a ni; ni ruk chhûngin Lalpan lei leh vânte a siam a; tin, a ni sarih ni chuan a châwl a, a intihahdam ta a ni si a,’ ti bawk ang che,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Sinai tlânga amah a biak zawh chuan thuhriattîrna lungphêk pahnih, lungphêk, Pathian kut zungṭanga ziak chu Mosia a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan Mosia chu tlâng ata lo chhuk thla har ta êmin an hria a, mipuite chu Arona hnênah an kal khâwm a, a hnênah chuan, “Khai, kan hma hruai tûrin pathiante min siamsak rawh; he Mosia, Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuaktu lah hi a chanchin kan hre ta si lo va,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Aronan an hnênah, “In nupuite, in fapate leh in fanute beh lai, rangkachak bengbehte kha han thlawn ula, ka hnênah han la rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuiho zawng zawng chuan rangkachak bengbeh an beh laite chu an thlawn vek a, Arona hnênah chuan an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an kut ata chu a lo la a, thîr zumin a han din a, bâwngno lemah a chhûng ta a. Tin, anni chuan, “Aw Israel-te u, hêngte hi Aigupta ram ata rawn hruai chhuaktu che u in pathiante an nih hi!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chu chu Aronan a han hmuhin, a hmaah chuan maichâm a siam ta a. Tin, Arona chu a tlângau va, “Naktûk hian Lalpa tân kût awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, a tûk zîng takah an tho va, hâlrala thilhlante an hlân a, remna thilhlante an rawn la a; tichuan, mipui chu ei leh in tûrin an ṭhu khâwm a, infiam tûrin an tho leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia chu a bia a, “Zu chhuk tawh khai, i mite Aigupta ram ata i rawn hruai chhuahte khu an intichhe zo ta vek mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thupêkte chu an hawisan hma zet mai. Bâwngno lem an insiam a, an bia a, a hnênah chuan an inthawi a, ‘Aw Israel-te u, hêngte hi Aigupta ram ata rawn hruai chhuaktu che u in pathiante an nih hi!’ an ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “He miteho hi ka enthla reng a, ngai teh, hnam luhlul tak an lo nih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, lo ngawi rawh, anmahni kâng ral zo vek khawpin an chungah ka thinur chu ling hle teh se. Tin, nang hi chi ropui takah ka siam ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Lalpa a Pathian hnênah, “ Lalpa , thiltihtheihna nasa tak leh kut chak taka i mi, Aigupta ram ata i rawn hruai chhuahte chungah hian engah nge i thinurna chu a lin hle le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta miten engah tehlul nge, ‘An tâna ṭha lo tûr tlângahte thah tûr leh, lei chung ata kâng ral vek tûrin a hruai chhuak a lo nih hi,’ an la rawn tih ang le? I thinur nasa tak hi han tireh la, i mite chunga he thil ṭha lo tih i tum hi han lamlêt leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Israela te hnêna, ‘Vâna arsi zâtin i thlahte chu ka la tipung ang a, he ram ka lo sawi tawh zawng zawng hi i thlahte ka la pe bawk ang a; tichuan, kumkhuain an luah hlen tawh ang,’ tia nangmah ngei inchhâla chhia i lo chham tawhnate kha hre reng ang che,” tiin a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan , “Ka mite chungah thil ṭha lo ka ti ang,” a tih chu a lamlêt ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu tlâng ata thuhriattîrna lungphêk pahnih kengin a lêt thla leh ta a; lungphêk a lehlam lehlam panga ziak chuan ve venate chu; a lehlam lehlam ve veahte chuan ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, lungphêkte chu Pathian kutchhuak a ni a; tin, a ziakte pawh chu Pathian ziak ngei, lungphêkte chunga ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Josuan mipui au thâwm a han hriat chuan Mosia hnênah, “Riahhmun lamah indo thâwm ri a awm ka ti!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Hnehtu au thâwm a nih loh chu, hnehate au thâwm pawh a ni hek lo; hla sa thâwm a ni ka hriat zâwk ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, riahhmun kiang a va thlen chuan, sebâwngno lem leh lâm chu a hmu ta a. Tichuan, Mosia thinrim chu a ling ta phut mai a, a lungphêk kente chu a paih ta ṭhuai a, tlâng hnuaiah chuan a paih keh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, sebâwngno lem an siam chu a la a, meiah a rawh a, a râwt dip derh a, tuiah a phul chiam a, Israela thlahte chu a intîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Arona hnênah chuan, “Hênghote hian i chungah eng nge maw an tiha, hetiang thil sual nasa tak mai an chunga i thlentîr le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Arona chuan, “Ka pu thinrim hi ling teh thut mai suh se a! Hêng mipuiho hi sual lam âwn tlat mi an ni tih i hria alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka hnênah, ‘Kan hma hruai tûrin pathiante min siamsak rawh; he Mosia, Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuaktu lah hi a chanchin kan hre ta si lo va,’ an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, keiin an hnênah, ‘Tu pawh rangkachak nei apiangin rawn thlawn rawh se,’ ka ti a. Chutichuan, min rawn pe a, keiin meiah ka lo paih lût a; tichuan, he sebâwngno lem hi a lo chhuak ta mai alâwm maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu an duh duhin an tâl tih Mosian a hria a (Arona chuan an hmêlmate laka hmuhsitawma awm khawpin an duh duhin a lo tâltîr ta si a);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tichuan, Mosia chu riahhmun luhna kawngkaah a ding a, “Tu pawh Lalpa lama ṭang apiang chu ka hnênah lo kal rawh se,” a ti a. Tichuan, Levia fate zawng zawng chu a hnênah an va kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin, ‘Mi tinin in khandaih pai ula, riahhmun chhûngah hian a luhna kawngka aṭanga kawngka lehlam thlengin vâk vêl ula, mi tinin in unaupa pawh, mi tinin in ṭhianpa pawh, mi tinin in ṭhenawmpa pawh that zêl rawh u,’ a ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Levia fate chuan Mosia thu ang chuan an ti a. Tin, chumi ni chuan mi sângthum an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “Vawiinah hian Lalpa hnênah intihrang rawh u, a ni, mi tinin mahni fapa te, mahni unaupa te an lo do ta si a; tichuan, vawiinah hian malsâwmnain a rawn vûr thei dâwn che u nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûkah chuan Mosian mipuite hnênah chuan, “Thil sual nasa tak mai in lo ti ta a. Chutichuan, Lalpa hnênah ka han chho vang e; in sualnaah hian inremna ka siam thei mahna,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chu Lalpa hnênah a han kal leh a, “Aw, hênghote hian thil sual nasa tak mai an lo ti ta a, rangkachak pathiante chu an lo insiam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, an sual i ngaidam thei ang emaw chu? I theih loh zawngin, i lehkhabua i lo ziak tawh ata kha mi thai bo tûrin ka ngên a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Tu pawh ka chunga thil tisual apiang chu ka lehkhabu ata ka thai bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, kal la, kalna tûr ka hrilh tawh che hmunah khân mipuihote hi va hruai phawt rawh. Ngai teh, ka vântirhkohvin i hma a hruai zêl ang. Amaherawhchu, ka rawn hrem hunah chuan an sualna ngeiah chuan ka rawn hrem dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Arona din sebâwngno lem chu an siam avângin Lalpan mipuite chu a hrem ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Mosia chu a bia a, “Chhuak ula, Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te hnêna, ‘I thlahte hnênah ka la pe ang,’ tia chhia ka lo chham tâk ramah chuan, nang leh Aigupta ram aṭanga i rawn hruai chhuahte nên hian heta ta hi han chho tawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hnute tui leh khawizu luanna ramah chuan. Tin, in hmaah vântirhkoh ka rawn tîr ang a; tichuan, Kanaan-ho te, Amor-ho te, Hit-ho te, Periz-ho te, Hiv-ho te, Jebus-ho te chu ka hnawt chhuak ang. Kei zawng in zîngah ka han chho ve dâwn lo ve, hnam luhlul tak in lo ni si a; kawng lakah ka tiboral hlauh dah ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu chu thu lâwmawm lo tak an hriat chuan an ṭap hlawm a, tu mah rêng rêng an inchei duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Israela thlahte hnênah, ‘Hnam luhlul tak in ni e. In zîngah rei lo tê pawh ka han tel ve zawngin ka tiboral ngei ang che u. Chuvângin, in incheinate kha hlîp vek rawh u; tichuan, ka tih dân tûr che u ka hre thei ang, a ti,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan an incheinate chu Horeb tlâng aṭang chuan an hlîp thla hlen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Mosian puan in kha a chhawm zêl a, riahhmun pâwn lam hla deuh takah a zâr ṭhîn a; chu chu inbiakna puan in a ti a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, tu pawh Lalpa zawng duh apiang chu riahhmun pâwn lama inbiakna puan inah chuan an va kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Mosia chu puan in pana a chhuah hunin mipui zawng zawng chu an tho vek a, mi tin mahni puan in kawngkaah an ding ṭheuh va, Mosia puan ina a luh thlengin an thlîr reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Mosia chu puan ina a luh veleh chhûm ding chu a lo chhuk a, puan in kawngkaah chuan a lo ding ṭhîn a; tin, Lalpan Mosia chu a rawn be ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawngin chhûm ding chu puan in kawngkaa ding an hmu a; tichuan, mipui zawng zawng chu an tho va, mahni puan in kawngka ṭheuhvah chuan chibai an lo bûk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, miin a ṭhian a bia ang mai hian Lalpan Mosia chu inhmatawnin a be ṭhîn a. Tin, riahhmun lamah chuan a lo kîr leh ṭhîn a; a rawngbâwltu Josua, Nuna fapa, tlangvâl erawh chu puan in chhûng ata chu a lo chhuak leh ve ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Lalpa hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, nangin ka hnênah, ‘He mite hi han hruai chho rawh,’ i ti a ni a; tu nge ni ka hnêna i rawn tirh ve dâwn mi la hrilh si lo. Nang lah chuan, ‘I hmingah ka hre chiang che alâwm; tin, ka mittlungin i awm tih ka hre bawk alâwm,’ i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, i mit ka tlun si chuan, nangmah ka hriat chian theih nân che leh i mittlunga ka awm theih nân, tûnah hian i kawngte hi khawngaih takin mi hriattîr ang che. Tin, he hnam hi i mite ngei an ni tih ngaihtuah ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “In zingah ka tel ve zêl ang a; tichuan, ka chawlhtîr ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Kan zînga i tel ve zêl si loh chuan heta ta hi min hruai chhuak ma ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei leh i mite hi i mittlungin kan awm a ni tih hi engtin nge hriatna a awm theih tâk ang? Lei chunga mihring zawng zawngte hi kei leh i mite nên kan inthliar hranna tûr chuan, nang kan hnêna i kal ṭhin hi a ni lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Chu pawh chu i sawi ang chuan ka ti ang e; ka mit i tlung si a, i hmingah ka hre chiang bawk si chia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “I ropuina chu khawngaih takin mi han entîr teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka ṭhatna zawng zawng chu i hmaah ka lantîr ang a, Lalpa hming chu i hmaah ka puang zêl ang. Ka khawngaih apiang chu ka khawngaih ang a, zah ka ngaihna chung apiangah chuan zah ka ngai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka hmêl zawng i hmu thei lo vang; mi hmua nung reng thei tu mah rêng rêng an awm si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan , “En teh, ka kianga hi hmun pakhat a awm hi, lungpui chungah hian i ding ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, ka ropuinain a rawn kal pelh chhûng che chuan, lungpui khi chhûngah hian ka dah ang chia, ka kal pelh hma loh che chuan ka kutin ka khuh ang chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ka kut chu ka han la leh ang a; tichuan, ka hnung lam chu i hmu ang; ka hmêl erawh chu hmuh tûr a ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Lungphêk pahnih hmâna mi ang kha chher leh rawh; tin, lungphêkah chuan hmâna i tihkeh tâk lungphêka thu chuang ang kha ka ziak leh ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naktûk zîngah inpeih tum ang che; tin, zîngah chuan Sinai tlângah lo chho la, tlâng chhîpah ka hmaan lo ding ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I hnênah tu mah lo kal ve suh se, tlângah rêng rêng chuan tu mah a lanin lo lang hauh suh se; berâm rualte leh bâwng rualte pawh tlâng pangah chuan tla hlek bawk suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, lungphêk pahnih hmâna mi ang kha a chher a. Tin, Mosia chu zîng takah a tho va, Lalpan thu a pêk angin Sinai tlângah chuan a han lâwn a; tin, lungphêk pahnih a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu chhûmah chuan a lo chhuk a; tin, a kiangah a va ding a, Lalpa hming chu a lam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hma lamah chuan a kal pêl a, “ Lalpa chu, Lalpa chu, Pathian lainatnaa khat, mi khawngaih thei tak, thinnel tak, ngilneihna leh thutak ngah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mi sâng tam tak chunga khawngaihna lantîr ṭhîn, khawlohna te, bawhchhiatna te, suahsualnate ngaidam ṭhîn; thiam lova ruatte chhuah mai ngai lo; pate khawlohna avânga fate, fate fa lehte, chhuan thumna leh chhuan lina thleng pawha hrem ṭhîn chu,” tiin a puang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chu a kaikûn thuai a, chibai a bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Tûnah hian i mittlung ka nih chuan, aw Lalpa, Lalpa chu kan hnênah khawngaih takin kal ve ang hmiang, hnam luhlul tak an ni na a; tichuan, kan khawlohna leh kan sualna ngaidam la, i ro chan atân min nei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ngai teh, thu ka thlung e. Khawvêl zawng zawng leh tu hnam zîngah mah la tih ngai loh, i mite zawng zawng mit hmuhah hian thilmak ka ti dâwn e; tichuan, i vêla awmho zawng zawngte hian Lalpa thiltih chu an hmu ang. I tâna ka thiltih tûr hi râpthlâk tak a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawiina ka thupêk tûr che hi pawm rawh. Ngai teh, i hmaah chuan Amor-ho te, Kanaan-ho te, Hit-ho te, Periz-ho te, Hiv-ho te, Jebus-ho te ka hnawt chhuak dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fîmkhur rawh; chuti lo chuan, i kalna tûr rama chêngte hnênah thu i thlung ang a, in zîngah hian thang a lo ni dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, an maichâmte chu in tichim vek tûr a ni a, an lungphunte chu tikeh sawm vekin, an Aseri-te chu in kit vek tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />pathian dang rêng rêng chu i be tûr a ni si lo va; Lalpa chu a hming rêng pawh Thîkthuchhiaa a ni a, Pathian thîkthuchhia a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chuti lo chuan, chumi rama mite hnênah chuan thu i thlung ang a, an pathiante lakah an uirê ang a, an pathiante hnênah an inthawi ang a, an rawn sâwm chein an inthawina chu i ei dah ang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, i fapate tân an fanute i nei ang a, an fanute chu an pathiante lakah an uirê ang a, i fapate pawh an pathiante lakah an uirêtîr dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milem chhûn pathiante chu i siam tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Chhang dawidim telh loh kût i nei tûr a ni. Thu ka lo pêk tâk che ang khân, ni sarih chhûng chu chhang dawidim telh loh, Abib thla hun ruatah khân i ei tûr a ni; Abib thla khân Aigupta ram ata chu i lo chhuak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhûl keu hmasa ber apiang chu ka ta a ni; tin, i ran pa zawng zawng, sebâwngpa leh berâmpa piang thla hmasa berte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, sabengtung piang thla hmasa ber chu berâmnovin i tlan tûr a ni. Tin, i tlan duh loh leh a ring chu i ulh tliak tûr a ni. I fapa piang hmasa zawng zawng chu i tlan tûr a ni. Tichuan, ka hmaah tu mah hi kut ruakin in lo lang tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûngin hna i thawk tûr a ni a, a ni sarih ni erawh chuan i châwl tûr a ni; lei leh lai leh buh seng lai pawhin i châwl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chawlhkâr kût, buh thar tirh kût chu, kum a lo ral a, buh khung vek hnua pâwl kût nên i nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I mipa zawng zawngte chu kum khatah vawi thum, Lalpa Pathian, Israel-te Pathian hmaah chuan an rawn inlan ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I hmaah hnam tin ka hnawt chhuakin, i ramrite chu ka zauh dâwn si a; kum khatah vawi thum Lalpa i Pathian hmaa inlan tûra i han kal hunah chuan tu mahin i ram hi an rawn ît hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ka tân inthawina sa thisen chu chhang dawidim telh nên chuan i rawn hlân tûr a ni lo, Kalhlên Kût inthawina pawh chu a tûk thlengin awmtîr tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I lova thlai thar hmasa ber chu Lalpa i Pathian inah i rawn dah tûr a ni. Kêlno sa, a pui hnute tuiin i chhûm tûr a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Hêng thûte hi ziak rawh khai, hêng ang thûte hian a nia i hnênah leh Israel-te hnêna thu ka thlun ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan Lalpa hnênah ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a awm a; chaw rêng rêng a ei lo va, tui pawh a in hek lo. Tin, lungphêkahte chuan thuthlunna thu, thu sâwm pêkte chu a ziak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Mosia chu thuhriattîrna lungphêk pahnih chu a kuta kengin Sinai tlâng ata chu a chhuk a, tlâng ata a chhuk chuan, Mosia chuan chutia an inbiakna avâng chuan a hmai vun chu a lo êng ta tih a hre hauh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Arona leh Israela thlah zawng zawngten Mosia an han hmuh chuan, ngai teh, a hmai vun chu a lo êng a, an rawn hnaih ngam lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Mosian anmahniho chu a han au va; tin, Arona leh pung khâwmho rorêltu zawng zawngte chu a hnênah an lo kîr leh a; tin, Mosian anniho chu a lo bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Israela thlahte zawng zawng chuan an rawn hnaih a; tichuan, Sinai tlânga Lalpa nêna an inbiakna zawng zawngte chu thu pein a lo hrilh chhâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Mosian anmahni chu a biak zawh chuan a hmai chu hmaikhuhnain a khuh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Mosia Lalpa be tûra a hmaa a luh hun apiang chuan, a lo chhuah leh hma loh chuan hmaikhuhna chu a hlîp ṭhîn a; tin, a lo chhuak leh ṭhîn a, a thupêkte chu Israela thlahte a hrilh chhâwng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Mosia hmai chu an han en a, Mosia hmai vun chu a lo êng ṭhîn a; tin, Mosia chu Pathian be tûra a luh leh hma chuan hmaikhuhna chuan a hmai a khuh leh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israela thlah pung khâwmho zawng zawngte chu a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “Hêng hi a nih hi Lalpan in tih tûra thu a pêk che u chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng hna thawh nân hman tûr a ni a, a ni sarih ni erawh chu in tân ni thianghlim, Lalpa tâna chawlh dêrna Chawlhni a ni tûr a ni: tu pawh chumi nia hna thawk apiang chu tihhlum tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chawlhni chuan in chênna hmun rêng rêngahte chuan mei in chhêm tûr a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israela thlahte pung khâwmho zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Hei hi a nih hi Lalpan thu a pêk che u chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘In zîng ata Lalpa tâna thilhlan tûr rawn la rawh u. Tu pawhin a thinlunga pêk châk apiang chuan Lalpa tân hlan tûr chu rawn la rawh se: rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />la dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te, lazai sîn te, kêl hmul te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, berâmpa vun chhum sen te, savun ṭha mi te, thingri thingte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, khâwnvâr atân hriak te, hriak thih mi atân leh hâl tûr rimtui tak atân englo rimtui nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, puithiam kawr leh kawr âwma zeh tûrin onukion lungte leh lunghlute nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, in zînga mi themthiam apiang chu lo kal sela, Lalpan siam tûra thu a pêk apiang chu siam rawh se:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />biak bûk te, a puan in te, a khuhna te, a chilh behna te, a ban rem khâwm te, a bangrel te, a ban te, a nghahchhan ker kuakte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />bâwm leh a zâwnfung te, zahngaihna ṭhutphah te, a daidanna tûr puanzâr te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />dawhkân leh a zâwnfung te leh a hmanrua zawng zawng te, chhangdah te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tin, êng atân khâwnvâr dahna te leh a hmanrua zawng zawng te, a khâwnvâr te, chhit ên atân hriak te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, rimtui hâlna maichâm leh a zâwnfung te, hriak thih mi te, hâl tûr rimtui tak te, biak bûk kawngkaa zâr tûr kawngka puanzâr te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hâlrala thilhlanna maichâm, a dâr lên leh a zâwnfungte leh a hmanrua zawng zawng te, maihûn leh a hûnchhan te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlaia puanzâr te, a ban te, a ban nghahchhan ker kuak te leh a hung chhûng kawngkaa puanzâr te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />biak bûk kilh behna te, a hung chhûng kawtlai kilh behna te, a hrui te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hmun thianghlima rawngbâwlna tûra silhfên mawi taka tah te, puithiam hna an thawh huna hâk tûr puithiam Arona silhfên thianghlim leh a fapate silhfênte,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlah pung khâwmho zawng zawngte chu Mosia hnên ata an ṭîn ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, mi tin thinlung taka phûr sârh apiang leh rilru taka phal apiang chu an lo kal a, inbiakna puan ina hman tûr leh, rawngbâwlna lam atâna thil hman ṭûl apiang leh, silhfên thianghlim tûr chu Lalpa tân an rawn thawh hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hmei a pain pêk châk apiangte chu an lo kal a, banbun te, bengbeh te, hming nemna zungbun te, ṭhi te, rangkachak incheina tinrêngte an rawn la a; mi tin rangkachak hlan tûr nei apiangin Lalpa tân an hlân ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mi tin la dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te, lazai sîn te, kêl hmul te, berâmpa vun chhum sen te, savun ṭha mi te nei apiangin an rawn keng hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi tin tangkarua leh dârte thawh apiangin Lalpa tâna thilhlan tûr an rawn keng a. Tin, mi tin thingri thing, hmanraw tinrêng atâna hman tlâk nei apiangin an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe themthiamho zawng zawngte chuan la an kai a, chûng an la kaih dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te, lazai sîn te chu an rawn keng hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe themthiam phûr sârhho zawng zawngte pawhin kêl hmul an kai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, puithiam kawr leh kawr âwma zeh tûrin rorêltuten onukion lungte leh lunghlute an rawn keng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tin, chhit ên atân te, hriak thih mi atân te, hâl tûr rimtui tak atân hriak leh rimtuite pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa hnênah duh thûa thilhlan an rawn hlân a; mi tin, a hmei a pa, Lalpan Mosia kuta thilsiam tûra thu a pêk zawng zawngte siamna tûra thinlunga châk taka kengtute chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israela thlahte hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh u, Lalpan Juda hnama mi Hura fapa Uria, chu mi fapa Bezalela chu a thlang tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chu mi chu finna te, hriat thiamna te, hriatna te, kawng tinrênga themthiamna te nei tûrin Pathian Thlarauvin a tikhat tawh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />thiltih tûr fing taka suangtuah thiamna te, rangkachak leh tangkarua leh dâr chher thiamna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />lunghlute zeh tûra phel thiamna te, thing zai mawi dân thiamna te, kawng tinrênga themthiamna te nei tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, amah nên, Dan hnama mi Ahisamaka fapa Oholiaba nên mite zirtîr theihna finna a pe ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Anni chu kawng tinrênga themthiamna te, englo ziak thiamna te, themthiamna te, la dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te, lazai sîn zeh mawi thiamna te, puan tah thiamna te, hnathawh tinrêng thiamna te, thiltih tûr fing taka suangtuah thiamna te nei tûrin thinlung finnain a tikhat tawh e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Bezalela leh Oholiaba leh mi themthiam tu pawh, Lalpan thu a pêk ang zêla hmun thianghlima rawngbâwlna hna tinrêng thawk thei tûra finna leh hriat thiamna a pêk apiangte chuan an bei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Bezalela leh Oholiaba leh mi themthiamho, Lalpan an thinlunga finna a pêka, chumi hna bei peih tûra thinlung taka phûr sârh apiang chu a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahten hmun thianghlima rawngbâwl nâna thilsiam tûra an rawn thawh zawng zawng chu Mosia hnên aṭangin an la zêl a. Tin, tûk tin duh thûa thilhlante chu a hnênah an rawn hlân zêl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, mi themthiamho zawng zawng, hmun thianghlim atâna hna tinrêng thawkte chuan an hnathawh lai chu an tlânsan ṭheuh va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosia hnênah, “ Lalpan siam tûra thu a pêk siam nân mite chuan a chuang a liamin thil an rawn la e,” tiin an thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan thu a pe a, “Hmun thianghlim atâna thil pêk tûr chu a hmei a pa, tu mahin rawn buatsaih tawh suh se,” tiin an riahhmunah chuan an tlângautîr ta a. Chutichuan, mite chuan an rawn lâk phal a ni ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An neih sa chu siam ṭûl apiang siamna tûr chuan a tâwk hle mai a, a tam lutuk mah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an zînga mi themthiam hnathawkho zawng zawngte chuan biak bûk chu puanzâr sâwm neiin an siam a; chûng puanzârte chu lazai sîn tak kawp te, dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te hmangin cherub lemte mi thiam tak siam chuantîrin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puanzâr chu a sei lam tawng sawmhnih leh tawng riat ṭheuh a ni a, puanzâr chu a hlai lam tawng li ṭheuh a ni; puanzâr zawng zawng chu a inchen vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr pangate chu a zawm vek a, puanzâr panga dangte pawh chu a zawm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr zawm khat hmâwrtawng ber tlângah chuan a beng a dumpâwlin a siam a; chutiang bawkin puanzâr zawm lehlam hmâwrtawng ber tlângah chuan a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puanzâr pakhatah chuan beng sawmnga a siam a, puanzâr zawm khat tlângah pawh chuan beng sawmnga a siam bawk a; chûng bengte chu a inep thliah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak chilh behna sawmnga a siam a, a chilh behnate chuan puanzârte chu a chilh bet a; tichuan, biak bûk chu pindan pakhat a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk chung khuh nân kêl hmul puanzârte a siam a; puanzâr sâwm leh pakhat a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Puanzâr chu a sei lam tawng sawmthum ṭheuh a ni a, puanzâr chu a hlai lam tawng li ṭheuh a ni; puanzâr sâwm leh pakhatte chu a inchen vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Puanzâr pangate chu a ṭhui zawm vek a, puanzâr paruk pawh chu a ṭhui zawm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr zawm khat hmâwrtawng ber tlângah chuan beng sawmnga a siam a, puanzâr zawm lehlam tlângah chuan beng sawmnga a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, puan in chu pindan pakhat a lo nih theih nân a chilh zawmna tûrin dâr chilh behna sawmnga a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, berâmpa vun chhum senin puan in chung khuhna te, savun ṭha miin a chunga khuh lehna te a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk ban rem khâwm tûrte chu ngîl taka dingin thingri thingin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ban rem khâwm sei lam chu tawng sâwm a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve ṭheuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ban rem khâwm tinah chuan ke pahnih inzawmin a awm a. Chutiang chuan biak bûk ban rem khâwm zawng zawng chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk atân chuan ban rem khâwmte a siam a, chhim chhawng chhim lampang atân chuan ban rem khâwm sawmhnih a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chumi ban rem khâwm sawmhnih nghahchhan atân chuan tangkaraw tlang ker kuak sawmli a siam a: a ke pahnih atân ban rem khâwm pakhat nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih leh, a ke pahnih atân ban rem khâwm dang pakhat nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk sîr lehlam hmâr chhawng lam atân chuan ban rem khâwm sawmhnih a siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tangkaraw tlang ker kuak sawmli nên: ban rem khâwm pakhat atân nghahchhan ker kuak pahnih a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk kawmchâr khawthlang chhawng lam atân chuan ban rem khâwm paruk a siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk kawmchâr kil ve ve atân chuan ban rem khâwm pahnih a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a hnuai lamah chuan thlawp a ni a, chutiang bawkin a chhîp lam khâng hmasa ber thlengin thlawp a ni. A kil pahnihah chuan chutiang chuan a ti ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ban rem khâwm pariat, a nghahchhan tûr tangkaraw tlang ker kuak sâwm leh paruk nên a awm a, ban rem khâwm tin innghah nân ker kuak pahnih zêl a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, thingri thingin bangrel: biak bûk bang lehlam ban rem khâwm atân panga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />biak bûk bang lehlam ban rem khâwm atân panga, biak bûk kawmchâr khawthlang chhawng lam ban rem khâwm atân pawh panga a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, bangrel laita, ban rem khâwm lai taka mi chu ban rem khâwm hmâwrtawng ber aṭangin, a lehlam hmâwrtawng ber thlenga thil tlang tûrin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ban rem khâwmte chu rangkachak tîin a luan a, bangrelte thil nân rangkachak khângte a siam a; tin, chûng bangrelte chu rangkachak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, puanzâr tûr chu lazai sîn tak kawp te, a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te hmangin cherub lemte mi thiam tak siam chuantîrin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, chumi atân chuan thingri ban pali a siam a, chûng chu rangkachak tîin a luan a, a bânnate chu rangkachak a ni; tin, chûng nghahchhan atân chuan tangkaraw tlang ker kuak pali a chhûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, puan in kawngkaa zâr tûr lazai sîn tak kawp te, a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lârte hmangin, puan zeh mawi thiam tak zeh nên a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tin, chumi zârna tûr ban panga, a bânnate nên a siam a. Tin, ban lubâwkte leh a zârfungte chu rangkachak tîin a luan a; mahse, chûng nghahchhan ker kuak pangate chu dâr a ni a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Bezalela chuan thingri thingin bâwm chu a siam a; a dung lam chu tawng hnih leh a chanve a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve a ni a, a sân lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chhûng leh a pâwn chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin a luan a, rangkachakin a tlâng a kâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chumi a ke palia vuah atân chuan rangkachak khâng pali a chhûng a: khâng pahnih chu a lehlam atân a ni a, khâng pahnih chu a lehlam atân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, thingri thingin zâwnfungte a siam a, chûng chu rangkachak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, bâwm chu zâwn theih tûrin a panga khângah chuan zâwnfungte chu a rawlh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak hlîr hlakin zahngaihna ṭhutphah a siam a; a dung lam chu tawng hnih leh a chanve a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, cherub pahnih rangkachakin a siam a; zahngaihna ṭhutphah hmâwr ve vea mi chu a chherin a chher a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a hmâwr lehlamah cherub pakhat, a hmâwr lehlamah cherub pakhat. Zahngaihna ṭhutphah nêna inbelhbawm hlâwm vekin a hmâwr ve vea cherub-te chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, cherub-te chuan zahngaihna ṭhutphah chu an thlaa hliapin an thlate chu an zâr duai a. Inhmatawnin, zahngaihna ṭhutphah lam chu cherub-te chuan an hawi ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, thingri thingin dâwhkân chu a siam a; a dung lam chu tawng hnih a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng khat a ni a, a sân lam chu tawng khat leh a chanve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chu chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin a luan a, rangkachakin a tlâng a kâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, kutphah bawka hlaiin a kâwm a siam a, chu chu rangkachakin a tlâng a kâwm leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, chumi atân chuan rangkachak khâng pali a chhûng a, chumi khâng chu dawhkân ke pali kil ṭheuhvah chuan a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dawhkân chu zâwna, a zâwnfung chu rawlh theih tûrin khângte chu a kâwm siin a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, dawhkân chu zâwn nân zâwnfungte chu thingri thingin a siam a, rangkachak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, dawhkâna bungbêl - thlêng te, no te, a bun chhuahna tûr berhbu te, uain thâwlte chu - rangkachak hlîr hlakin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khâwnvâr dahna chu rangkachak hlîr hlakin a siam a; chumi khâwnvâr dahna chu a ngul bul leh a ngul chu a chherin a chher a; a no te, a pârfung te, a pârte chu a inzawm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sîrahte chuan pêng paruk a lo pêng chhuak a: khâwnvâr dahna ngul sîr lehlamah chuan pêng pathum a awm a, khâwnvâr dahna ngul sîr lehlamah chuan pêng pathum a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lehlam pang pêngah chuan vaiumkhal kuhmûm ang no pathum, a pârfung leh a pâr a siam a; tin, a lehlam pang pêngah pawh vaiumkhal kuhmûm ang no pathum, a pârfung leh a pâr a siam a; chutiang chuan khâwnvâr dahna pêng paruk atân a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, khâwnvâr dahna ngulah chuan no pali, vaiumkhal kuhmûm anga siam, a pârfung leh a pârte a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi inzawm vek pêng pahnih hnuaiah chuan pârfung hmasa ber a awm a, chumi inzawm vek pêng pahnih hnuaiah chuan pârfung dang a awm a, chumi inzawm vek pêng pahnih hnuaiah chuan pârfung dang a awm leh bawk a; khâwnvâr dahna ngula pêng parukah chuan a awm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng a pârfungte leh a pêngte chuan a zawm vek a; a pum chuan rangkachak hlîr hlaka chher a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, chumi atân chuan khâwnvâr pasarih nên, chaichehte nên, meivâp dahnate nên rangkachak hlîr hlakin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi khâwnvâr dahna leh a hmanrua tûr zawng zawng siam nân chuan rangkachak hlîr hlak talent khat a hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, rimtui hâl nân thingri thingin maichâm a siam a. A dung lam chu tawng khat a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng khat a ni a, kil li a ni; tin, a sân lam chu tawng hnih a ni. A kîte nên chuan a inzawm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a chungte, a pang vêlte leh a kîte chu rangkachak hlîr hlak tîin a luan a; tin, rangkachakin a tlâng a kâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a kotlâng hnuai lamah, a sîr tuakah chuan rangkachak khâng pahnih a siam a; chûng chu a zâwnfung rawlhna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, thingri thing zâwnfungte a siam a, rangkachak tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hriak thih chi, hriak thianghlim leh englo rimtui tak hâl tûr rimtui fîm tak, rimtui siamtu siam angin a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thingri thingin hâlral thilhlan maichâm chu a siam a; a dung lam chu tawng nga a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng nga a ni a, kil li a ni; a sân lam chu tawng thum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kil li chhîpahte chuan a kîte a siam a; chûng kîte chu maichâm nên a inzawm vek a; dâr tîin a luan vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maichâm atâna hmanrua zawng zawng - bêl te, vutlawh te, maihûn te, sa thurna thîrkawm te, mei lâknate - a siam a; chûng hmanrua zawng zawngte chu dârin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maichâm dawhzâwl hnuai lamah a chanve thlengin dâr lên phan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zâwnfungte rawlh nân dâr lên hungna kil lia vuah tûr khâng pali a chhûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, zâwnfungte chu thingri thingin a siam a, dâr tîin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a zâwnna tûrin maichâm sîra khângahte chuan zâwnfungte chu a rawlh lût a; maichâm chu thing phela hungin a kawrawngin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dâr maihûn, a hûnchhan dâr nên, inbiakna puan in kawngka bula hmeichhe rawngbâwl ṭhînte dârthlalangin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlai a siam a; chhim chhawng chhim lampanga a hung chhûng kawtlaia puanzâr zâr tûr chu, la zai sîn tak kawpa siam tawng zaa sei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi atân chuan ban sawmhnih leh dâr tlang ker kuak sawmhnih a awm a; bana a bânnate leh a zârfungte chu tangkarua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmâr lampanga puanzâr zâr tûr chu tawng za a ni a, a bante chu sawmhnih leh dâr tlang ker kuak sawmhnih a ni a; bana a bânnate leh a zârfungte chu tangkarua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thlang lampanga puanzâr zâr tûrte chu tawng sawmnga a ni a, a bante chu sâwm a ni a, a nghahchhan ker kuak chu sâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhak chhawng chhak lampanga puanzâr zâr tûrte chu tawng sawmnga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kawngka sîr lehlama puanzâr zâr tûrte chu tawng sâwm leh tawng ngaa sei a ni a, a ban pathum leh a nghahchhan ker kuak pathum a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a sîr lehlam panga mi pawh chutiang bawk chu a ni; biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlai kawngka sîr lehlam lehlama puanzâr zâr tûrte chu tawng sâwm leh tawng nga a ni; a bante chu pathum a ni a, a nghahchhan ker kuakte pawh pathum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlai vêla puanzâr zâr tûr zawng zawngte chu la zai sîn tak kawp vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ban nghahchhan ker kuakte chu dâr a ni a, bana a bânnate leh a zârfungte chu tangkarua a ni a, a lubâwkte chu tangkaraw tîa luan a ni; tin, biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlai ban zawng zawng zârfungte chu tangkarua vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlai kawngkaa puanzâr zâr tûr chu puan zehmawi thiam taka zeh a ni a, la zai sîn tak kawp te, a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lârtea siam a ni. A sei lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a sân lam chu biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlai puanzâr zâr tûrte nêna induh chiah, tawng nga bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a bante chu pali a ni a, a nghahchhan ker kuakte chu pali a ni a, dâr vek a ni; a bânnate chu tangkarua a ni a, a lubâwkte leh a zârfungte chu tangkaraw tîa luan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Biak bûk leh a kawtlai hung chhûng kilh behna zawng zawngte chu dâr vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biak bûk, thuhriattîrna biak bûk atâna hmanrua, Mosia thupêk anga puithiam Arona fapa Ithamara hova Levia chiten an chhiarte chu hêngte hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda hnama mi Hura fapa Uria, chu mi fapa Bezalela chuan Lalpan Mosia hnêna siam tûra thu a pêk zawng zawng kha a siam vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hnênah chuan Dan hnama mi Ahisamaka fapa Oholiaba, englo ziak thiam, kut themthiam, la dumpâwl te, sen duk te, sen lâr te, la zai sîn tak te zehmawi thiamin a thawk ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmun thianghlim atâna hman ṭûl apianga rangkachak hman zawng zawng, rangkachak hlana chu talent sawmhnih leh pakua leh, hmun thianghlima sekel an pêk ṭhin anga chhiar chuan sekel zasarih leh sawmthum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, mipui chhiar tawhte zînga tel apiangte tangka pêk chu talent za leh, hmun thianghlima sekel an pêk ṭhin anga chhiar chuan, sekel sângkhat leh zasarih leh sawmsarih leh panga a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />kum sawmhnih achin chung lam chhiar tawhte zînga tel tûra kal, nuai ruk leh sângthum leh zanga leh sawmngate chu, hmun thianghlima sekel pêk ṭhin anga chhiar chuan, beka khat ṭheuh (chu chu sekel chanve a ni) pe ang an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, tangka talent za chu hmun thianghlim ban nghahchhan ker kuak leh, puan zârna ban nghahchhan ker kuak chhûn nân an hmang a; ban nghahchhan ker kuak za chhûn nân talent za an hmang a, ban nghahchhan pakhat chhûn nân talent khat zêl an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, sekel sângkhat leh zasarih leh sawmsarih leh panga chu hmangin bana bânnate a siam a, lubâwkte chu tangkaraw tîin a luan a, a zârfungte a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, an dâr hlante chu talent sawmsarih leh sekel sânghnih leh zali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, chûng chu inbiakna puan in kawngka ban nghahchhan ker kuakah te, dâr maichâmah te, a dâr lên leh maichâma hmanraw thil zawng zawngah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlai vêl ban nghahchhan ker kuakah te, biak bûk hung chhûng kawngka ban nghahchhan ker kuakah te, biak bûk chilh behna zawng zawngah te a siam vek a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, la dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te hmangin hmun thianghlima rawngbâwlna tûra silhfên mawi takte an siam a; Arona tân silhfên thianghlimte an siam bawk a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rangkachak zai te, la dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te, la zai sîn tak kawpte hmangin puithiam kawr chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rangkachak chu pan takin an chhu pêr a, la dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te, la zai sîn tak tea mi themthiam takin a zeh tûrin an zai thlûr seng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dârbak ṭhui belhbawmin an siam a; a hmâwr ve vea ṭhui belhbawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chumi kawr chunga kâwnghrên tûr themthiam taka tah chu, chumi kawr chi bawk tluan khat vek a ni a: rangkachak zai te, la dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te, la zai sîn tak kawptea tah a ni, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte hming ang zêlin, nemnaa ziak ang chuanna rangkachak zai phiara phûm onukion lungahte chuan an ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte hriat rengna lung atân puithiam kawr dârbakah chuan a bel a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, âwmbel chu puithiam kawr siam ang bawk mi thiam tak siam angin rangkachak zai te, la dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te, la zai sîn tak kawpte hmangin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu chu kil li nei a ni a, âwmbel chu an thuah a; a dung lam chu khâp a ni a, a vâng lam pawh khâp bawk a ni a, thuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan lunghlute tlar liin an zep a: tlar khatna chu saridon te, topazio te, smaragdon te a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tlar hnihna chu anthrax te, sappheiros te, sardonukion te a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tlar thumna chu huakinthos te, akates te, amethustos te a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tlar lina chu krusolithos te, berullion te, onukion te a ni a: rangkachak zai phiara phûm fel ṭhêt a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, lung chu sâwm leh pahnih, Israela thlahte hming ang zêlin a ni a: hming nemnaa chuang ang, hnam tin an hming ang zêlin, hnam sâwm leh hnam hnihte tân chuan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, âwmbel chungah chuan hruihrual ang khaidiatte, rangkachak hlîr hlak herh an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rangkachak zai phiar pahnih leh rangkachak khâng pahnih an siam bawk a; tichuan, âwmbel tlâng hmâwr ve veah chuan khângte chu an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak khaidiat herh pahnih chu âwmbel tlâng hmâwr ve vea khâng pahnihah chuan an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, khaidiat herh hmâwr lehlam pahnihte chu rangkachak zai phiar pahnihah chuan an zawm a, chu chu puithiam kawr hma lama dârbakah chuan an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak khâng pahnih an siam a, chûng chu âwmbel kil pahnih, puithiam kawr dep chhûng lampangah chuan an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rangkachak khâng pahnih dang an siam leh a, chûng chu a hma lama puithiam kawr dârbakna pahnih hnuai lampang, a inzawmna lai vêl, puithiam kawr hrênna themthiam taka tah chung lamah chuan an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, puithiam kawra khângahte chuan âwmbela khângte chu hrui dumpâwlin an chilh zawm a, themthiam taka tah puithiam kawr hrênna chung lama a awm theih nân leh, âwmbel chu puithiam kawr nên a inhran loh nân, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Puithiam kawrfual, a dumpâwl hlîr hlaka tah a siam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tin, kawrfual lai tak chu kawr bân bûl angin a tiâwng a, a âwng chu a thlêr chhiat theih mai lohna tûrin a tlâng vêl chu a chep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kawrfual fêmahte chuan pawmgranet lem - a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lâr te, la zai kawptein an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak hlîr hlak tengengte an siam a, chûng tengeng chu kawrfual fêmah a vêlin pawmgranet inkârahte chuan an dah a, pawmgranet inkâr zêlah an dah a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tengeng pakhat leh pawmgranet pakhat zêl kawrfual fêmah a vêlin rawngbâwlna tûra inthuam nân an dah a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Arona leh a fapate tân chuan la zai sîn taka tah kawrte an siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />la zai sîn taka siam puithiam lukhum te, la zai sîn taka siam diar ṭha tak te, la zai sîn tak kawpa siam la zai sîn kekawr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />la zai sîn tak kawp te, a dumpâwl te, a sen duk te, a sen lârte hmanga puan zehmawi thiam taka zeh kawnghrên te nên, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, lukhum thianghlim atâna rangkachak phêk chu rangkachak hlîr hlakin an siam a, a pangah chuan hming nemna a chuang ang, “ Lalpa PUAL” tih an chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lukhum chung lama bel tûrin hrui dumpâwlin an thlung a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, inbiakna puan in biak bûk hna zawng zawng chu an zo ta a. Tichuan, Lalpan ti tûra Mosia thu a pêk ang chiah zêlin Israela thlahte chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Mosia hnênah biak bûk an rawn kalpui a, puan in te, a hmanrua zawng zawng te: a chilh behna te, a ban rem khâwm te, a bangrel te, a ban te, a nghahchhan ker kuak te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />berâmpa vun chhum sena siam a khuhna te, savun ṭha mia siam a khuhna te, a daidanna tûr puanzâr te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />thuhriattîrna bâwm leh a zâwnfung te, zahngaihna ṭhutphah nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />dawhkân te, a hmanrua zawng zawng te, chhangdah te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />rangkachak hlîr hlaka siam khâwnvâr dahna te, a khâwnvâr, khâwnvâr dah tûr te, a hmanrua zawng zawng leh chhit ên atân a hriak nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />rangkachak maichâm te, hriak thih mi te, hâl tûr rimtui tak te, puan in kawngkaa zâr tûr puanzâr te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />dâr maichâm te, a dâr lên te, a zâwnfung te, a hmanrua zawng zawng te, maihûn leh a hûnchhan te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />biak bûk hung chhûng kawtlaia puanzâr te, a ban te, a ban nghahchhan ker kuak te, a hung chhûng kawngkaa puanzâr te, a hrui te, a kilh behna te, inbiakna puan in biak bûk chhûnga a hmanraw thil zawng zawng nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />hmun thianghlima rawngbâwlna tûra silhfên mawi taka tah te, puithiam Arona leh a fapaten puithiam hna an thawh huna an hâk tûr silhfên thianghlimte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lalpan ti tûra Mosia thu a pêk ang zawng zawng chu Israela thlahte chuan an ti vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Mosian chûng hnathawh zawng zawng chu a han en a, ngai teh, an lo zo vek tawh a; Lalpa thupêk ang takin an zo vek a ni. Tichuan, Mosian anni chu mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A thla khatna ni khat nîah chuan inbiakna puan in biak bûk chu i din tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A chhûngah chuan thuhriattîrna bâwm i dah tûr a ni a, bâwm chu puanzârin i daidang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dawhkân kha la lûtin, a chunga thil awmte chu i dah fel tûr a ni; khâwnvâr dahna kha la lûtin, a khâwnvârte chu i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rimtui hâlna rangkachak maichâm kha thuhriattîrna bâwm hmaa dahin, biak bûk kawngka puanzâr kha i zâr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hâlrala thilhlanna maichâm kha inbiakna puan in biak bûk kawngka bulah i hûng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, inbiakna puan in leh maichâm inkârah chuan maihûn hûngin, chutah chuan tui i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk vêl chuan a hung chhûng kawtlai siamin, a hung chhûng kawtlai kawngka puanzâr chu i zâr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, hriak thih mi lain, biak bûk leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte chu hnawihin, i tithianghlim tûr a ni, a bungbêl zawng zawngte nên; tichuan, a lo thianghlim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, hâlrala thilhlanna maichâm leh a hmanrua zawng zawngte chu hriak hnawihin, maichâm chu i tithianghlim tûr a ni; tichuan, maichâm chu thianghlim tak a lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, maihûn leh a hûnchhan chu hriak hnawihin i tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Arona leh a fapate chu inbiakna puan in kawngka bula rawn hruaiin tuiin i sil tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Arona chu silhfên thianghlimte chu i sintîr tûr a ni; tichuan, puithiam hna thawka ka tân rawng a bâwl theihna tûra hriak thihin, i tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a fapate pawh rawn hruaiin kawr i haktîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Puithiam hna thawka ka tân rawng an bâwl theihna tûrin, an pa hriak i thih ang khân anmahni chu hriak i thih tûr a ni; hriak thiha an awm hi, an thlahte thleng pawha kumkhuaa puithiam tûra ruat an ni reng tawh ang tih, an tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Mosian a ti a; Lalpan tih tûra a pêk ang zawng zawng chuan a ti vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a kum hnihna thla tîr ber, chumi thla ni khat ni tak chuan biak bûk chu an din ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan biak bûk chu a han din a, a nghahchhan ker kuakte a han rem a, a ban rem khâwmte chu a han din a, a bangrelte chu a han rawlh a, a bante chu a han tung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk chungah chuan puan in a zâr a, chumi puan in chung chu a khuhnain a khuh leh a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuhriattîrna chu a la a, bâwm chhûngah a dah a, bâwmah chuan a zâwnfungte a rawlh a, bâwm chungah chuan zahngaihna ṭhutphah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, bâwm chu biak bûk chhûngah chuan a dah a, a daidanna puanzâr chu a zâr a, thuhriattîrna bâwm chu a daidang ta a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dawhkân chu inbiakna puan in chhûng, biak bûk hmar lampang, puanzâr pâwn lamah chuan a hûng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />dawhkânah chuan Lalpa hmaah chhang chu a dah fel diam a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khâwnvâr dahna chu inbiakna puan in chhûng biak bûk chhim lampang dawhkân epah chuan a dah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tin, khâwnvârte chu Lalpa hmaah chuan a dah a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Rangkachak maichâm chu inbiakna puan in chhûng puanzâr hmaah chuan a dah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tin, a chungah chuan englo rimtui tak hâl tûr rimtui a hâl a; Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Biak bûk kawngka puanzâr a zâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, inbiakna puan in biak bûk kawngka bulah chuan hâlrala thilhlanna maichâm a hûng a, a chungah chuan hâlral thilhlan leh ei tûr thilhlan a hlân a, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, maihûn chu inbiakna puan in leh maichâm inkârah chuan a hûng a, insilna tûrin tui a chhûng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tin, Mosia leh Arona leh a fapate chuan chutah chuan an kut leh an kete an sil a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Inbiakna puan ina an luh dâwn leh maichâm bula an kal dâwnin an insil a ni, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk leh maichâm vêl chuan hung chhûng kawtlai chu a siam a, a hung chhûng kawtlai kawngka puanzâr chu a zâr a. Chutichuan, Mosia chuan hna chu a zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, inbiakna puan in chu chhûmin a rawn tuam ta mup a, biak bûk chu Lalpa ropuinain a lo khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, chutia chhûm a lo zîn tâk mupa, Lalpa ropuinaa biak bûk chu a lo khah tâk avângin, Mosia chu inbiakna puan in chhûngah chuan a lût thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, chhûm chuan biak bûk chu a kian chhohsan veleh Israela thlahte chu an insawn zêl a, an kalna tûr lama a kal chhûng zawng chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chhûm chuan a kian chhohsan loh erawh chuan a kian chhohsan hma loh zawng insawn lovin an awm reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chhûnah chuan Lalpa chhûm chu biak bûk chungah a zîng a, chutah chuan zânah mei a lo awm ṭhîn a, Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan an kalna tûr lama an kal chhûng zawng chuan chu chu an hmu zêl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
